is_a: HP:0040195 ! Decreased head circumference

[Term]
id: HP:0000478
name: Abnormality of the eye
def: "Any abnormality of the eye, including location, spacing, and intraocular abnormalities." []
synonym: "Eye disease" RELATED layperson []
is_a: HP:0000118 ! Phenotypic abnormality

[Term]
id: HP:0000504
name: Abnormality of vision
def: "Abnormality of eyesight (visual perception)." []
is_a: HP:0012373 ! Abnormal eye physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0000505
name: Visual impairment
def: "Visual impairment (or vision impairment) is vision loss (of a person) to such a degree as to qualify as an additional support need through a significant limitation of visual capability resulting from either disease, trauma, or congenital or degenerative conditions that cannot be corrected by conventional means, such as refractive correction, medication, or surgery." []
is_a: HP:0000504 ! Abnormality of vision

[Term]
id: HP:0000539
name: Abnormality of refraction
def: "An abnormality in the process of focusing of light by the eye in order to produce a sharp image on the retina." []
is_a: HP:0012373 ! Abnormal eye physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0000545
name: Myopia
def: "An abnormality of refraction characterized by the ability to see objects nearby clearly, while objects in the distance appear blurry." []
is_a: HP:0000539 ! Abnormality of refraction

[Term]
id: HP:0000707
name: Abnormality of the nervous system
def: "An abnormality of the nervous system." []
is_a: HP:0000118 ! Phenotypic abnormality

[Term]
id: HP:0000708
name: Atypical behavior
def: "Atypical behavior is an abnormality in a person's actions that can be controlled or modulated by the will of the individual. While abnormal behaviors can be difficult to control, they are distinct from other abnormal actions that cannot be affected by the individual's will." []
is_a: HP:0011446 ! Abnormality of mental function

[Term]
id: HP:0000716
name: Depression
def: "Frequently experiencing feelings of being down, miserable, and/or hopeless; struggling to recover from these moods; having a pessimistic outlook on the future; feeling a pervasive sense of shame; having a low self-worth; experiencing thoughts of suicide and engaging in suicidal behavior." []
synonym: "Depressive disorder" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0000745 ! Abnormal diminished volition
is_a: HP:0100851 ! Abnormal emotional state

[Term]
id: HP:0000745
name: Abnormal diminished volition
def: "A reduction in willful and motivated goal-directed behavior that is considered the determinant of behavior and adaptation that allows individuals to get started, be energized to perform a sustained and directed action." []
is_a: HP:0025780 ! Abnormal volitional state

[Term]
id: HP:0000855
name: Insulin resistance
def: "Increased resistance towards insulin, that is, diminished effectiveness of insulin in reducing blood glucose levels." []
is_a: HP:0011014 ! Abnormal glucose homeostasis

[Term]
id: HP:0000924
name: Abnormality of the skeletal system
def: "An abnormality of the skeletal system." []
is_a: HP:0033127 ! Abnormality of the musculoskeletal system

[Term]
id: HP:0000925
name: Abnormality of the vertebral column
