[Term]
id: HP:0001952
name: Glucose intolerance
def: "Glucose intolerance (GI) can be defined as dysglycemia that comprises both prediabetes and diabetes. It includes the conditions of impaired fasting glucose (IFG) and impaired glucose tolerance (IGT) and diabetes mellitus (DM)." []
is_a: HP:0011014 ! Abnormal glucose homeostasis

[Term]
id: HP:0001977
name: Abnormal thrombosis
