[Term]
id: MONDO:0002331
name: nephrosis
def: "Pathological processes of the KIDNEY without inflammatory or neoplastic components. Nephrosis may be a primary disorder or secondary complication of other diseases. It is characterized by the NEPHROTIC SYNDROME indicating the presence of PROTEINURIA and HYPOALBUMINEMIA with accompanying EDEMA." []
is_a: MONDO:0005240 ! kidney disorder

[Term]
id: MONDO:0002334
