is_a: MONDO:0021040 ! pancreatic neoplasm

[Term]
id: MONDO:0010030
name: Sjogren syndrome
def: "An autoimmune disorder in which immune cells attack and destroy the glands that produce tears and saliva. Sjögren syndrome is also associated with rheumatic disorders such as rheumatoid arthritis or systemic lupus erythematosus. The hallmark symptoms of Sjögren syndrome are dry mouth and dry eyes. In addition, Sjogren syndrome may cause skin, nose, and vaginal dryness. It also may affect other organs of the body including the kidneys, blood vessels, lungs, liver, pancreas, and brain" []
is_a: MONDO:0000586 ! autoimmune disorder of exocrine system
is_a: MONDO:0001142 ! salivary gland disorder
is_a: MONDO:0002254 ! syndromic disease
is_a: MONDO:0024625 ! disorder of lacrimal gland

