[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000035
name: obsolete Centre National de Génotypage
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-22. The Centre National de Génotypage is a French genotyping and sequencing centre, not a participant cohort. Its only hit in an EBI database is a text match of the acronym CNG to EGA study EGAS00001001825 (Institut Curie - CNG neuroblastoma whole-genome sequencing), which the human EGA review marked incorrect, and the GWAS Catalog has no CNG cohort tag. No cohort was identified for the term to be replaced by.
synonym: "CNG" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
is_obsolete: true

