[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000073
name: Gabriel Advanced Survey
def: "A multi-phase, stratified, cross-sectional population-based survey of school-aged children in rural regions of southern Germany, Austria and Switzerland and in Poland, run from 2006 within the EU-funded GABRIEL project: a screening questionnaire (phase I), a stratified random subsample with detailed farm-exposure questionnaires and blood, genetic and environmental samples (phase II), and in Bavaria an in-depth respiratory and environmental assessment (phase III), to determine the factors in farming environments that protect against asthma and atopic disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34155719", IAO:0000119="PMID:22534534", IAO:0000119="PMID:21819425", IAO:0000119="PMID:23621318"}
