name: obsolete National Health Service Blood and Transplant
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-25. NHS Blood and Transplant is the special health authority through which the INTERVAL trial recruited its blood donors, not a cohort: the GWAS Catalog tags the study recorded under this term (GCST90243401) with INTERVAL, and its EGA study (EGAS00001000825) is INTERVAL's exome sequencing. Found when the sweep of the cached papers for sub-cohort links was checked (src/curation/link_sweep_2026-09-25.csv). See INTERVAL study (COHO:0000184).
is_obsolete: true
consider: coho:COHO_0000184

