[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000127
name: Gastroparesis Clinical Research Consortium cohort
def: "A cohort of patients with gastroparesis recruited through the Gastroparesis Clinical Research Consortium (GpCRC), a network of gastrointestinal tertiary centres in the United States sponsored by the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases (NIDDK), whose registry provided the gastroparesis cases of the GWAS Catalog study tagged NIDDK." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37688361"}
