relationship: coho:hasCohort coho:COHO_0000100 {xref="https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001002169", comment="MeDALL epigenetics study includes illumina 450k methylation measurements from 4 cohorts: Infancia y Medio Ambiente (INMA)"}
