id: coho:COHO_0000300
name: obsolete Milan cohort
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. The Milan cohort of EGAS00001004390 (Subtype specific studies of breast cancer progression. Milan cohort.) is not a named cohort: the study’s paper (PMC7299965) calls it the third of three tissue cohorts, “Milan”, unpublished before, with fresh frozen tissue from 34 breast tumours, and gives it no name beyond the city. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

