[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000344
name: Type 2 Diabetes Genetic Exploration by Next-generation sequencing in multi-Ethnic Samples
def: "A consortium of United States and United Kingdom groups that sequenced the exomes of 6,546 type 2 diabetes cases and 6,457 controls of African American, East Asian, South Asian, Hispanic and European ancestry, drawn from member cohorts, to assess common, low-frequency and rare variants in diabetes risk." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001001460"}
subset: coho1:EGA_subset
