id: coho:COHO_0000371
name: Million Veteran Program
def: "An observational cohort and mega-biobank of veterans enrolled since 2011 at recruiting sites of the Department of Veterans Affairs health care system in the United States, combining questionnaires, electronic health records and blood samples for genomic testing to study genetic influences on health and disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26441289"}
