[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000380
name: Canadian Longitudinal Study on Aging
def: "A national stratified cohort of 51,338 women and men aged 45–85 years recruited in 2011–2015 from all 10 Canadian provinces, comprising a telephone-interviewed Tracking cohort and an in-person Comprehensive cohort providing physical assessments and blood and urine samples, assembled as a longitudinal research platform for studying health and aging." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31633757"}
