[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000384
name: Cardiovascular Health Study
def: "A population-based longitudinal cohort of men and women aged 65 years and older sampled from Medicare eligibility lists in four US communities (Forsyth County, North Carolina; Sacramento County, California; Washington County, Maryland; Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania) from 1989, with mostly Black participants added in 1992–1993, to identify factors related to the onset and course of coronary heart disease and stroke in older adults." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:1669507", IAO:0000119="PMID:36314488"}
