[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000389
name: Busselton Health Study
def: "A community-based longitudinal cohort of residents of the town and Shire of Busselton in south-western Western Australia, surveyed since 1966 and including related and unrelated individuals of predominantly European ancestry, whose 1994/95 follow-up provided blood samples for genetic studies of cardiovascular, respiratory and metabolic traits." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35668104", IAO:0000119="PMID:24099269"}
