[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000390
name: Swedish Infrastructure for Medical Population-Based Life-Course and Environmental Research
def: "A Swedish research infrastructure combining two large ongoing population-based cohorts, the Cohort of Swedish Men and the Swedish Mammography Cohort, whose randomly selected subsamples from Västmanland and Uppsala were clinically examined with genotyping and biosampling for life-course studies of health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12987725/fullTextXML"}
