id: coho:COHO_0000393
name: Metabolic Syndrome in Men Study
def: "A population-based cohort of 10,197 middle-aged and older Finnish men from a single site in north-eastern Finland, examined in 2005–2010 with detailed metabolic phenotyping, oral glucose tolerance tests, metabolomics and extensive genotyping and sequencing, and followed up to study nongenetic and genetic risk factors for type 2 diabetes and cardiovascular disease." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:35347128", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28119442"}
