[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000395
name: Trøndelag Health Study
def: "A population-based cohort of the adult population of Trøndelag County, Norway, in which all residents of Nord-Trøndelag aged 20 or over have been invited to repeated surveys since 1984–86, extended to Sør-Trøndelag in 2017–19, collecting questionnaires, interviews, clinical examinations, laboratory measurements and biological samples on a broad range of health topics." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:35578897", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
