[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000404
name: NIHR BioResource Rare Diseases Study
def: "A cohort of patients with rare diseases or extreme measurements of quantitative traits, their affected relatives and controls, enrolled mainly at National Health Service hospitals in the United Kingdom between 2012 and 2017 under the coordination of the NIHR BioResource at the University of Cambridge, whose whole genomes were sequenced to provide genetic diagnoses and discover aetiological variants within routine healthcare." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32581362"}
