def: "A population-based cohort of 3,596 randomly selected Finnish children and adolescents aged 3–18 years at baseline in 1980, followed into adulthood for over three decades to study how cardiovascular risk factors in childhood relate to preclinical markers of cardiovascular disease in adulthood." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38115890"}
