[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000423
name: All of Us Research Program
def: "A national research cohort led by the National Institutes of Health that aims to enrol at least one million diverse adults in the United States, most from groups historically under-represented in biomedical research, through more than 340 recruitment sites, collecting health questionnaires, electronic health records, physical measurements, digital health data and biospecimens to advance precision medicine." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31412182"}
