[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000428
name: deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort
def: "A population sample of Icelanders recruited through the disease-specific and general-population research projects of deCODE genetics in Reykjavik, Iceland, including the deCODE Health Study, whose chip genotypes and whole-genome sequences, combined with the nationwide Icelandic genealogy, are used for genome-wide association studies of diseases and other traits." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:28596592", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37294764"}
