[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000429
name: PainOMICS Retrospective Study
def: "A retrospective, multicentre case–control study of adults of Caucasian ancestry with chronic low back pain and controls without chronic pain, run within the European Union FP7-funded PainOMICS project (ClinicalTrials.gov NCT02037789), which enrolled 3,400 participants between September 2014 and February 2016 at clinical centres in Italy, Belgium, the United Kingdom and Croatia (the registered protocol also listed sites in the United States and Australia), collecting clinical data and blood samples for genome-wide association, glycomics and activomics analyses of chronic low back pain." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27798002", IAO:0000119="PMID:37293449", IAO:0000119="PMID:28459826", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12218978/supplementaryFiles", IAO:0000119="https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT02037789"}
