[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000430
name: The Pomak cohort
def: "A population-based cohort of adults from the Pomak villages of the regional unit of Xanthi, a set of religiously isolated mountainous villages of the Muslim Pomak minority in northern Greece, 1,702 of whom were recruited as volunteers through the local health centre in Echinos between July 2010 and March 2013 within the Hellenic Isolated Cohorts (HELIC) study, with interview-based questionnaires, anthropometric, haematological and biochemical measurements and blood samples for DNA that were genotyped and whole-genome sequenced, to study the genetics of cardiometabolic and other medically relevant complex traits in an isolated population." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31847144", IAO:0000119="PMID:25373335", IAO:0000119="PMID:34857772"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
synonym: "HELIC-Pomak" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Pomak" RELATED []
