id: coho:COHO_0000432
name: Correlated Expression and Disease Association Research
def: "A cohort of about 320 healthy adult Europeans visiting the Academic Hospital of the University of Liège, Belgium, as part of a national colon-cancer screening campaign, from whom peripheral blood and intestinal biopsies were collected to generate transcriptomes of circulating immune cell types and gut tissues for expression quantitative trait locus analysis of inflammatory bowel disease risk loci." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:29930244", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
