id: coho:COHO_0000437
name: GeneRISK study
def: "A prospective cohort of about 7,300 adults aged 45-66 recruited in southern Finland in 2015-2017 (from the Kymenlaakso population register, occupational health care customers in Helsinki and Turku, and blood donors) to assess the impact of communicating genetic risk information for cardiovascular disease to participants." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35130028", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10618167/fullTextXML"}
