id: coho:COHO_0000441
name: Health, Aging and Body Composition Study
def: "A prospective cohort of 3,075 community-dwelling Black and white adults aged 70-79, recruited from 1997 from white Medicare beneficiaries and all eligible Black residents in and around Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania and Memphis, Tennessee, and followed for about 17 years to study body composition, functional decline and disease in older age." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40044514", IAO:0000119="https://healthabc.nia.nih.gov/", IAO:0000119="PMID:32396194"}
