[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000447
name: 500 Functional Genomics
def: "A cohort of about 500 healthy adult volunteers of Western European ancestry recruited at Radboud University Medical Center in Nijmegen, the Netherlands, in 2013–2014 within the Human Functional Genomics Project, to study how genetic, environmental, host and microbiome factors shape individual cytokine and immune responses." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://humanfunctionalgenomics.org/projects/500fg/", IAO:0000119="PMID:27814508"}
