id: coho:COHO_0000454
name: Qatar Metabolomics Study on Diabetes
def: "A cross-sectional case–control study of 374 people with and without type 2 diabetes, of Arab and Asian descent, enrolled in February–June 2012 at the Dermatology Department of Hamad Medical Corporation in Doha, Qatar, with metabolomic profiling of saliva, blood plasma and urine to study metabolic dysregulation in diabetes." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26049400", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
