[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000458
name: Epidemiological Investigation of Rheumatoid Arthritis
def: "A population-based case-control study established in Sweden in 1996, enrolling incident rheumatoid arthritis cases (now more than 5000) from the middle and southern regions of Sweden together with population controls, used to study genetic risk factors for rheumatoid arthritis and its ACPA-defined subsets and environmental factors such as cigarette smoking." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:37326842", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21156761", IAO:0000119="PMID:12922955"}
