[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000468
name: deCODE Health Study
def: "A general-population sample of Icelanders, enriched for carriers of rare and potentially high-impact mutations, comprehensively phenotyped by deCODE genetics in Iceland (e.g. audiometry, speech recordings, DXA body composition, plasma proteomics) and combined with the Icelandic genotype and sequence data for genetic association studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33982893", IAO:0000119="PMID:34108613", IAO:0000119="PMID:37294764"}
