relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Qatar {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A26635005+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="Qatar Biobank will provide a powerful resource to investigate the major determinants of ill-health and well-being in Qatar, providing valuable insights into the current and future public health burden that faces the country."}
