[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000470
name: Reykjavik Study
def: "A population-based cohort of men born 1907–1934 and women born 1908–1935, randomly selected from residents of the Reykjavik area, examined at the Heart Preventive Clinic in Reykjavik from 1967 and followed since in Iceland by the Icelandic Heart Association, to study cardiovascular disease and its risk factors." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19438929", IAO:0000119="PMID:17351290", IAO:0000119="PMID:20736269"}
