id: coho:COHO_0000473
name: Research Program on Genes, Environment and Health
def: "A research resource developed by the Kaiser Permanente Northern California Division of Research from consenting members of the KPNC health plan, linking surveys, biospecimens and electronic health records and including the Genetic Epidemiology Research on Adult Health and Aging cohort and a pregnancy cohort, for research on the genetic and environmental determinants of common, age-related complex health conditions." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13340790/fullTextXML", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7939422/fullTextXML"}
