[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000487
name: Leipzig Research Center for Civilization Diseases-Heart Study
def: "A hospital-based cohort of patients with suspected stable coronary artery disease, acute myocardial infarction or known left main coronary artery disease undergoing coronary angiography at the Heart Center Leipzig, Germany, recruited from December 2006 by Leipzig University and its Leipzig Research Center for Civilization Diseases (LIFE) as a biobank and database for studying clinical, metabolic, cellular and genetic factors of atherosclerosis and coronary artery disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22216169", IAO:0000119="PMID:34822396"}
