[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000490
name: Danish Twin Registry
def: "A nationwide population-based register of more than 175,000 Danish twins from birth cohorts 1870 to 2009, established in the 1950s, that combines repeated surveys, in-person assessments, a biobank and linkage to Danish national registers, for studies of genetic and environmental influences on health, disease and ageing." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23084092", IAO:0000119="PMID:31544734"}
