[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000491
name: Electronic Medical Records and Genomics Network
def: "A National Human Genome Research Institute-funded consortium, established in 2007, of US academic and integrated health systems, each with its own biorepository linking DNA samples to electronic medical records, which pooled its sites' data into a network-wide genome-wide dataset of about 105,000 participants for genomic discovery and later sequenced about 25,000 participants to study the return of genomic results." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23743551", IAO:0000119="PMID:35047833"}
