id: coho:COHO_0000493
name: Dose-Responses to Exercise Training
def: "A four-year randomised controlled trial of resistance and aerobic exercise and dietary interventions in a population-based random sample of men and women aged 55-74 years living in Kuopio, Finland, drawn from the national population registry, of whom 1,479 attended baseline examinations in 2005-2006, to study the health effects of regular physical exercise and a healthy diet in middle-aged and older people." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8244125/fullTextXML"}
