[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000495
name: Study of Women's Health Across the Nation
def: "A multi-site, multiethnic, community-based longitudinal cohort of 3,302 women aged 42–52 enrolled in 1996–1997 at seven US sites (Boston, Chicago, Detroit, Los Angeles, Pittsburgh, Oakland and Newark) and followed about yearly to study how women's physical, biological, psychological and social health in midlife affects health during ageing." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13153493/fullTextXML", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
