[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000500
name: Older Australian Twins Study
def: "A longitudinal study of Australian twins aged 65 years and over, with some of their equivalently aged siblings, recruited through the Australian Twin Registry and a recruitment drive and assessed every two years with psychiatric, neuropsychological, cardiovascular, metabolic, neuroimaging and genetic measures, to study genetic and environmental influences on healthy brain ageing and ageing-related neurocognitive disorders." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:27030319", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19943720"}
