[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000501
name: LymeProspect
def: "A prospective observational cohort of adults with proven or probable Lyme borreliosis in the Netherlands, included at the start of antibiotic treatment from 2015 and followed for one year with questionnaires and repeated blood sampling, run by RIVM with the Lyme borreliosis expert centres of Amsterdam UMC and Radboudumc to study the prevalence and determinants of persistent symptoms after treatment." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:30987580", IAO:0000119="PMID:38714679", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
