[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000502
name: 300-Tanzania-FG
def: "A cross-sectional cohort of 323 healthy adults aged 18-65 living in the Kilimanjaro region of northern Tanzania, enrolled within the Human Functional Genomics Project by Radboudumc and Tanzanian partners, with ex vivo cytokine stimulations at the Kilimanjaro Clinical Research Institute in Moshi, to study genetic and environmental determinants of immune responses in an African population." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:37555575", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:41858114"}
