id: coho:COHO_0000503
name: UCLA ATLAS Community Health Initiative
def: "An ancestrally diverse biobank embedded in the UCLA Health medical system in Los Angeles County, run by the UCLA Institute for Precision Health, that links genomic data from blood samples of consenting UCLA Health patients (36,736 genotyped in 2022) to their de-identified electronic health records, for genetic and precision-health research." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36085083", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9461263/fullTextXML"}
