id: coho:COHO_0000505
name: WHI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network
def: "A nested case-control genome-wide association sub-study of the Women's Health Initiative hormone therapy trials, comprising the coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thromboembolism and selected diabetes cases that arose during the active intervention phase and age-matched controls, genotyped under the NHGRI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network (GARNET)." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5714283/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41398-025-03418-z/MediaObjects/41398_2025_3418_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
