[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000507
name: Brain Imaging Genetics study
def: "A pool of self-reported healthy volunteers, many of them university students, who took part in diverse imaging studies at the Donders Centre for Cognitive Neuroimaging in Nijmegen, the Netherlands, and consented to pooling of their anatomical MRI scans with DNA for imaging genetics; established in 2007 and now part of the Cognomics initiative." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25013396", IAO:0000119="PMID:24734025"}
