id: coho:COHO_0000513
name: Long Life Family Study
def: "A longitudinal, multicentre, multinational family study of 4,953 members of 539 two-generation families selected for exceptional familial longevity, recruited in 2006-2009 through field centres in Boston, New York and Pittsburgh in the United States and in Denmark and re-examined in 2014-2017, to study the genetic and non-genetic determinants of exceptional longevity and healthy ageing." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:34739053", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
