id: coho:COHO_0000514
name: Genetic Epidemiology of COPD
def: "A multicentre observational cohort of about 10,000 non-Hispanic white and African American current and former smokers with and without COPD, aged 45-80, enrolled at 21 clinical centres across the United States and followed longitudinally with chest CT imaging and genome-wide genotyping to identify genetic factors and CT-defined subtypes of COPD." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37241208", IAO:0000119="PMID:20214461"}
