[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000525
name: ADDITION-PRO Study
def: "A population-based longitudinal cohort of 2,082 Danish adults at different levels of diabetes risk, sampled from the 16,136 high-risk individuals identified by the 2001–2006 stepwise diabetes screening programme in Danish general practice of the Danish arm of ADDITION-Europe, examined in 2009–2011 with detailed cardiometabolic phenotyping and followed for cardiovascular disease and death." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23241242", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
synonym: "ADDITION-PRO" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
