[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000529
name: obsolete Korea Association Resource
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-23. KARE, the Korea Association Resource, is another name for the KoGES Ansan and Ansung Study (COHO:0000530), not a separate cohort or a genotyped sub-cohort of it: the KoGES profile calls the study's genome-wide data KARE, the papers tagged KARE describe the KARE cohort as the Ansan and Anseong cohort, and the KARE, Ansan and Ansung tags all denote that one cohort (src/curation/catalog_cohorts_tier_b_check.csv). Replaced by COHO:0000530, which carries the acronym KARE and the KARE names.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000530

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000530
name: Ansan and Ansung Study
