[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000532
name: Chronic Kidney Disease Genetics Consortium
def: "An international collaborative consortium, co-directed by Anna Köttgen and Cristian Pattaro with its data hosted at the University of Freiburg, that meta-analyses genome-wide association results from many, mostly population-based, studies to investigate the genetic basis of kidney function and disease, releasing summary statistics for markers such as estimated glomerular filtration rate and blood urea nitrogen." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8285412/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://ckdgen.imbi.uni-freiburg.de/"}
