[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000533
name: Tohoku Medical Megabank Project
def: "A Japanese genome cohort project launched after the 2011 Great East Japan Earthquake and run by the Tohoku Medical Megabank Organization of Tohoku University and the Iwate Tohoku Medical Megabank Organization of Iwate Medical University, comprising two prospective cohorts in Miyagi and Iwate Prefectures, the TMM Community-Based Cohort Study of adults and the TMM Birth and Three-Generation Cohort Study, with an integrated biobank of health information, biospecimens and genome and omics data." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27374138"}
