relationship: coho:hasCohort coho:COHO_0000938 {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7738642/fullTextXML", comment="To overcome the above-mentioned issues, we established the Tohoku Medical Megabank (TMM) Project, which is conducted by Tohoku University Tohoku Medical Megabank Organization (ToMMo) and Iwate Medical University Iwate Tohoku Medical Megabank Organization (IMM).9 We decided to conduct the TMM Project in Miyagi and Iwate Prefectures and started two prospective cohort studies in Miyagi and Iwate Prefectures: a population-based adult cohort study, the TMM Community-Based Cohort Study (TMM CommCohort Study), which recruited more than 80,000 participants, and a birth and three-generation cohort study, the TMM Birth and Three-Generation Cohort Study (TMM BirThree Cohort Study), which recruited more than 70,000 participants, including fetuses and their parents, siblings, grandparents, and extended family members.10"}
relationship: coho:hasCohort coho:COHO_0000939 {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7738642/fullTextXML", comment="To overcome the above-mentioned issues, we established the Tohoku Medical Megabank (TMM) Project, which is conducted by Tohoku University Tohoku Medical Megabank Organization (ToMMo) and Iwate Medical University Iwate Tohoku Medical Megabank Organization (IMM).9 We decided to conduct the TMM Project in Miyagi and Iwate Prefectures and started two prospective cohort studies in Miyagi and Iwate Prefectures: a population-based adult cohort study, the TMM Community-Based Cohort Study (TMM CommCohort Study), which recruited more than 80,000 participants, and a birth and three-generation cohort study, the TMM Birth and Three-Generation Cohort Study (TMM BirThree Cohort Study), which recruited more than 70,000 participants, including fetuses and their parents, siblings, grandparents, and extended family members.10"}
