[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000534
name: Fred Hutchinson Prostate Cancer Study
def: "A prostate cancer study run at the Fred Hutchinson Cancer Center that comprises two population-based case-control studies in King County, Washington, whose cases, identified through the Seattle-Puget Sound SEER cancer registry, were men aged 40–64 diagnosed in 1993–1996 and men aged 35–74 diagnosed in 2002–2005, and whose controls without prostate cancer were found by random-digit dialling and frequency-matched to cases by age; its genotyped samples contribute to the PRACTICAL consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28145099", IAO:0000119="PMID:17700570", IAO:0000119="PMID:37555839"}
