[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000535
name: Whole Genome Association Analysis of Hematopoietic Cell Transplant (HCT) Outcomes
def: "A retrospective cohort of patients with a haematological malignancy or myelodysplastic syndrome who had a first allogeneic haematopoietic cell transplant at the Fred Hutchinson Cancer Research Center and Seattle Cancer Care Alliance from 1990 to 2011, together with their donors, genotyped to find variants associated with graft-versus-host disease, recurrent malignancy and other complications after transplantation." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs001918.v1.p1", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9043943/fullTextXML"}
