id: coho:COHO_0000536
name: Meta-Analyses of Glucose and Insulin-related traits Consortium
def: "A collaborative consortium that combines genome-wide association and exome-array data from many cohorts of individuals without diabetes in meta-analyses of glycaemic traits (fasting glucose, fasting insulin, 2-hour glucose and HbA1c) and measures of insulin secretion and sensitivity, to find loci influencing glycaemic and metabolic traits, and releases its summary results." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11399760/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://magicinvestigators.org/"}
