[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000543
name: Relationship between Insulin Sensitivity and Cardiovascular disease
def: "A prospective cohort of about 1,500 healthy men and women of European ancestry aged 30 to 60, recruited without diabetes, hypertension or dyslipidaemia at centres in 13-14 European countries by the European Group for the Study of Insulin Resistance, with baseline oral glucose tolerance tests and euglycaemic insulin clamps and follow-up after 3 and 10 years to study how insulin resistance relates to atherosclerosis, cardiovascular disease and type 2 diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:14968294", IAO:0000119="PMID:19455304"}
