[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000548
name: DIAbetes COhoRtE
def: "A prospective cohort of about 3,000 adult outpatients of self-reported Caucasian ethnicity with prevalent type 2 diabetes, recruited in 2010–2014 at two university-based study centres in Germany and followed with biennial visits, core phenotyping and biobanking for at least 10 years to study diabetes complications, with a primary focus on renal events." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23409726", IAO:0000119="PMID:30897159"}
