id: coho:COHO_0000551
name: European Alzheimer & Dementia Biobank
def: "A European consortium bringing together the European genome-wide association consortia working on Alzheimer disease, which collated and uniformly genotyped a new dataset of about 20,000 clinically diagnosed Alzheimer disease cases and 22,000 controls from 15 European countries and pools them with existing European cohorts for genetic studies of Alzheimer disease and related dementias." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35379992"}
