[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000565
name: Intermountain Heart Collaborative Study
def: "A prospective registry and biorepository of Intermountain Healthcare, Utah, begun in 1993, that enrols consenting patients at the cardiac catheterisation laboratories of Intermountain hospitals in Salt Lake City and Ogden, with a blood sample taken at angiography and electronic follow-up for cardiovascular outcomes such as death, myocardial infarction, heart failure and stroke. It was later renamed the INSPIRE biobank registry and now collects samples and data from consenting Intermountain patients with any health condition." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4302371/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10482040/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="PMID:29803983", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12807872/fullTextXML"}
