id: coho:COHO_0000567
name: London Life Sciences Prospective Population Study
def: "A prospective population-based cohort of about 28,000 Indian Asian (South Asian) and European men and women aged 35 to 75, recruited in 2003-2008 from the lists of 58 general practitioners in West London, UK, with a structured cardiovascular and metabolic assessment and stored blood, to study the excess cardiometabolic risk of South Asians." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33413638", IAO:0000119="PMID:27195708"}
