[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000569
name: Diet, Activity and Lifestyle Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of colon cancer, with cases diagnosed in 1991–1994 and age- and sex-matched controls recruited from the Kaiser Permanente Medical Care Program of Northern California, Utah and the Twin Cities of Minnesota, extended in 1997–2001 by a parallel study of rectal cancer in Utah and Kaiser Permanente, collecting diet, physical activity and other lifestyle data to study their relation to colorectal cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3005543/unicode", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3913564/unicode"}
