id: coho:COHO_0000570
name: Invecchiare in Chianti
def: "A prospective population-based study of aging of 1,453 residents aged 20 to 102, mostly older people, selected by multistage sampling from the registries of Greve in Chianti and Bagno a Ripoli in Tuscany, Italy, examined at baseline in 1998-2000 and followed up to identify risk factors for the loss of walking ability and other age-related decline." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:11129752", IAO:0000119="PMID:40981293"}
