[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000573
name: Norwegian Breast Cancer Study
def: "A Norwegian breast cancer case-control study in the Breast Cancer Association Consortium, whose cases are incident breast cancers from Ullevål University Hospital (1990–1994), the Norwegian Radium Hospital (1975–1986 and 1995–1998) and Haukeland University Hospital (1992–2001) and whose controls are women from Tromsø and Bergen who attended the Norwegian Breast Cancer Screening Program. It also includes a sub-study of women attending the national mammography screening programme in 2002–2007 who gave blood and breast biopsies with mammographic density measurements, and its normal and tumour breast tissue samples are used in gene expression studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5065698/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4754625/supplementaryFiles", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9006574/supplementaryFiles"}
