[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000577
name: Swedish Mammography Cohort
def: "A population-based prospective cohort of women born 1914–1948 living in Uppsala and Västmanland counties in central Sweden, established in 1987–1990 among the 90,303 women invited to mammography screening who completed a food frequency questionnaire, re-surveyed in 1997 and followed through linkage to Swedish national registers to study diet, lifestyle and chronic disease, notably cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:42319504"}
