id: coho:COHO_0000579
name: VITamins And Lifestyle Study
def: "A prospective cohort of men and women aged 50–76 living in the 13-county area of western Washington State covered by the SEER cancer registry, recruited by mailed questionnaire from October 2000 to December 2002, with about 77,700 valid baseline questionnaires, to study the use of vitamins and other dietary supplements, and lifestyle, in relation to cancer risk." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4705892/fullTextXML"}
