[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000580
name: Western Australian Sleep Health Study
def: "A clinic-based cohort of patients of European origin attending the only public sleep clinic in Western Australia, in Perth, most of them referred for sleep-disordered breathing, with questionnaires, biochemistry, DNA and in-laboratory polysomnography collected for over 3,000 patients by 2010 towards a target of 4,000 and linkage to Western Australian health data, to study the epidemiology and genetics of obstructive sleep apnoea and its comorbidities." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30990817", IAO:0000119="PMID:21318257", IAO:0000119="PMID:34446064"}
