[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000581
name: European Medical Information Framework for Alzheimer's Disease Multimodal Biomarker Discovery study
def: "A European multimodal biomarker dataset of 1,221 people aged over 50 with normal cognition, mild cognitive impairment or Alzheimer-type dementia and known amyloid status, whose existing clinical data, samples and scans were retrospectively combined from 11 prospective European cohort studies (three multicenter and eight single-center studies) within the Innovative Medicines Initiative-funded European Medical Information Framework, with plasma, cerebrospinal fluid, DNA and MRI data for discovery of diagnostic and prognostic Alzheimer disease biomarkers." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29980228"}
