id: coho:COHO_0000585
name: Colorectal Cancer Genetics & Genomics
def: "A Spanish colorectal cancer study combining two case-control studies: incident colorectal cancer cases and hospital controls recruited at the University Hospital of Bellvitge, L'Hospitalet de Llobregat (Barcelona), in 1996–1998, and cases and population controls recruited at Bellvitge and the Hospital of León in 2007–2015, genotyped to study the genetics and genomics of colorectal cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8574048/fullTextXML"}
