[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000587
name: EPIC-InterAct Study
def: "A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32641421", IAO:0000119="PMID:21717116"}
