id: coho:COHO_0000588
name: Leipzig Adults
def: "A sample of about 900 adults of European ancestry aged 18 to 99 from Leipzig, Germany, with a mean BMI of about 35 to 38 kg/m2, collected with support from the Integrated Research and Treatment Centre (IFB) AdiposityDiseases of the University of Leipzig and the German Obesity Biomaterial Bank, and genotyped on the Illumina ExomeChip and Metabochip for consortium studies of obesity-related and glycaemic traits." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://doi.org/10.2337/figshare.12933737", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7610958/supplementaryFiles", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11399760/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0011-x/MediaObjects/41588_2017_11_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx"}
