id: coho:COHO_0000589
name: Swiss Study on Air Pollution and Lung Diseases in Adults
def: "A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36267918", IAO:0000119="PMID:16167509", IAO:0000119="PMID:9151378"}
