id: coho:COHO_0000590
name: Bunkyo Health Study
def: "A prospective cohort of 1,629 older adults aged 65–84 years living in Bunkyo-ku, an urban area of Tokyo, sampled from the residential registries of 13 communities chosen by probability proportionate to size, examined at the Sportology Center of Juntendo University in 2015–2018 and followed for over 10 years to study muscle function, metabolic health and ageing." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39346030", IAO:0000119="PMID:38769351"}
