[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000593
name: Italian Network of Genetic Isolates - Friuli Venezia Giulia
def: "A population-based cohort of about 1,700 people from six isolated villages in the Friuli Venezia Giulia region of north-eastern Italy, examined between 2008 and 2010 in the Genetic Park of Friuli Venezia Giulia project; one of the isolated populations of the Italian Network of Genetic Isolates, which studies the genetic basis of complex diseases and phenotypes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9436946/supplementaryFiles", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7080768/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10178705/fullTextXML"}
