id: coho:COHO_0000598
name: Alpha-Tocopherol, Beta-Carotene Cancer Prevention Study
def: "A randomized, placebo-controlled trial of alpha-tocopherol and beta-carotene supplements for the primary prevention of lung and other cancers in 29,133 male smokers aged 50–69 in Finland, recruited in 1985–1988 and supplemented for five to eight years, whose participants have since been followed as a cohort for cancer and other outcomes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12329778/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9992367/fullTextXML"}
