id: coho:COHO_0000599
name: Growth and Obesity Chilean Cohort Study
def: "A longitudinal cohort of 1,195 children born in 2002-2003 and recruited in 2006 at about 3.5 years of age from childcare centres of the low-to-middle income South East Area of Santiago, Chile, measured annually (six-monthly from 2010) at the Instituto de Nutrición y Tecnología en Alimentos into adolescence to study growth, puberty and obesity." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:34047840", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
