[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000605
name: Isle of Wight Whole Population Birth Cohort
def: "A whole-population birth cohort of the children born on the Isle of Wight, England, between 1 January 1989 and 28 February 1990, of whom 1,456 were enrolled for long-term follow-up and assessed at 1, 2, 4, 10, 18 and 26 years, to study the prevalence, natural history and risk and protective factors of asthma and allergic diseases from infancy into adulthood." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31831580", IAO:0000119="PMID:29547889"}
