[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000613
name: ADDITION-Denmark
def: "The Danish arm of the ADDITION-Europe trial, in which people aged 40–69 without known diabetes registered with 181 general practices in Denmark were screened stepwise for diabetes in 2001–2006 and those with screen-detected type 2 diabetes, in practices cluster-randomised to routine care or intensive multifactorial treatment (with or without GP training in motivational interviewing), were followed for cardiovascular events and mortality." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32071038"}
synonym: "ADDITION" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "ADDITION study" RELATED []
synonym: "ADDITION-DK" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
