relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Denmark {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7330202/fullTextXML", comment="In brief, between 2001 and 2006, a population-based stepwise screening programme was performed among people aged 40–69 years without known diabetes in 181 general practices in Denmark."}
