[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000614
name: Anglo-Danish-Dutch Study of Intensive Treatment in People with Screen Detected Diabetes in Primary Care
def: "A pragmatic cluster-randomised trial in 343 general practices in Denmark, the Netherlands and the UK, in which registered patients aged 40–69 without known diabetes were screened and the 3,057 with screen-detected type 2 diabetes received routine care or early intensive multifactorial treatment and were followed for cardiovascular events and death." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21705063"}
synonym: "ADDITION" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "ADDITION-Europe" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
