id: coho:COHO_0000615
name: Montreal Heart Institute Biobank
def: "A longitudinal hospital-based cohort and biobank of patients of the Montreal Heart Institute, a cardiology hospital enriched for cardiovascular disease, who consented to give a baseline blood sample with medical, nutritional, psychosocial, sociodemographic and lifestyle data, updated through hospital record linkage and four-yearly follow-up interviews, and who are genotyped for genetic and pharmacogenomic studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9372422/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12480102/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13532063/fullTextXML"}
