[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000622
name: Taiwan Precision Medicine Initiative
def: "A hospital-based cohort of more than 565,000 participants recruited by Academia Sinica with 16 major medical centres across Taiwan, genotyped on arrays optimised for Han Chinese ancestry and linked to retrospective and prospective electronic medical records, for genome-wide, phenome-wide and polygenic risk studies of common disease and pharmacogenetic response." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:41092961"}
