[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000624
name: Born in Guangzhou Cohort Study
def: "A prospective birth cohort of pregnant women living in Guangzhou, China, recruited in early pregnancy at Guangzhou Women and Children's Medical Center from 2012, with biological samples from mothers, fathers and infants and planned follow-up of the children to age 18 years, to study social, biological and environmental influences on pregnancy and child health and development." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28321694"}
