property_value: IAO:0000112 "GCST90321087" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Germline Genetic Variants Associated with Somatic TMPRSS2:ERG Fusion Status in Prostate Cancer: A Genome-Wide Association Study.", xref="PMID:37555839", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A37555839+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="However, few studies have investigated germline genetic variants associating with TMPRSS2:ERG fusion status.MethodsWe performed a genome-wide association study with 396 TMPRSS2:ERG(+) cases, 390 TMPRSS2:ERG(-) cases, and 2,386 cancer-free controls from the Physicians' Health Study (PHS), the Health Professionals Follow-up Study (HPFS), and a Seattle-based Fred Hutchinson (FH) Cancer Center Prostate Cancer Study."}
