[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000633
name: Child and Adolescent Twin Study in Sweden
def: "An ongoing longitudinal study of all twins born in Sweden since July 1992, whose parents are interviewed about the children's somatic and mental health and social environment at age 9 or 12, with follow-up questionnaires at ages 15 and 18 and clinical assessments at 15 of screen-positive twin pairs and controls, to study the aetiology of childhood mental health problems and their role in later adjustment." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22506305"}
