id: coho:COHO_0000642
name: Determining the Influence of Susceptibility COnveying Variants Related to one-Year mortality after BMT
def: "A study population of patients with acute myeloid leukaemia, myelodysplastic syndrome or acute lymphoblastic leukaemia who received an unrelated-donor blood or marrow transplant in 2000–2011, and their HLA-matched unrelated donors, contributed by 151 US transplant centres to the Center for International Blood and Marrow Transplant Research, assembled in two cohorts to find non-HLA genetic variants associated with one-year survival after transplant." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:34746714", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
