id: coho:COHO_0000649
name: San Antonio Family Study
def: "A family-based study of Mexican Americans in San Antonio, Texas, United States, made up of the San Antonio Family Heart Study (extended families of randomly selected low-income Mexican American probands) and the San Antonio Family Diabetes/Gallbladder Study (extended families of probands with type 2 diabetes from the San Antonio Heart Study), both begun in 1991 and followed with repeated examinations, to study the genetics of cardiovascular disease, type 2 diabetes and related traits." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:8901667", IAO:0000119="PMID:25519314", IAO:0000119="PMID:35399580"}
