def: "A prospective cohort of women aged 35–74 living in the United States and Puerto Rico who had never had breast cancer but had a sister diagnosed with it, enrolled from 2003 by the National Institute of Environmental Health Sciences with biological and environmental samples to study environmental and genetic risk factors for breast cancer and other health outcomes in women." [] {dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29373861"}
