[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000661
name: UroLife study
def: "A multicentre prospective cohort of more than 1,100 patients newly diagnosed with non-muscle-invasive bladder cancer, recruited in 2014–2021 from 22 hospitals in the Netherlands and followed with questionnaires, diaries, blood and tumour samples and cancer registry data to study how lifestyle habits relate to prognosis and health-related quality of life." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31619424"}
