id: coho:COHO_0000663
name: CROATIA-Split Study
def: "A population-based cohort of about 1,000 adults from the mainland city of Split, the second-largest city in Croatia, recruited within the 10,001 Dalmatians biobank project as an urban counterpart to the isolated island cohorts of Vis and Korčula, for studies of the genetic, environmental and social determinants of health and disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10138356/fullTextXML"}
