[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000664
name: Epidemiological study on the Genetics and Environment of Asthma
def: "A French case-control and family-based cohort of asthma cases recruited in chest clinics in Grenoble, Lyon, Marseille, Montpellier and Paris, their first-degree relatives and population-based controls, enrolled in 1991–1995 and followed up in 2003–2007 and later, to study the genetic and environmental causes of asthma, bronchial hyperresponsiveness and atopy." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35624665", IAO:0000119="PMID:8590334"}
