[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000666
name: Gothenburg H70 Birth Cohort Studies and Clinical AD Sweden
def: "A collection of Alzheimer's disease cases and dementia-free controls from Sweden that combines cases diagnosed in memory clinics in different parts of Sweden or identified in two population-based studies in Gothenburg, the Prospective Population Study of Women and the Gothenburg Birth Cohort Studies (H70, H85 and 95+), with controls from those Gothenburg population studies, genotyped for genome-wide association studies of Alzheimer's disease and its biomarkers." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:42237039", IAO:0000119="PMID:36066633"}
