id: coho:COHO_0000667
name: Northern California Breast Cancer Family Registry
def: "The Northern California site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry, which from 1995 enrolled about 4000 women with incident breast cancer, ascertained through the Greater Bay Area Cancer Registry in the San Francisco Bay Area with oversampling of cases with indicators of increased genetic susceptibility, together with their family members and random-digit-dialled population controls, to study the genetic epidemiology of breast cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25327703", IAO:0000119="PMID:15217505", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9006574/supplementaryFiles"}
