[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000673
name: Accessible Resource for Integrated Epigenomic Studies
def: "A sub-study of the Avon Longitudinal Study of Parents and Children comprising 1,018 mother-offspring pairs with genome-wide DNA methylation profiled at birth, in childhood and in adolescence for the children and at two time points for the mothers, established as an openly accessible resource to study the determinants and consequences of epigenetic variation." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25991711"}
