id: coho:COHO_0000674
name: Bellygenes initiative
def: "An international collaborative initiative that pooled individual-level and aggregate genetic data on 12,852 people with irritable bowel syndrome and 139,981 controls from multiple studies for genome-wide association studies of irritable bowel syndrome." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34741163"}
