id: coho:COHO_0000675
name: CERA cohort
def: "A cohort of people of European ancestry with and without age-related macular degeneration, recruited, imaged with optical coherence tomography and genotyped by the Centre for Eye Research Australia, used in genetic studies of age-related macular degeneration and reticular pseudodrusen." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:41361163"}
