id: coho:COHO_0000688
name: METASTROKE collaboration
def: "A collaboration that meta-analyses genome-wide association datasets from ischaemic stroke case-control cohorts of European ancestry (initially 15 cohorts with 12,389 cases and 62,004 controls) to validate previously reported associations and identify new genetic associations with ischaemic stroke and its subtypes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23041239"}
