[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000694
name: Stroke in Young Fabry Patients
def: "A multicentre, multinational European prospective observational study of 5,023 patients aged 18–55 with acute stroke or transient ischaemic attack, enrolled at 47 centres in 15 European countries between 2007 and 2010, originally designed to investigate the relation between juvenile stroke and Fabry disease and also used to study stroke patterns in young adults." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25380809"}
