def: "A German study run from the Technical University of Dresden, with participants from Saxony, of people at increased risk of type 2 diabetes who had a 75-g oral glucose tolerance test at baseline and again after about three years, which also contributed patients with type 2 diabetes and controls to consortium genetic studies of type 2 diabetes and glycaemic traits." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21646370", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:16801592", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2798726/fullTextXML"}
