[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000713
name: Korea-Registries to Overcome Dementia and Accelerate Dementia Research
def: "A hospital-based Korean dementia research programme made up of three prospective cohorts (the PREMIER consortium, the LLOD cohort and the Samsung Medical Center amyloid PET cohort) at 28 centres, which by December 2023 had recruited over 5,800 participants across the Alzheimer's clinical syndrome, subcortical vascular cognitive impairment and frontotemporal dementia spectra, with clinical, neuroimaging, biomarker and genomic data, to study disease progression and early diagnosis of dementia in the Korean population." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39512701"}
