id: coho:COHO_0000720
name: Phenomics and Genomics Sample
def: "A sample collected at the University of Munich, Germany, of about 3,000 healthy volunteers of German descent from the Munich area, assessed with structured psychiatric interviews covering themselves and their first-degree relatives, together with about 1,000 patients with schizophrenia and about 300 people with other diagnoses, including Alzheimer's disease patients from the psychiatric memory clinic, used as a case and control resource in genetic studies of psychiatric, neurological and neurodegenerative disorders." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:32157568", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35379992", IAO:0000119="PMID:33133009"}
