[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000731
name: Collaborative Oncological Gene-environment Study
def: "A collaborative genotyping experiment of four cancer genetics consortia, studying breast cancer (the Breast Cancer Association Consortium), ovarian cancer, prostate cancer, and breast and ovarian cancer in BRCA1 and BRCA2 mutation carriers, funded by the EU Seventh Framework Programme, which genotyped samples from their member studies on a custom Illumina iSelect array (iCOGS) of more than 200,000 SNPs to identify cancer susceptibility loci." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35418701", IAO:0000119="PMID:23535729"}
