id: coho:COHO_0000735
name: San Francisco Bay Area Breast Cancer Study
def: "A population-based multiethnic case-control study of breast cancer in the San Francisco Bay Area, California, in which women aged 35–79 diagnosed with invasive breast cancer in 1995–2002 were identified through the Greater Bay Area Cancer Registry and controls were identified by random-digit dialing and matched on 5-year age group." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25327703"}
