id: coho:COHO_0000738
name: Mexico City sample 1
def: "A case-control sample of 967 Mexican adults with type 2 diabetes, preferentially diagnosed before age 55, and 343 normoglycaemic controls from Mexico City, Mexico, who are covered by the Mexican Social Security Institute and were recruited at the Medical Center Siglo XXI, used in genome-wide association studies of type 2 diabetes and lipid traits." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21573907", IAO:0000119="PMID:26780889", IAO:0000119="PMID:35399580"}
