id: coho:COHO_0000742
name: AncestryDNA Human Diversity Project
def: "A research cohort of customers of the AncestryDNA consumer genetic testing service who consented to AncestryDNA's Human Diversity Project and contribute genotype data and survey responses to genetic studies, including a COVID-19 survey of US-based adult customers used in genome-wide association studies of COVID-19 and influenza outcomes." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:39103650", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35410379"}
