relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Italy {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7987337/fullTextXML", comment="This is a nested case-control study in which we compared male participants with extreme phenotype selected from the Italian GEN-COVID cohort of SARS-CoV-2-infected participants (<60 y, 79 severe cases versus 77 control cases)."}
