property_value: coho:numberOfCases "1662" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="genotyped lung cancer cases and controls (analysed subset, NHW and AA), 2018", xref="https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC11771983", comment="These P/LP variants were genotyped in a sample of 3,040 lung cancer cases and controls from the INHALE study (non-Hispanic White: n=1,915; African American: n=1,125) and were tested for their association with lung cancer using multivariate logistic regression adjusting for age, sex, pack-years, and race."}
