def: "A prospective population-based cohort of adults aged 35–64 years recruited in 2007 by age-stratified random sampling in the semi-urban Ragama Medical Officer of Health area of Gampaha district, Sri Lanka, with baseline socio-demographic, lifestyle, anthropometric, biochemical and clinical data and follow-up of mortality and its predictors." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32994253"}
