[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000763
name: Singapore Epidemiology of Eye Diseases Study
def: "A multiethnic population-based cohort of Malay, Indian and Chinese adults in Singapore, recruited at baseline through the Singapore Malay Eye Study (2004–2006), the Singapore Indian Eye Study (2007–2009) and the Singapore Chinese Eye Study (2009–2011) and re-examined about six years later (SEED-2), to study the incidence and risk factors of eye diseases and visual impairment." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38025163"}
