property_value: coho:numberOfParticipants "10033" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="Malay, Indian and Chinese adults aged 40-80 who took part at baseline (2004-2011)", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10630666/fullTextXML", comment="All subjects provided written informed consent.In brief, an age-stratified random sampling method was used to select 13 271 subjects (4168 Malays, 4497 Indians, and 4606 Chinese) aged 40–80 years, from which a total of 10 033 subjects (3280 Malays, 3400 Indians, and 3353 Chinese) participated in the study, thereby achieving a response rate of 75.6%."}
