id: coho:COHO_0000773
name: Colorectal Transdisciplinary Study
def: "A colorectal cancer genetic epidemiology consortium, approved at the University of Southern California and funded within the NCI GAME-ON post-GWAS initiative, that pools genome-wide genotype data from colorectal cancer case-control studies such as the Molecular Epidemiology of Colorectal Cancer Study, the Colon Cancer Family Registry and the Kentucky and Newfoundland case-control studies to find and characterise colorectal cancer susceptibility variants." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:25105248", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
