[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000778
name: Swedish MS registry
def: "A government-funded national quality registry of patients with multiple sclerosis, used in all Swedish neurology departments, that supports clinical decisions and serves as a research resource, hosting nested projects including an incidence cohort, a prevalence cohort and post-marketing cohorts of patients on novel disease-modifying drugs." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26046553"}
