[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000780
name: Multi-Site Collaborative Study for Genotype-Phenotype Associations in Alzheimer's Disease
def: "A multi-site case-control study run with GlaxoSmithKline that recruited people with Alzheimer's disease from memory referral clinics in Canada, with cognitively unimpaired controls from their non-biological relatives, friends or spouses, to find genetic variants associated with Alzheimer's disease risk and age at onset." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:17998437"}
