id: coho:COHO_0000781
name: Hospital-based Epidemiologic Research Program at Aichi Cancer Center
def: "A hospital-based epidemiologic research programme run since 1988 at Aichi Cancer Center in Nagoya, Japan, whose participants are first-visit outpatients of Aichi Cancer Center Hospital (including the HERPACC-2, 2001–2005, and HERPACC-3, 2005–2013, phases), used for case-control studies of cancer such as oesophageal cancer and for genome-wide studies within the Japanese Consortium of Genetic Epidemiology Studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15942624", IAO:0000119="PMID:38277453", IAO:0000119="PMID:34897183"}
