[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000782
name: Japanese Consortium of Genetic Epidemiology Studies
def: "A consortium of Japanese population-based and hospital-based studies — the Tohoku Medical Megabank Community-Based Cohort Study, the Japan Public Health Center-based Prospective Study, the Japan Multi-Institutional Collaborative Cohort Study and the Hospital-based Epidemiologic Research Program at Aichi Cancer Center — that pools genome-wide genotype data on healthy participants for genetic epidemiology, including genome-wide association studies of body mass index, height and weight." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34897183"}
synonym: "J-CGE" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Japanese Consortium of Genetic Epidemiology" RELATED []
