[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000784
name: MEGASTROKE consortium
def: "A multi-ancestry consortium that combined genome-wide association data from 29 studies (67,162 stroke cases and 454,450 controls, mainly of European and East Asian ancestry) in a meta-analysis of stroke and its aetiological subtypes, drawing on contributing groups such as METASTROKE, SiGN, CHARGE and COMPASS." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29531354"}
