property_value: IAO:0000112 "GCST90841456" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Multi-ancestry, trans-generational GWAS meta-analysis of gestational diabetes and glycaemic traits during pregnancy reveals limited evidence of pregnancy-specific genetic effects.", xref="PMID:42225636", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13226718/fullTextXML", comment="The largest and most recent GDM GWASs to date include the FinnGen study (12,332 cases; 131,109 controls; European ancestry)21 and the MONN study (12,024 cases; 67,845 controls; East Asian ancestry)29, which together identified 27 loci associated with GDM."}

