id: coho:COHO_0000831
name: Influence of Life-style factors on Development of the Immune System and Allergies in East and West Germany plus Air Pollution and Genetics on Allergy Development
def: "A prospective population-based German birth cohort of 3,097 healthy term newborns born between 1997 and 1999 and recruited in obstetric hospitals in Munich, Leipzig, Wesel and Bad Honnef, followed through childhood and adolescence to study the influence of lifestyle, environmental exposures such as air pollution, and genetics on the development of the immune system and allergic diseases." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30402607"}
subset: coho1:GEC_subset
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
