id: coho:COHO_0000833
name: Multicase-Control Study in Spain
def: "A multicase-control study in Spain that recruited hospital-based cases of several common cancers, including breast, colorectal and prostate cancer, and population-based controls in 2008–2013, to study environmental, lifestyle and genetic risk factors for these cancers." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:41183009"}
