def: "A population-based case-control study of bladder cancer among residents of Maine, New Hampshire and Vermont, United States, with cases newly diagnosed in 2001–2004 and population controls frequency-matched on age, sex and state, used to study environmental, dietary and genetic risk factors for bladder cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35536285"}
