id: coho:COHO_0000838
name: NPDPSC pathology-confirmed rpAD
def: "A set of about 115 autopsied people referred with rapidly progressive dementia resembling prion disease to the National Prion Disease Pathology Surveillance Center at Case Western Reserve University between 2009 and 2017, in whom neuropathology, prion protein typing, PRNP sequencing and record review excluded prion disease and confirmed Alzheimer's disease, whole-genome sequenced from frozen brain tissue for genetic studies of rapidly progressive Alzheimer's disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38184787"}
