[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000843
name: Pakistan Genomic Resource
def: "A growing biobank and national consortium of case–control studies in Pakistan that aims to enrol one million participants (about 250,000 from 48 clinical sites in 17 cities by September 2023) across some 50 diseases, with whole-exome sequencing and recontact, used for genetic association and loss-of-function studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39271666"}
