[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000845
name: Riesgo de Enfermedad TROmboembólica VEnosa
def: "A Spanish case-control study of venous thromboembolism, based at the Hospital de la Santa Creu i Sant Pau in Barcelona, whose cases had a first venous thromboembolism and were sampled after 6–12 months of anticoagulant treatment, with healthy controls recruited from the general population, used to study genetic and plasma determinants of venous thromboembolism." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10247781/fullTextXML"}
