property_value: coho:numberOfCases "398" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="patients with VT and controls in the RETROVE study sample", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11935730/fullTextXML", comment="They include the LURIC (Ludwigshafen Risk and Cardiovascular Health) study, 27 composed of 1833 individuals among whom 100 reported venous thrombosis (VT); a subsample of 1011 participants from the MARTHA (Marseille Thrombosis Association) study, 28 which consists of 1 592 patients with VT; a subsample of 865 participants from the MEGA (Multiple Environmental and Genetic Assessment) study, 29 comprising 1289 patients with VT; and the RETROVE (Riesgo de Enfermedad Tromboembolica Venosa) 30 study, which included a sample of 398 patients with VT and 398 controls."}
