property_value: IAO:0000112 "GCST90094399" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Elevated plasma concentration of complement factor C5 is associated with risk of future venous thromboembolism.", xref="PMID:34339498", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A34339498+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="We wanted to investigate (1) whether plasma complement component C5 (C5) levels are influenced by genetic variants or chronic inflammation and (2) the association between plasma C5 and risk of future VTE in a nested case-control study of 415 patients with VTE and 848 age- and sex-matched controls derived from the Tromsø Study."}

