[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000861
name: DeCOI cohort
def: "A cohort of about 1,220 mainly vaccine-naive individuals with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection, across the full spectrum from asymptomatic to critical COVID-19, recruited early in the pandemic at 16 sites in Germany and South Tyrol, Italy, by a national host-genetics consortium built on the German COVID-19 Omics Initiative, with whole genome sequencing to study host genetic factors in COVID-19." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39715278"}
