id: coho:COHO_0000893
name: African Ancestry Anthropometry Genetics Consortium
def: "A consortium of genome-wide association studies of individuals of African ancestry that meta-analyses results from participating studies (up to about 53,000 individuals for body mass index) to discover and fine-map genetic loci for adiposity and other anthropometric traits." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28430825"}
