def: "A nation-wide Dutch collaborative project that combines genotype data from sixteen population and clinical cohorts in the Netherlands with uniform, DSM-based phenotyping of major depressive disorder, pooled centrally for genetic mega-analysis of depression." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13569458/fullTextXML", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
