property_value: coho:numberOfCases "16655" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="individuals in the lifetime MDD GWAS mega-analysis (16 655 cases, 48 286 controls)", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13569458/fullTextXML", comment="We performed a genome-wide association mega-analysis of lifetime MDD case-control status in 64 941 individuals (16 655 cases and 48 286 controls) and evaluated the extent to which this design captured common-variant signal by estimating SNP-based heritability and genetic overlap with the latest Psychiatric Genomics Consortium major depression GWAS [10]."}
