def: "A longitudinal population study of more than 5000 adults aged 40 and older in Bushbuckridge, rural Mpumalanga, South Africa, recruited in 2014–2015 within the Agincourt Health and Demographic Surveillance System, collecting socio-demographic, infection history and cognitive data to study health and ageing." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36973338"}
