id: coho:COHO_0000925
name: North American Rheumatoid Arthritis Consortium
def: "A collection of families with multiple siblings affected by rheumatoid arthritis, gathered in the United States by the North American Rheumatoid Arthritis Consortium using well-defined clinical criteria and a severe-phenotype selection of probands, later extended with case-control collections (NARAC-II, NARAC-III), for linkage and association studies of rheumatoid arthritis genetics." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:11254450"}
