[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000928
name: Ontario Familial Breast Cancer Registry
def: "The Ontario site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry, which enrolled women with invasive breast cancer diagnosed in 1996–1998 identified through the Ontario Cancer Registry (all those aged 20–54 at high genetic risk and random samples of others, with high-risk cases diagnosed in 2001–2002 added), together with their relatives and population controls, to study the genetic epidemiology of breast cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15217505", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9006574/supplementaryFiles"}
