id: coho:COHO_0000930
name: Polish Breast Cancer Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of breast cancer in Warsaw and Łódź, Poland, in 2000–2003, funded by the intramural programme of the US National Cancer Institute, in which cases were women aged 20–74 with newly diagnosed in situ or invasive breast cancer identified through a rapid identification system at participating hospitals and through cancer registries." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:20520800", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9006574/supplementaryFiles", IAO:0000119="PMID:25855707"}
