[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000938
name: Tohoku Medical Megabank Community-Based Cohort Study
def: "A community-based cohort of adults aged 20 years or over living in Miyagi or Iwate Prefecture, Japan, of whom 87,865 consented to join through health check-ups and assessment centres of the Tohoku Medical Megabank Project, to assess the long-term impact of the Great East Japan Earthquake and gene–environment interactions in major diseases such as cancer and cardiovascular disease, with genome and metabolome information." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:31932529", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
