id: coho:COHO_0000948
name: Harvard Aging Brain Study
def: "A longitudinal observational study of cognitively normal older adults, designed to distinguish normal ageing from preclinical Alzheimer's disease, with demographic, clinical, neuropsychological, clinical biomarker and neuroimaging data, including amyloid PET acquired at Massachusetts General Hospital in Boston, United States." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25843019"}
