id: coho:COHO_0000950
name: Study of Asthma Phenotypes and Pharmacogenomic Interactions by Race-Ethnicity
def: "An ongoing study at Henry Ford Health System of members of the health system aged 12–56, with and without a clinical diagnosis of asthma, from southeast Michigan and the Detroit metropolitan area, United States, enrolled with a staff-administered questionnaire and lung function testing to study asthma phenotypes and pharmacogenomic interactions across racial and ethnic groups." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37794016"}
