id: coho:COHO_0000963
name: Tyypin 1 Diabetekseen Sairastuneita Perheenjäsenineen
def: "A Finnish collection of people with type 1 diabetes, most of them diagnosed in childhood, together with members of their families, which has contributed cases, controls and parent–offspring trios to international genetic studies of type 1 diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28983737"}
