[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000965
name: European Study into Digestive Illnesses and Genetics
def: "A multicentre case-control study of pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma carried out at centres in Spain, Italy, Sweden, Germany, the United Kingdom and Ireland in 2009-2014 and 2016-2018, which recruited newly diagnosed patients aged 18 and older and, as controls, sex-, age- and area-matched hospital in-patients without cancer whose primary diagnoses were not associated with known risk factors for the disease (population-based controls in Ireland and Sweden), and collected lifestyle, environmental-exposure and medical-history information by in-person interviews." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:41315260", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33517887"}
