[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000966
name: Seoul Breast Cancer Study
def: "A multicentre case-control study of female breast cancer conducted in Seoul, South Korea, since 1995, which recruited women with histologically confirmed incident breast cancer at university hospitals in Seoul, among them Seoul National University Hospital and Asan Medical Center, and cancer-free controls from health examinees at the same hospitals or in community health screening programmes, collecting risk-factor information by face-to-face interviews with a structured questionnaire." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22452962", IAO:0000119="PMID:24349656", IAO:0000119="PMID:27057831"}
