[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000969
name: Enhancing NeuroImaging Genetics through Meta-Analysis Consortium
def: "An international collaborative network of neuroimaging and genetics researchers at institutions worldwide, organised into working groups, that pools and meta-analyses brain MRI and genetic data from many sites, including patient populations, to find genetic and other factors that affect brain structure and function in health and disease; its first project was a genome-wide association study of hippocampal and intracranial volume." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24399358", IAO:0000119="https://enigma.ini.usc.edu/about-2/", IAO:0000119="PMID:32198361"}
