relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9228731/fullTextXML", comment="Herein, we provide results from a prospective population-based longitudinal follow-up (FU) SARS-CoV-2 serosurveillance study in Tirschenreuth, the county which was hit hardest in Germany in spring 2020 and early 2021."}
