[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000971
name: Amsterdam Cohort Studies on HIV infection and AIDS
def: "A prospective cohort study of HIV infection and AIDS in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, a collaboration of the Public Health Service of Amsterdam, Amsterdam University Medical Centers, Sanquin Blood Supply and other partners, which since 1984 has followed an open cohort of men who have sex with men and from 1985 until 2016 followed a cohort of people who use drugs, to study the prevalence, incidence and risk factors of HIV infection and AIDS and the natural history of HIV-1 infection, and to carry out intervention studies and evaluate prevention programmes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30312336", IAO:0000119="PMID:33407562", IAO:0000119="PMID:9586643"}
