[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000972
name: Broad Cardiovascular Disease Initiative Study
def: "A multi-study case–control collection at the Broad Institute, an extension of the Broad AF study, focused on cardiovascular diseases including atrial fibrillation, mitral valve prolapse, atrioventricular nodal reentrant tachycardia, supraventricular tachycardia and bradyarrhythmia, whose samples' DNA was imported to the Broad and jointly genotyped. It was funded as part of a collaboration between the Broad Institute and Bayer AG." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40050429"}
