[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000974
name: Cardiovascular and Metabolic Disease Etiology Research Center-High Risk
def: "A prospective cohort of adults at high risk of cardiovascular disease, enrolled from November 2013 at Severance Hospital in Seoul, South Korea, to develop preventive strategies for high-risk patients. Participants qualify through high-risk hypertension, diabetes with albuminuria, end-stage renal disease on dialysis, asymptomatic atherosclerotic disease, rheumatoid arthritis treated with methotrexate and steroids, atrial fibrillation, a kidney transplant, or being a relative of a patient with early acute myocardial infarction." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28740058"}
