[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000983
name: Studies of a Targeted Risk Reduction Intervention through Defined Exercise
def: "A group of three randomised trials of supervised exercise training, STRRIDE I (1999–2003), STRRIDE AT/RT (2004–2008) and STRRIDE-PD (2009–2012), that enrolled previously sedentary adults with overweight or obesity and mild-to-moderate dyslipidaemia or prediabetes at Duke University Medical Center and East Carolina University, to study the effects of exercise amount, mode and intensity, and of weight loss by caloric restriction, on cardiometabolic health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37492634"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
synonym: "STRRIDE" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
