[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000986
name: Umeå Fracture and Osteoporosis Study
def: "A population-based study sampled from the Northern Sweden Health and Disease Study cohort in the county of Västerbotten, Sweden, whose hip and forearm fracture cases, identified by linking the cohort with medical records and radiographic reports, are compared with controls from the same cohort to identify the genetic and environmental determinants of osteoporotic fractures." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:32067027", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
