id: coho:COHO_0000987
name: Multicenter Study of Hydroxyurea in Sickle Cell Anemia
def: "A randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial, conducted in 1992–1995 at 21 sickle cell referral centres in the United States and Canada, of whether hydroxyurea reduces vaso-occlusive events in adults with sickle cell anaemia and frequent painful episodes, whose participants were then followed observationally in 1996–2001." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:12672732"}
