[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000990
name: African American-Diabetes Heart Study
def: "A study at Wake Forest School of Medicine that, after the family-based Diabetes Heart Study and in parallel with it, enrolled unrelated African Americans with type 2 diabetes under the same inclusion criteria and analyses them together with that study's African American participants, to investigate ethnic differences in and inherited contributions to calcified atherosclerotic plaque and related traits such as bone density, vitamin D and, in its MIND extension, brain structure and cognition." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:34014961", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21409311", IAO:0000119="PMID:19825824"}
