[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0000991
name: Anti-Aging Study Cohort
def: "A cohort of middle-aged and older residents of Ehime Prefecture, Japan, who since 2006 have attended the health check-up programme of the Anti-aging Center at Ehime University Hospital, designed to evaluate ageing-related disorders such as atherosclerosis, cardiovascular disease, physical function and mild cognitive impairment, and who are followed in the Japan Shimanami Health Promoting Program (J-SHIPP), a longitudinal study of factors related to cardiovascular disease, dementia and death." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29491417", IAO:0000119="PMID:38280978", IAO:0000119="PMID:28371474", IAO:0000119="PMID:28406166"}
