[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001001
name: Diabetes Genetics Initiative
def: "A genome-wide association study of type 2 diabetes and related quantitative traits by the Broad Institute of Harvard and MIT, Lund University and the Novartis Institutes for BioMedical Research. Its participants were patients with type 2 diabetes and matched non-diabetic controls from Finland and Sweden, genotyped and characterised for glucose metabolism, lipids, obesity and blood pressure." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:17463246", IAO:0000119="PMID:18678614"}
