[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001002
name: DIAbetes Meta-ANalysis of Trans-Ethnic association studies
def: "A consortium established to assemble genome-wide association studies of type 2 diabetes across diverse ancestry groups. It meta-analyses them within its European and East Asian ancestry components and, together with African, Hispanic and South Asian ancestry studies, in a multi-ancestry meta-regression, to discover and fine-map type 2 diabetes loci." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35551307"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
