[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001006
name: International FTLD-TDP Whole-Genome Sequencing Consortium
def: "An international consortium, established to characterise the known genetic causes of frontotemporal lobar degeneration with TDP-43 inclusions (FTLD-TDP) and to find new genetic risk factors for it and its pathological subtypes. It whole-genome sequences people with pathologically confirmed FTLD-TDP (and, from its second phase, clinically diagnosed FTLD subtypes enriched for FTLD-TDP) and neurologically normal controls, compiled from institutions and brain banks in North America, Europe and Australia." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30739198", IAO:0000119="PMID:40280976"}
