[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001011
name: Genetics of the Scottish Health Research Register
def: "A biobank sub-study of SHARE, the Scottish Health Research Register, in NHS Tayside and NHS Fife, Scotland, which collects, with consent, blood left over from registrants' routine clinical tests at hospital or GP clinics for genotyping linked to their anonymised electronic health records; it began as a Wellcome Trust-funded pilot in NHS Tayside." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37308106", IAO:0000119="PMID:39792440", IAO:0000119="PMID:29025058", IAO:0000119="PMID:28148535"}
