[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001016
name: International AMD Genomics Consortium
def: "An international consortium of 26 studies of age-related macular degeneration, mainly in the United States, Europe, Israel and Australia, which gathered DNA from advanced and intermediate AMD cases, mostly recruited from ophthalmology clinics, and from controls, predominantly of European ancestry. The samples were genotyped centrally at the Center for Inherited Disease Research on a custom-modified HumanCoreExome array to examine common and rare genetic variants in AMD." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26691988"}
