id: coho:COHO_0001018
name: UK lung cancer GWAS from the Institute for Cancer Research
def: "A genome-wide association case-control study of lung cancer in the United Kingdom, run at the Institute of Cancer Research, which genotyped lung cancer patients recruited in 1999–2004 through UK oncology centres for the Genetic Lung Cancer Predisposition Study (GELCAPS) and compared them with genotyped controls from the 1958 British Birth Cohort." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:18978787", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18715499", IAO:0000119="PMID:22899653"}
