[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001021
name: International Suicide Genetics Consortium
def: "An international consortium that meta-analyses genome-wide association data on suicide attempt and suicide death from cohorts worldwide, including cohorts ascertained for psychiatric disorders or substance use, studies of suicide or suicide attempt, and population-based biobanks, to identify genetic risk loci for suicidal behaviour and separate them from those of psychiatric disorders." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34861974"}
