[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001022
name: Myocardial Applied Genomics Network
def: "A multicentre biorepository for genomic studies of human myocardial disease, led by investigators at the Perelman School of Medicine, University of Pennsylvania, which collects left ventricular tissue from failing hearts at cardiac transplantation and from donor hearts not used for transplantation, at sites including the University of Pennsylvania, the Cleveland Clinic and Stanford, together with genotyped patients with prevalent heart failure referred to a heart failure specialty centre for case-control studies of heart failure." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40038546", IAO:0000119="PMID:36376295", IAO:0000119="PMID:31235787"}
