id: coho:COHO_0001036
name: TRoglitazone In the Prevention Of Diabetes
def: "A single-centre, randomised, double-masked, placebo-controlled trial in which nondiabetic Hispanic women with prior gestational diabetes mellitus, recruited in the Los Angeles area, United States, were assigned to troglitazone or placebo to test whether treating insulin resistance improves insulin sensitivity, preserves pancreatic beta-cell function and prevents type 2 diabetes." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:24124113", IAO:0000119="PMID:9551285", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37594959"}
