[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001054
name: Antioxydants, Lipides Essentiels, Nutrition et maladies OculaiRes
def: "A population-based cohort of elderly residents of Bordeaux, France, recruited from 2006 as an ophthalmological follow-up nested within the Three-City Study, assessing associations between eye diseases such as age-related macular degeneration and nutritional factors through plasma measurements, dietary-intake estimation and repeated eye examinations." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21125205", IAO:0000119="PMID:34203817", IAO:0000119="PMID:40808916", dcterms:contributor="Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26084364"}
