id: coho:COHO_0001057
name: Base de Datos de Ictus del Hospital del Mar
def: "A prospective hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public university hospital serving about 330,000 people in three districts of Barcelona, Spain, with records from 2005 onwards, standardised clinical and imaging assessment and outcome follow-up; its patients who gave DNA form the BASICMAR genetic study, a contributing site of the NINDS Stroke Genetics Network." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29310044", IAO:0000119="PMID:29706931", IAO:0000119="PMID:26708676", IAO:0000119="PMID:39286457"}
