[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001058
name: Bavarian Breast Cancer Cases and Controls Study
def: "A case-control study of breast cancer based at the University Breast Center for Franconia, Erlangen University Hospital, Bavaria, Germany, which in the 2000s enrolled women aged 18 or older with invasive breast cancer treated there, with tumour tissue for tissue microarrays, and controls recruited in hospital, through a breast cancer screening programme or by newspaper advertisement, to study genetic and non-genetic risk factors and prognostic and predictive factors of breast cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35414113", IAO:0000119="PMID:38178900", IAO:0000119="PMID:39586971"}
