id: coho:COHO_0001063
name: Bio-Repository of DNA in Stroke
def: "An ongoing international hospital-based DNA repository, run from Imperial College London, of adults with ischaemic or haemorrhagic stroke recruited at stroke centres in the United Kingdom (patients of European ancestry and British South Asians), India and Qatar, together with controls, to compare genetic risk factors for stroke between European, South Asian and Middle Eastern populations." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24175068", IAO:0000119="PMID:37706299"}
