[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001068
name: CLOZUK study
def: "A sample of people in the United Kingdom with treatment-resistant schizophrenia who were prescribed clozapine, whose anonymised blood samples and clinical monitoring data were obtained through the clozapine monitoring services, first in collaboration with Novartis and later through the Zaponex Treatment Access System (second wave 2013–15, third wave 2019–21), for Cardiff University's genetic studies of schizophrenia and clozapine metabolism." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36804072", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22614287"}
