[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001070
name: Combined Small Datasets Collection
def: "A harmonized dataset of the Alzheimer's Disease Genetics Consortium that merges six separately ascertained datasets or dataset waves of Alzheimer's disease cases and cognitively normal elders (BIOCARD, CHAP2, EAS, RMAYO, ROSMAP2 and WASHU2), each too small to be analysed on its own, so that they can be analysed together in common-variant association studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:42237039"}
