id: coho:COHO_0001083
name: Genotek COVID-19 study
def: "Participants of the COVID-19 genetic studies of the Russian genetic testing company Genotek: its customers who consented to research use of their data and answered online questionnaires about COVID-19, studied for long COVID and, when aged 40 or over with non-severe COVID-19, as controls in a genome-wide association study of severe COVID-19 whose cases were patients hospitalised in Moscow and Ufa." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40399555", IAO:0000119="PMID:39364016"}
