[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001085
name: Graz Stroke Study
def: "A hospital-based series of patients with ischaemic stroke admitted to the stroke unit of the Department of Neurology of the Medical University of Graz, Austria, investigated with brain imaging and a standardised diagnostic protocol and subtyped by stroke neurologists, whose cases are compared in genetic studies of ischaemic stroke with participants of the Austrian Stroke Prevention Study from the same catchment area as controls." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24021684", IAO:0000119="PMID:23041239"}
