[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001086
name: Head and Neck 5000
def: "A prospective clinical cohort of people newly diagnosed with head and neck cancer, recruited before treatment at NHS centres across the United Kingdom and coordinated from Bristol, with health, lifestyle, quality-of-life and sexual-history questionnaires, clinical data, blood, saliva and tumour tissue samples and follow-up, set up to evaluate the centralisation of head and neck cancer care and as a biomedical resource for translational and prognostic research." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25519023"}
