[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001089
name: International Collaboration for the Genomics of HIV
def: "An international collaboration of the HIV host genetics community, established to combine all available genome-wide SNP data sets on people living with HIV-1 worldwide, which pools genotype and clinical data from HIV cohorts and studies in North America, Europe, Australia and Africa, many of them natural-history cohorts, to study host genetic influences on HIV-1 acquisition, viral load and spontaneous control." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37097752", IAO:0000119="PMID:23935489"}
