id: coho:COHO_0001090
name: International Endometriosis Genetics Consortium
def: "An international consortium of research groups studying the genetics of endometriosis, which pools genome-wide association data from studies in Europe, the United States, Australia and Japan, with cases identified by surgical confirmation, medical records or self-report, in meta-analyses of endometriosis risk." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36914876", IAO:0000119="PMID:32423502", IAO:0000119="PMID:42056605"}
