relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Italy {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2761731/fullTextXML", comment="The aim of the present study is to characterize the population isolate of the upper Val Borbera, a large valley localized within the Apennine mountains of Piedmont, in the Northwest of Italy, geographically secluded from the surrounding areas."}
