[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001093
name: Karolinska Mammography Project for Risk Prediction of Breast Cancer
def: "A prospective cohort of women recruited in 2011–2013 when attending mammography screening or clinical mammography at four hospitals in Sweden (in Stockholm, Helsingborg, Lund and Landskrona), with questionnaires, mammograms, blood samples and linkage to Swedish health registers, established to determine how mammographic density, genetic factors and lifestyle influence breast cancer risk and to build risk prediction models for individualised prevention and screening." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28180256"}
