id: coho:COHO_0001094
name: Kathleen Cuningham Foundation Consortium for Research into Familial Breast Cancer
def: "A research resource of epidemiological, family-history, lifestyle and clinical data and biospecimens collected since 1997 from affected and unaffected members of families with multiple cases of breast and/or ovarian cancer, recruited by research nurses through family cancer clinics in Australia and New Zealand, and made available to researchers anywhere in the world for studies of familial breast cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:16507150", IAO:0000119="https://www.kconfab.org/"}
