[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001099
name: Minnesota Breast Cancer Family Study
def: "A historical cohort of multigenerational families in Minnesota, United States, ascertained through a consecutive, family-history-unselected series of breast cancer probands diagnosed from 1944 to 1952 at the University of Minnesota, followed up by telephone interview and mailed questionnaire to measure cancer incidence and risk factors in their relatives (sisters, daughters, granddaughters, nieces and marry-ins)." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:35414113", IAO:0000119="PMID:10613336", dcterms:contributor="Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
