id: coho:COHO_0001100
name: Middlesex County Ischemic Stroke Study
def: "A prospective hospital-based registry of adults with ischaemic stroke, of any ethnic or racial group, admitted through the emergency room to the dedicated stroke unit of the New Jersey Neuroscience Institute at JFK Medical Center in Edison, New Jersey, United States, which enrolled first-ever and recurrent strokes of any severity from 2000 to 2009 with standardised investigations and TOAST subtyping; one of the genetic research centres of the Stroke Genetics Network." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24021684", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0058-3/MediaObjects/41588_2018_58_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
