[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001103
name: Melanoma Institute Australia cohort
def: "A cohort of patients with histopathologically confirmed cutaneous melanoma managed at Melanoma Institute Australia in Sydney, Australia, identified with written informed consent from the institute's Biospecimen Bank and Research Database, whose germline DNA was genotyped genome-wide in phases from 2014 and who are followed prospectively for outcomes including death from melanoma, ascertained from clinical records and linkage to Australian cancer registries." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36064556", IAO:0000119="PMID:32716505"}
