[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001135
name: CALGB 90401
def: "A randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled phase III trial designed by the Cancer and Leukemia Group B and endorsed by the Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group that enrolled men with chemotherapy-naive progressive metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer at participating institutions in the United States between May 2005 and December 2007, comparing docetaxel and prednisone with or without bevacizumab, with overall survival as the primary end point." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22454414", IAO:0000119="https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT00110214"}
