[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001138
name: 23Mofang cohort
def: "A research cohort of customers of 23Mofang (Chengdu 23Mofang Biotechnology Co., Ltd.), a Chinese direct-to-consumer genetic testing company, who were genotyped through its personal genome service and consented to the research use of their genotypes and of traits they self-reported in the company's web-based surveys." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30899065", IAO:0000119="PMID:42009823"}
