[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001139
name: 3D Facial Norms cohort
def: "A normative craniofacial study begun in 2009 as part of the FaceBase Consortium of the US National Institute of Dental and Craniofacial Research, which recruited healthy people aged 3 to 40 of self-reported European ancestry and without craniofacial conditions at four US sites (Pittsburgh, Seattle, Houston and Iowa City), collecting 3D facial surface images, anthropometric measurements, a demographic questionnaire and saliva DNA for genome-wide genotyping, and shares the data through a web-based repository." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26492185", IAO:0000119="PMID:27110347"}
