[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001140
name: 4D-SZ cohort
def: "A multi-omics cohort of adult Chinese volunteers in Shenzhen, China, run by BGI-Shenzhen and recruited largely at annual physical examinations from 2017 (some gave samples from 2015), with sampling repeated over time. It combines whole-genome sequencing, metagenomes of the gut, mouth and other body sites, plasma metabolites, medical tests and questionnaires on diet and lifestyle, to study how host genetics and environment shape the microbiome and health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34873157", IAO:0000119="PMID:34118463", IAO:0000119="PMID:33563976"}
