[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001144
name: African Research on Kidney Disease
def: "A study of kidney function in adults with and without chronic kidney disease in sub-Saharan Africa, run by the African Research on Kidney Disease collaboration within existing population cohorts in Malawi (Karonga and Lilongwe), South Africa (the Agincourt health and demographic surveillance site) and Uganda (the General Population Cohort). It measured glomerular filtration rate by iohexol plasma clearance to test equations for estimating it, with serial biobanking, cross-sectionally in Malawi and Uganda and longitudinally in South Africa." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35839814", IAO:0000119="PMID:31941441"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
synonym: "African Research into Kidney Diseases" RELATED []
synonym: "African Research Kidney Disease study" RELATED []
synonym: "African Research on Kidney Disease Study" RELATED []
synonym: "ARK" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
