[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001153
name: California and Uganda Prostate Cancer Study
def: "A case–control study of prostate cancer in men of African ancestry, genotyped on the Illumina H3Africa array. It combines African American cases from Los Angeles, California, identified through the SEER cancer registry, and cancer-free controls from the African American Eye Disease Study in Inglewood, California, with incident cases and controls from other clinics at Mulago Hospital in Kampala, Uganda." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33398198", IAO:0000119="PMID:29580111", IAO:0000119="PMID:37945903"}
