def: "A Johns Hopkins University study that enrolled people with cystic fibrosis both with and without cystic fibrosis-related diabetes; its participants are among those whose genomes were sequenced by the Cystic Fibrosis Genome Project." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36206743", IAO:0000119="PMID:35647563", IAO:0000119="PMID:38536042"}
