relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sweden {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3012192/fullTextXML", comment="Sixteen fasting glucose-raising loci were genotyped in middle-aged adults from the Gene x Lifestyle interactions And Complex traits Involved in Elevated disease Risk (GLACIER) Study, a population-based prospective cohort study from northern Sweden."}
