[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001179
name: Genetic Modifier Study
def: "A case-control study of genetic modifiers of cystic fibrosis lung disease, led by the University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill and Case Western Reserve University, that enrolled unrelated patients homozygous for F508del whose lung function for age was at either extreme (severe or mild disease) from cystic fibrosis centres across the United States, together with a smaller population-based sample from children's hospitals in Denver, Wisconsin and Boston." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26417704", IAO:0000119="PMID:20681990", IAO:0000119="PMID:21602797", IAO:0000119="PMID:16207846"}
