[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001188
name: Hong Kong Diabetes Register
def: "A prospective register of patients with diabetes, with a biobank, established in 1995 by the Chinese University of Hong Kong at its teaching hospital, the Prince of Wales Hospital, as a research-driven quality-improvement programme. Patients referred by hospital specialty clinics, community clinics and general practitioners to the hospital's Diabetes Mellitus and Endocrine Centre were enrolled consecutively for a structured assessment of complications and metabolic control and then followed until death, to study the risk factors, complications and outcomes of diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40171472", IAO:0000119="PMID:32722720"}
