[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001189
name: HostSeq initiative
def: "A pan-Canadian databank set up in 2020 by CGEn, Canada's national platform for genome sequencing and analysis, within Genome Canada's Canadian COVID-19 Genomics Network, that brings together independent clinical and epidemiological studies enrolling people of any age infected with SARS-CoV-2 across Canada. Each partner study contributes blood (rarely saliva) samples for whole-genome sequencing at the CGEn centres and clinical information on a standard case report form, creating a resource for research on host genetic factors in SARS-CoV-2 infection and COVID-19 outcomes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37131148", IAO:0000119="PMID:38517939"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
