id: coho:COHO_0001192
name: HypnoLaus Sleep Cohort Study
def: "A population-based sleep cohort nested in the CoLaus/PsyCoLaus study of Lausanne, Switzerland: consecutive participants of CoLaus/PsyCoLaus's first follow-up (2009–12), who also answered sleep questionnaires and had clinical and biological phenotyping, were invited from September 2009 to June 2013 to a full polysomnography at home, organised from the sleep centre of Lausanne University Hospital, to study the prevalence and determinants of sleep disorders such as sleep-disordered breathing and their links with cardiometabolic and mental health. Participants were re-examined at the cohort's second follow-up in 2014–17." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:30898062", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25682233", IAO:0000119="PMID:35861817"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
