id: coho:COHO_0001205
name: MedStar
def: "A hospital-based case-control study designed for biomarker and genetic studies of coronary artery disease, which from August 2004 to March 2007 recruited patients with and without angiographic coronary artery disease undergoing cardiac catheterisation at the Washington Hospital Center, Washington, DC, United States, with support from the MedStar Research Institute." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21239051", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21378990"}
