[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001206
name: Melanoma in Southern Sweden
def: "A prospective population-based cohort of Swedish-born women aged 25–64 without a history of cancer, randomly selected from the population registry of the southern Swedish healthcare region and recruited in 1990–1992, who answered a baseline questionnaire on sun exposure habits, constitutional characteristics and other risk factors for melanoma and follow-up questionnaires every ten years, with cancer incidence and mortality followed through Swedish national registers. It was set up to study risk factors for melanoma and is also used to study the health effects of sun exposure." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:31663602", IAO:0000119="PMID:37675201", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40102189"}
