property_value: coho:numberOfParticipants "30000" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="twins and family members in the population-based registry (approximate), 2019", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31466551+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="The MSUTR has two broad components: a large-scale, population-based registry of child, adolescent, and adult twins and their families (current N ~30,000) and a series of more focused and in-depth studies drawn from the registry (projected N ~7200)."}
