[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001209
name: Myositis Genetics Consortium
def: "An international consortium of myositis research centres through which DNA samples with clinical and autoantibody data from patients of European ancestry with idiopathic inflammatory myopathies (adult and juvenile polymyositis and dermatomyositis, and inclusion body myositis) were collected at participating centres in Europe, the United States and Australia, including national collections such as the UK Adult Onset Myositis Immunogenetic Collaboration, for genome-wide and Immunochip association studies of myositis and its clinical and serological subgroups, analysed against controls supplied by other disease consortia." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36580032", IAO:0000119="PMID:26362759", IAO:0000119="PMID:29884237"}
