[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001214
name: Linxian General Population Nutrition Intervention Trial
def: "A randomized, double-blind primary prevention trial of the Cancer Institute of the Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences and the US National Cancer Institute in Linxian, Henan province, China, a rural county with some of the world's highest rates of oesophageal and gastric cardia cancer, which in 1985 enrolled healthy adults aged 40–69 from four communes in northern Linxian and gave them daily combinations of vitamins and minerals or placebo in a fractional factorial design from March 1986 to May 1991. Its participants have since been followed as a prospective cohort for cancer incidence and cause-specific mortality." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:7960367", IAO:0000119="PMID:34022824", IAO:0000119="PMID:38282387", IAO:0000119="PMID:35224031"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
synonym: "Linxian Nutrition Intervention Trial" RELATED []
synonym: "NIT" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
