[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001220
name: University of Pennsylvania Catheterization Study
def: "A hospital-based study of genes and biomarkers for coronary artery disease at the University of Pennsylvania Medical Center, United States, which from July 1998 to March 2003 recruited consecutive patients undergoing cardiac catheterisation and coronary angiography. A nested case-control genome-wide association study of angiographic coronary artery disease in its white patients is one of the core studies of the CARDIoGRAM consortium." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26343929", IAO:0000119="PMID:21239051", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19287092"}
