[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001222
name: Karolinska Mammography Project for Risk Prediction of Breast Cancer - Case-Control Study
def: "A Swedish breast cancer case-control study, known as prevalent KARMA, that combines women diagnosed with primary breast cancer in Stockholm between 2001 and 2008, identified through the regional cancer register for the LIBRO-1 study, with breast-cancer-free women from the Karolinska Mammography Project for Risk Prediction of Breast Cancer (KARMA) cohort as controls, all of whom gave blood samples, and whose genotypes contribute to the Breast Cancer Association Consortium's studies of breast cancer risk." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24943594", IAO:0000119="PMID:28725034", IAO:0000119="PMID:38366028"}
