[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001224
name: Predictors For ECT
def: "A Swedish study that between 2013 and 2017 recruited adults who had received electroconvulsive therapy (ECT) recorded in the Swedish National Quality Register for ECT, inviting registered patients by letter to a telephone interview and blood sampling and recruiting others at Swedish psychiatric hospitals before an ECT series, and that links their DNA, stored at the Karolinska Institutet Biobank, to the register's data on each treatment series, to study predictors of ECT outcome, including genetic ones, and the genetics of severe depressive episodes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36069021", IAO:0000119="PMID:33483693"}
