def: "A breast cancer case-control genetics study, led from Vanderbilt University, that genotyped Chinese women with breast cancer and controls drawn from four population-based studies in urban Shanghai, China: the Shanghai Breast Cancer Study, the Shanghai Breast Cancer Survival Study, the Shanghai Women's Health Study and, for controls only, the Shanghai Endometrial Cancer Study." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000799.v1.p1", IAO:0000119="PMID:32139696", IAO:0000119="PMID:35395775"}
