[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001230
name: Scandinavian Lymphoma Etiology study
def: "A population-based case-control study of the causes of malignant lymphomas (non-Hodgkin lymphoma, including chronic lymphocytic leukaemia, and Hodgkin lymphoma) among residents of Denmark and Sweden aged 18–74, recruited in 1999–2002, with incident cases identified shortly after diagnosis through a rapid case-ascertainment network and controls sampled from the national population registers, and with a telephone interview and blood sampling." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21037568", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15687363", IAO:0000119="PMID:25294155"}
