[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001233
name: Scottish Diabetes Research Network Type 1 Bioresource
def: "A cohort of adults aged 16 or older with a clinical diagnosis of type 1 diabetes, latent autoimmune diabetes of adulthood or monogenic diabetes, recruited mainly at diabetes outpatient clinics across Scotland between December 2010 and November 2013, whose biosamples were banked and genotyped and who are followed through linkage to national electronic health records, set up to study the genetic determinants, biomarkers and complications of type 1 diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:42274395", IAO:0000119="PMID:28338705"}
