id: coho:COHO_0001242
name: Type 1 Diabetes TrialNet
def: "A cohort of people with or at risk of type 1 diabetes recruited since 2001 by Type 1 Diabetes TrialNet, an international network of clinical research centres established by the US National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases: chiefly relatives of people with type 1 diabetes who are screened for islet autoantibodies and followed for progression in its Pathway to Prevention natural-history study, and people at risk of or newly diagnosed with type 1 diabetes enrolled in its trials aimed at delaying or preventing the disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40272284"}
