[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001243
name: UCI Breast Cancer Study
def: "A population-based breast cancer case-control study run from the University of California, Irvine, whose cases were breast cancer patients diagnosed in Orange County, California, in the year from March 1994, ascertained through the population-based Cancer Surveillance Program of Orange County and enrolled as probands in the UCI population-based breast and ovarian cancer family registry, and whose controls were Orange County residents recruited in 1998–2003 by random digit dialling and frequency-matched to cases by age and race/ethnicity." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21194473", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:10667470", IAO:0000119="PMID:22267197", IAO:0000119="PMID:10882857"}
