[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001247
name: VHIR-FMT-Barcelona
def: "A case-control collection from Barcelona, Spain, of European-ancestry patients with non-lacunar ischaemic stroke confirmed by neuroimaging within 7 days, a subset of those enrolled in the Genetic contribution to functional Outcome and Disability after Stroke (GODS) project, and of controls over 40 years old without ischaemic stroke, collected in Barcelona primary care centres and Spanish network hospitals for the ISSYS and GRECOS studies, genotyped together and used as a case-control set in ischaemic stroke genome-wide association studies." [] {IAO:0000119="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0058-3/MediaObjects/41588_2018_58_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26708676"}
