[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001259
name: Northern Ireland GRID Collection
def: "A collection of people with type 1 diabetes from Northern Ireland, most of them diagnosed in childhood. It is analysed separately from the Genetic Resource Investigating Diabetes (GRID) cases of Great Britain, and its DNA was genotyped on the ImmunoChip at the University of Virginia under the Type 1 Diabetes Genetics Consortium grant for genetic studies of type 1 diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28983737", IAO:0000119="PMID:34127860"}
