[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001260
name: Genome-wide assessment of the gene variants associated with severe COVID-19 phenotype in Iran
def: "A case-control genetic association study of COVID-19 severity in Iran, based at Shariati Hospital, Tehran University of Medical Sciences. It genotyped people of Middle Eastern ancestry hospitalised with COVID-19, and controls, on the Illumina Global Screening Array, and contributed them to the COVID-19 Host Genetics Initiative's meta-analyses of COVID-19 severity and of long COVID." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35922517", IAO:0000119="PMID:40399555"}
