[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001261
name: Northern Ireland Young Hearts Project
def: "A longitudinal study of cardiovascular disease risk factors in young people in Northern Ireland, which screened a random sample of 12- and 15-year-olds from post-primary schools in 1989–1990, re-examined the younger group at age 15 in 1992–1993, and invited the whole sample back for examination as young adults in 1997–1999. A second school sample of 12- and 15-year-olds was surveyed in 1999–2001 as Young Hearts 2000." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20864003", IAO:0000119="PMID:15462676"}
