[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001262
name: Active Life Expectancy, Ageing, and Disability Related to Obesity Study
def: "A longitudinal study of community-dwelling people aged 60 years and older in Santiago, Chile, designed to study disability and dementia associated with obesity. It follows three cohorts: Santiago participants of the SABE survey, born before 1940 and first recruited in 1999–2000; people born in 1940–1948, recruited from public primary health care centre registries in 2005–2008; and people of high socioeconomic status selected from private health insurance registries." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36013179", IAO:0000119="PMID:33883888", IAO:0000119="PMID:22286726", IAO:0000119="PMID:35887574"}
