[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001266
name: SweCovid study
def: "A study of patients with critical COVID-19 admitted from March 2020 to the intensive care unit of Uppsala University Hospital, Sweden, who were enrolled in the prospective observational PronMed cohort and invited to follow-up three to six months after discharge, in which researchers at Uppsala University and Karolinska Institutet investigate the mechanisms of acute and long-term organ dysfunction in critical COVID-19, including its host genetics." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36271419", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.scilifelab.se/news/uppsala-researchers-contributes-to-the-global-covid-19-host-genetics-initiative/", IAO:0000119="PMID:34597274", IAO:0000119="PMID:35052684"}
