[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001270
name: Mount Sinai COVID-19 Biobank
def: "A research biobank of patients hospitalised with COVID-19 in the Mount Sinai Health System in New York City, enrolled from April to June 2020 through daily review of new admissions together with a smaller group of healthy and hospitalised controls, whose blood was sampled repeatedly alongside routine clinical draws during their hospital stay for multi-omic study of the host response to SARS-CoV-2, and whose survivors were later surveyed for post-acute sequelae of COVID-19." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32719485", IAO:0000119="PMID:36482101"}
