id: coho:COHO_0001275
name: Asian Genetic Epidemiology Network
def: "A consortium of genetic epidemiology studies of type 2 diabetes and related traits in people of East Asian ancestry, mostly population-, hospital- or family-based cohorts in East and South-East Asia, which meta-analyses its member studies' genome-wide association results in trait-specific groups (such as AGEN-T2D and AGEN-BP) for type 2 diabetes, glycaemic traits, adiposity, adiponectin, blood pressure and kidney function." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:24647736", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32499647", IAO:0000119="PMID:37859345", IAO:0000119="PMID:22797727", IAO:0000119="PMID:23105927"}
