relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A42461483+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="Nested within the AIDS Linked to the IntraVenous Experience (ALIVE) study, an ongoing community-based cohort of former and current PWID in Baltimore, Maryland, we conducted an ego-centric drug use network survey among n = 237 PWID who reported any injection drug use in the last 12 months from across the metropolitan region in 2018-2019 and examined prospective associations between network geography and injection drug use, sharing, and non-fatal overdose at 6-month follow-up visits."}
