[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001277
name: Australian Melanoma Family Study
def: "A multicentre, population-based case-control-family study in Australia, recruiting people with early-onset first-primary cutaneous melanoma, population-based and spouse or friend controls, and their relatives, between 2001 and 2005, to investigate genetic and environmental influences on melanoma risk." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19887461"}
