id: coho:COHO_0001281
name: Assessment of Renal and Cervical Artery DysplasIA
def: "A prospective national registry, sponsored by Assistance Publique–Hôpitaux de Paris and coordinated at the Hôpital Européen Georges Pompidou in Paris, of adults with renal, cervical or intracranial artery fibromuscular dysplasia recruited from 2009 to 2014 at 16 university hospitals in France and Belgium, with standardised clinical and imaging data and leukocyte DNA collected to study multisite disease and to search for susceptibility genes." [] {IAO:0000119="https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT02884141", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33998257", IAO:0000119="PMID:34654805"}
