[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001283
name: The Ashkenazi Jewish Dataset
def: "A case-control sample of people of Ashkenazi Jewish ancestry from the New York area, with Parkinson's disease cases recruited at the Center for Parkinson's Disease and Other Movement Disorders at Columbia University and controls evaluated in the same way, assembled from two Columbia University studies, the Genetic Epidemiology of PD study (PD EPI) and the AJ Study, for a genome-wide association study of Parkinson's disease." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21812969", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
