[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001284
name: Assessment, Serial Evaluation, and Subsequent Sequelae of Acute Kidney Injury Study
def: "A prospective, matched cohort study, funded by the US National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases, that enrolled hospitalised adults with and without acute kidney injury (AKI), matched on clinical research centre, pre-admission chronic kidney disease and other risk factors, at centres in the United States and Canada between December 2009 and February 2015, together with children undergoing cardiac surgery, and followed them after discharge to examine how an episode of AKI affects the development and progression of chronic kidney disease, cardiovascular events and death." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:32707221", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20799966"}
