[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001285
name: Age-related diseases: Understanding Genetic and non-genetic influences - a study at the University of Regensburg
def: "A population-based cohort of mobile people aged 70 and over from the city and county of Regensburg in eastern Bavaria, Germany, invited from random samples of the local residents' registries and examined at the University Hospital Regensburg in two baseline surveys (2013–2015 and 2017–2019), with interviews, medical and eye examinations, biobanking and genotyping and later follow-up, set up by the University of Regensburg as a research platform for late-onset chronic diseases and their genetic and non-genetic causes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26489512", IAO:0000119="PMID:37721739"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
