[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001287
name: Biology, Affect, Stress, Imaging and Cognition study
def: "A population-based prospective cohort of pregnant women in Uppsala County, Sweden, invited at their routine ultrasound examination at gestational week 16–18 at Uppsala University Hospital from September 2009 to November 2018 and followed to one year postpartum with web surveys, biological samples and medical-record data, to study the biopsychosocial causes and predictors of perinatal depression." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31641004"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
