relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe
property_value: coho:numberOfParticipants "14223" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="persons examined at the first examination (1976-1978)", xref="PMID:26779513", comment="Of the original 14,223 examined at the first examination 3,092 (21.7%) have been examined in all four examinations, and of the 5,106 non-responders from the first survey in 1976–1978, 1,698 responded and were examined in one or more of the following surveys."}
