[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001303
name: Chinese Keratoconus Cohort Study
def: "A hospital-based, dynamic, longitudinal prospective cohort of patients with keratoconus, established at Henan Eye Hospital in Zhengzhou, China, which since January 2019 has enrolled patients from a large geographical area, collecting questionnaire data on demographics, lifestyle, eye rubbing, medical, surgical and family history and visual function, eye and general examinations, biological specimens and data on patients' first-degree relatives, with follow-up at 3, 6 and 12 months and yearly thereafter, to study genes, environment and their interaction in keratoconus progression and its prevention." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:38703249", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39186261", IAO:0000119="PMID:40642536"}
