[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001313
name: Diabetes Gene Discovery Group
def: "A French case–control sample of people of European ancestry assembled for a genome-wide association study of type 2 diabetes: people with type 2 diabetes, a family history of diabetes in first-degree relatives and a BMI below 30, recruited at the CNRS UMR8090 unit in Lille and the Endocrinology-Diabetology Department of the Corbeil-Essonnes Hospital, and normoglycaemic controls drawn mostly from the D.E.S.I.R. cohort of volunteers attending French health examination centres." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:17293876", IAO:0000119="PMID:35551307", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fnature05616/MediaObjects/41586_2007_BFnature05616_MOESM286_ESM.pdf"}
