[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001314
name: Diabetes Multi-omic Investigation of Drug Response
def: "A diverse cohort of adults with type 2 diabetes who are members of the Henry Ford Health System with pharmacy-covered health insurance and live in southeast Michigan and the Detroit metropolitan area, invited on the basis of two or more recorded diagnoses of type 2 diabetes and an HbA1c of at least 6.5%, who at enrolment completed a research survey, clinical examination and specimen collection, and whose genome-wide genotypes are linked to longitudinal electronic records of laboratory results and medication fills to study the genetics of response to diabetes drugs." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37639712"}
