id: coho:COHO_0001320
name: Estudo Longitudinal de Saúde do Adulto
def: "A multicentre cohort of active and retired employees aged 35–74 years of six Brazilian universities and research institutions, with study centres in state capitals of north-eastern, south-eastern and southern Brazil, examined at baseline in 2008–2010 and at later visits and followed by annual telephone interviews, to investigate the development of chronic diseases, primarily diabetes and cardiovascular diseases." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24585730"}
