property_value: coho:numberOfControls "2934" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="suspected Burkitt lymphoma cases and population controls enrolled 2010-2016", xref="PMID:31054214", comment="We therefore conducted a population-based case-control study of eBL in children aged 0-15 years old in six regions in Northern Uganda, Northern Tanzania and Western Kenya, enrolling 862 suspected cases and 2,934 population controls (response rates 98.5-100%), and processing ~40,000 vials of samples using standardized protocols."}
