[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001323
name: FActeurs de RIsque et de récidives de la maladie thromboembolique Veineuse
def: "A French multicentre case-control study of venous thromboembolism, run in 11 centres from 2003 to 2009, that enrolled consecutive adult inpatients and outpatients treated for a first objectively documented deep vein thrombosis and/or pulmonary embolism, without active cancer or malignancy in the previous 5 years, whose blood was mostly sampled in the week after diagnosis, and hospital controls matched for age, sex and centre with no history of venous or arterial thrombosis; the patients were also followed prospectively, to study risk factors for a first venous thromboembolism and for its recurrence." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:19967159", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37286573", IAO:0000119="PMID:36002395", IAO:0000119="PMID:35463779", IAO:0000119="PMID:37399490"}
