[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001325
name: FinDonor 10 000 study
def: "A prospective cohort of whole-blood donors aged 18–70 recruited by the Finnish Red Cross Blood Service alongside standard donation at three fixed donation sites in the Helsinki metropolitan area of Finland (Kivihaka, Sanomatalo and Espoo) from May 2015 to December 2017, with blood samples taken at their donation visits during the study for blood counts, CRP, ferritin and soluble transferrin receptor and for DNA, and health and lifestyle questionnaires at enrolment and again in 2018, to study iron status and the genetic and lifestyle factors affecting iron stores in blood donors." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31657023"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
synonym: "FinDonor" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
