[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001332
name: Genetic Analysis of Psoriasis Consortium
def: "An international consortium of psoriasis genetics research groups in the United Kingdom, Ireland, Austria, Finland, Germany, Italy, the Netherlands, Spain and Sweden, with a management committee chaired from King's College London, that pools its members' collections of people of European descent with psoriasis vulgaris, together with controls from national control collections, for genetic association studies of psoriasis, including a genome-wide association study with the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium 2 and an Immunochip case–control study." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20953190", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2467/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2467_MOESM43_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:23143594"}
