relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/China {xref="https://www.genetics-osteoarthritis.com/contributing-studies/contributing-studies/index.html", comment="The China Kadoorie Biobank (CKB) is a prospective cohort of 512,000 adults aged 30-79 years, recruited from ten rural and urban areas of China during 2004-2008."}
