relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Iceland {xref="https://www.genetics-osteoarthritis.com/contributing-studies/contributing-studies/index.html", comment="The deCODE genetics osteoarthritis study is an ongoing population based study in Iceland that was initiated in 1997."}
