[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001343
name: Global Parkinson's Genetics Program
def: "A worldwide programme, the first resource project of the Aligning Science Across Parkinson's initiative, that genotypes and sequences people with Parkinson's disease, and some controls, from existing and newly collected patient and cohort collections, working with established Parkinson's disease consortia and focusing on populations under-represented in genetic research, and shares the harmonised data to find genetic causes of and risk factors for typical and monogenic Parkinson's disease." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:37633302", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33513272"}
