[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001344
name: Genomic Research on Asthma in the African Diaspora
def: "A case-control collection of self-reported African American children and adults with physician-diagnosed asthma and non-asthmatic controls from the Baltimore–Washington, DC metropolitan area, brought together by the Genomic Research on Asthma in the African Diaspora consortium from eight NIH-funded asthma studies and one study of healthy African Americans, to study genetic contributions to asthma and its disparities in people of African descent." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34536413", IAO:0000119="PMID:30787307", IAO:0000119="PMID:19910028"}
