[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001349
name: Guangzhou Colorectal Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of colorectal cancer in Guangzhou, China. Its cases are patients with histopathologically confirmed colorectal cancer recruited at Sun Yat-sen University Cancer Center between 2002 and 2012, and its controls are cancer-free men and women recruited in the same period from the physical examination centres of several large hospitals in Guangdong. Its four case-control collections (Guangzhou-1 to Guangzhou-4) were genotyped for genome-wide association studies of colorectal cancer in East Asians." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23263487", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2985/MediaObjects/41588_2014_BFng2985_MOESM57_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:24836286"}
