[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001351
name: Hordaland Health Study
def: "A population-based health study of residents of Hordaland County in Western Norway, begun in 1992-93 as the Hordaland Homocysteine Study by the Norwegian Health Screening Service, the University of Bergen and the Municipal Health Service in Hordaland, which invited residents by year of birth and place of residence, re-examined part of them together with further birth cohorts in 1997-99, and since 2018 has re-examined those born in 1950-51 who took part in both surveys, to study chronic diseases such as cardiovascular disease, cancer, osteoporosis, anxiety and depression and their prevention." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:38671141", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="http://husk.w.uib.no", IAO:0000119="https://husk-en.w.uib.no/"}
