[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001355
name: Health and Prevention Enhancement
def: "A retrospective, population-based cohort of Koreans who had health check-ups at the Healthcare System Gangnam Center of Seoul National University Hospital in Seoul, South Korea, from October 2003, with repeated check-up data, advanced diagnostic imaging and record linkage for cancer and death, designed to investigate the association of diagnostic imaging results and biomarkers with the predisease stage of non-communicable diseases such as cancers and metabolic diseases in an average-risk population." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29674364"}
