id: coho:COHO_0001357
name: International Stuttering Project
def: "A continually recruiting collection of people with clinically ascertained developmental stuttering, assembled by the International Stuttering Project, a collaboration of researchers and clinicians in the United States, Australia and Ireland formed in 2020 to illuminate the genetic aetiology of stuttering, which recruits through stuttering clinics, research laboratories and stuttering associations in these countries and online and genotypes its participants at Vanderbilt University Medical Center." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.theinternationalstutteringproject.com/", IAO:0000119="PMID:35047858", IAO:0000119="PMID:34861174"}
