[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001360
name: Indiana University-Purdue University Indianapolis cohort
def: "A collection of 3D facial images, self-reported age, height, weight and ancestry, and DNA from volunteers recruited without restriction on ancestry (minors with a parent's or guardian's consent) in Indianapolis, Indiana and in Twinsburg, Ohio under one Indiana University-Purdue University Indianapolis ethics protocol, with support from the US National Institute of Justice, and genotyped to study the genetics of facial shape and of other visible traits such as head hair shape." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33288918", IAO:0000119="PMID:29220522", IAO:0000119="PMID:33692830"}
