property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:35765848" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Developing and validating polygenic risk scores for colorectal cancer risk prediction in East Asians.", xref="PMID:35765848", xref="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9509464/", comment="Data from the Korean-National Cancer Center CRC Study (Korea validation set: a case-control study including 622 cases and 832 controls) and a case-control study nested in cohorts of the Shanghai Men’s Health Study and Shanghai Women’s Health Study (China validation set: 868 cases and 868 age- and sex-frequency matched controls) were used for model validation."}
