[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001367
name: Lung Oncology Research & Discovery
def: "An ongoing single-site, case-only cohort of patients who have undergone lung cancer surgery since 1999 at the Quebec Heart and Lung Institute (Institut universitaire de cardiologie et de pneumologie de Québec – Université Laval) in Quebec City, Canada, with diagnoses confirmed by pathology of the resected specimens, clinical data and consent to the institute's biobank, assembled by a translational research programme towards precision medicine in lung cancer and used for germline genetic and tumour molecular studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38970920", IAO:0000119="PMID:40209611"}
