[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001374
name: Myeloma XI trial
def: "A UK open-label, randomised, phase 3 adaptive-design trial for patients with newly diagnosed multiple myeloma at 110 National Health Service hospitals in England, Wales and Scotland, recruiting from 2010, which assigned patients by age and fitness to intensive (transplantation) or non-intensive pathways and had three randomisation stages, including induction regimens and lenalidomide maintenance against observation." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30559051"}
