id: coho:COHO_0001387
name: Pancreatic Cancer Case-Control Consortium
def: "An international consortium that pools data from case-control studies of pancreatic cancer, conducted in North America, Europe, China and Australia, to study risk factors such as tobacco and alcohol use, diabetes and pancreatitis; cases and controls from several member studies were also genotyped together for a genome-wide association study of pancreatic cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26098869", IAO:0000119="PMID:26646264", IAO:0000119="PMID:22104574"}
