id: coho:COHO_0001388
name: UPenn Local TGCT Study
def: "A case-control study of inherited susceptibility to testicular germ cell tumour at the University of Pennsylvania, Philadelphia, whose genome-wide association scan compared men with testicular germ cell tumour seen at the University of Pennsylvania Health System or Fox Chase Cancer Center with male controls from the Philadelphia region drawn from the PennCATH study." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:28604732", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs001307.v1.p1", IAO:0000119="PMID:19483682"}
