[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001390
name: PLATelet inhibition and patient Outcomes
def: "An international, phase III, randomised, double-blind trial funded by AstraZeneca that enrolled patients hospitalised with acute coronary syndrome (ST-elevation ACS scheduled for primary percutaneous coronary intervention, or non-ST-elevation ACS) at 862 centres in 43 countries between October 2006 and July 2008, to compare ticagrelor with clopidogrel for preventing death from vascular causes, myocardial infarction and stroke; blood samples from its genetic and biomarker substudies have been used for genome-wide association studies." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:19332184", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21685437", IAO:0000119="PMID:36869765"}
