[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001397
name: REDS-III Brazil Sickle Cell Disease Cohort
def: "A cohort of children and adults with sickle cell disease, randomly sampled from the active patients of six care sites in the Brazilian states of Minas Gerais (Belo Horizonte, Juiz de Fora and Montes Claros), Rio de Janeiro, Pernambuco (Recife) and São Paulo and enrolled in 2013–2015 as the Brazilian component of the NHLBI REDS-III programme, with clinical data, a blood biorepository and genome-wide genotyping, to characterise the clinical and transfusion outcomes of sickle cell disease in Brazil and support genotype–phenotype studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30027669"}
