[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001398
name: Raine Eye Health Study
def: "The eye study of the offspring (Generation 2) of the Raine Study pregnancy cohort in Western Australia, in which participants completed a comprehensive eye assessment at the cohort's 20-year follow-up, including visual acuity, orthoptic assessment, cycloplegic autorefraction, ocular biometry and anterior and posterior segment photography, to determine the prevalence of and risk factors for eye disease in young adults and characterise their ocular biometric parameters." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23301674", IAO:0000119="PMID:36596879"}
