[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001399
name: Racial Variability in Genotypic Determinants of Breast Cancer Risk Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of breast cancer conducted in the Philadelphia and Detroit metropolitan areas of the United States from 1999 to 2003, whose cases, diagnosed with invasive ductal breast cancer within 18 months of recruitment and over-sampled for diagnosis before age 40, were identified in the University of Pennsylvania Health System and the Karmanos Cancer Institute or recruited through local advertisement, with controls without breast cancer recruited in the same way." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:34706928", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-024-01736-4/MediaObjects/41588_2024_1736_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
