id: coho:COHO_0001401
name: Sanford Biobank
def: "A hospital-based biobank of adult patients of Sanford Health, a rural health system of the Upper Midwest of the United States based in Sioux Falls, South Dakota, who since 2011 have elected to provide specimens for research, genotyped on the Illumina Global Screening Array and linked to the health system's clinical records for genetic studies such as of cardiovascular disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/45157534", IAO:0000119="PMID:33777099", IAO:0000119="PMID:41669951"}
