[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001403
name: San Francisco City Clinic Cohort
def: "A cohort of homosexual and bisexual men recruited in 1978–1980 at the San Francisco municipal sexually transmitted disease clinic for studies of sexually transmitted hepatitis B, whose stored serum specimens, follow-up examinations and questionnaires, and linkage to AIDS surveillance and death registries were later used to study the natural history, transmission and cofactors of HIV infection and AIDS." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:2261554", IAO:0000119="PMID:37532928", IAO:0000119="PMID:1546772"}
