[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001405
name: Swiss Kidney Project on Genes in Hypertension
def: "A multicentre family- and population-based study of adults of European descent in Switzerland, in which index participants drawn at random from population samples in the city of Lausanne (the CoLaus study), the canton of Geneva (the Bus Santé study) and the canton of Bern (the cantonal phone directory) were recruited from December 2009 to April 2013 together with their first-degree relatives and re-examined about three years later, to study genetic and environmental determinants of blood pressure, kidney function and other cardiometabolic outcomes; it is the Swiss part of the European Project on Genes in Hypertension." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:41695656", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:41325371", IAO:0000119="PMID:24663506"}
