[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001407
name: Santiago Longitudinal Study
def: "A cohort of healthy, full-term infants from low- to middle-income neighbourhoods of Santiago, Chile, recruited through community clinics in 1991–1996 for an iron-deficiency anaemia preventive trial or a neuromaturation study, and followed up through childhood, adolescence and adulthood in studies of nutrition, development, substance use and cardiometabolic risk." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:35501766", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32499257", IAO:0000119="PMID:34556688", IAO:0000119="PMID:39885687", IAO:0000119="PMID:24662965"}
