id: coho:COHO_0001409
name: Swedish National Myeloma Biobank
def: "A national biobank of samples from patients with multiple myeloma in Sweden, based at Skåne University Hospital in Lund, whose patients' germline DNA has been genotyped for genome-wide association studies of inherited susceptibility to multiple myeloma." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27363682", IAO:0000119="PMID:26007630", IAO:0000119="PMID:31363079"}
