[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001411
name: Hispanic Community Children's Health Study/Study of Latino Youth
def: "An ancillary study of the Hispanic Community Health Study/Study of Latinos that in 2012–2014 enrolled Hispanic/Latino children aged 8–16 whose parents or legal guardians took part in HCHS/SOL, at its field centres in the Bronx, Chicago, Miami and San Diego, United States, to examine how youth's lifestyle behaviours and cardiometabolic risk factors relate to acculturation, parenting and family behaviours, and psychosocial functioning." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39885687", IAO:0000119="PMID:24120345", IAO:0000119="PMID:41294090"}
