relationship: coho:isSubCohortOf coho:COHO_0000388 {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11875162/fullTextXML", comment="The Hispanic Community Children’s Health Study/Study of Latino Youth (SOL Youth) cohort is an ancillary study of the Hispanic Community Health Study/Study of Latinos (HCHS/SOL) that recruited n = 1,466 children aged 8–16 years between 2012 and 2014 whose parents/legal guardians participated in the HCHS/SOL at one of four field centers (Chicago, Bronx, San Diego, and Miami).33 A total of n = 1,073 children were included in GWAS analyses (mean age = 12.00 years)."}
