[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001417
name: Seoul National University Prospectively Enrolled Registry for Renal Cell Carcinoma-Nephrectomy
def: "A prospective, biobank-linked registry at Seoul National University Hospital, South Korea, that since March 2016 has enrolled patients clinically diagnosed with renal cell carcinoma who undergo surgical treatment (ablation, or partial, radical or cytoreductive nephrectomy), collecting standardised clinical, pathological, quality-of-life and survival data and blood and tumour samples stored in the hospital's Human Biobank. It is the nephrectomy sub-cohort of the renal cell carcinoma arm (SUPER-RCC) of the Seoul National University Prospectively Enrolled Registry for Genitourinary Cancer (SUPER-GUC)." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31294132", IAO:0000119="PMID:38200428"}
