[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001418
name: Triple A Barcelona Study
def: "A prospective, hospital-based longitudinal registry, started in 2019, of consecutive individuals with abdominal aortic aneurysm seen at the vascular and endovascular surgery units of the Hospital de la Santa Creu i Sant Pau and the Hospital del Mar in Barcelona, Spain, with aortic diameter measurements by CT or ultrasound, clinical data and DNA, RNA and plasma samples collected at follow-up visits, to study aneurysm growth and its predictors and to inform surveillance intervals." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37845353", IAO:0000119="PMID:40649094"}
