[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001419
name: Trans-National Asthma Genetic Consortium
def: "A consortium of research groups worldwide, established to increase sample sizes for genome-wide association meta-analysis of asthma, that pooled asthma genome-wide association studies of European, African, Japanese and Latino ancestry, among them studies of the GABRIEL, EVE, EAGLE, APCAT, CARe and Australian Asthma Genetics consortia, into a multi-ancestry meta-analysis, with a separate analysis of childhood-onset asthma, to identify asthma risk loci." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29273806"}
subset: coho1:GWAS_subset
synonym: "TAGC" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
