[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001421
name: Brain Bank for Aging Research
def: "A brain bank at the Tokyo Metropolitan Geriatric Hospital and Institute of Gerontology in Tokyo, Japan, which registers, with the consent of relatives, the brains and other tissues of consecutive autopsies of patients of the hospital, which provides community-based general and emergency care to older people, together with their clinical data, for clinicopathological and genetic research on ageing-related neurodegenerative, movement and cognitive disorders." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33150517", IAO:0000119="PMID:26091809", IAO:0000119="PMID:16248404"}
