[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001422
name: Tasmanian Ophthalmic Biobank
def: "A biobank of the Menzies Institute for Medical Research at the University of Tasmania, run with the Royal Hobart Hospital and associated public and private eye clinics in Tasmania, Australia, that collects DNA samples and clinical information from Tasmanian residents diagnosed with a range of eye diseases, and from adults without eye disease recruited from the community as controls, to investigate eye disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34013049", IAO:0000119="PMID:42026177"}
