def: "A prospective longitudinal cohort of patients with Parkinson's disease, collected since 1997 from sequential new referrals to the Department of Neurology at St. Olav's Hospital in Trondheim, Norway (some followed since 1980), most living within about 50 miles of Trondheim, established mainly for genetic studies of Parkinson's disease and followed for disease course, cognition and survival." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34315208", IAO:0000119="PMID:38849413"}
