[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001425
name: Taiwan Super Control Study
def: "A population-based sample of Han Chinese individuals in Taiwan, selected at random from the healthy controls of the Taiwan Han Chinese Cell and Genome Bank, who had been recruited by stratified three-stage probability cluster sampling through the registry of the non-aboriginal townships and city districts of Taiwan. It was genotyped genome-wide with support from the Academia Sinica Genomic Medicine Multicenter Study." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:24647736", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32453789"}
