[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001428
name: Danish T2D Case-Control Study
def: "A type 2 diabetes case-control sample of Danish participants, undertaken by the Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Basic Metabolic Research at the University of Copenhagen, that brings together people from several Danish studies, among them the Vejle Diabetes Biobank, Inter99, Health2006, Health2008 and DanFunD: cases with type 2 diabetes by self-report, anti-diabetic treatment or fasting or 2-hour plasma glucose, and controls with normal fasting and, where measured, 2-hour plasma glucose, genotyped genome-wide for genetic studies of type 2 diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35551307", IAO:0000119="PMID:30297969"}
