[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001429
name: CoFAR Eosinophilic Esophagitis Registry
def: "A registry of children and adults aged 6 months to 65 years with biopsy-confirmed eosinophilic esophagitis, enrolled at a single visit in 2011–2016 at the five US sites of the NIAID-funded Consortium of Food Allergy Research (in New York, North Carolina, Denver, Little Rock and Baltimore), with medical history questionnaires and blood or saliva samples genotyped at Cincinnati Children's Hospital Medical Center, to characterise the disease and establish its genetic basis." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30075341", IAO:0000119="https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT01323803"}
