relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Denmark {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC400669/fullTextXML", comment="All study subjects were identified, recruited, and interviewed through five population-based cancer registries, four in the USA (three Surveillance, Epidemiology and End Results registries, namely Iowa, Los Angeles County [CA], and Seattle [WA], and the Cancer Surveillance Program of Orange County [CA]) and one in Denmark (the Danish Cancer Registry)."}
