[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001436
name: WOBASZ II
def: "A cross-sectional national health examination survey of a random sample of residents of Poland aged over 20, drawn from the national identity card registry by three-stage sampling stratified by voivodeship, type of urbanisation and gender, and examined in 2013–2014 with face-to-face questionnaire interviews, physical examinations and blood samples to assess the prevalence, treatment and control of cardiovascular diseases and their risk factors. It continued the first WOBASZ survey of 2003–2005 with a new, independent sample and was coordinated by the Institute of Cardiology in Warsaw with medical universities in Gdansk, Katowice, Krakow, Lodz and Poznan." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26620680", IAO:0000119="PMID:41144382"}
