id: coho:COHO_0001437
name: Oxford Regional Prospective Study of Childhood Diabetes
def: "A population-based inception cohort of children diagnosed with type 1 diabetes before the age of 16 in the Oxford Health Authority region of the United Kingdom, established in 1986, who were recruited within three months of diagnosis until 1997 and followed prospectively with annual measurements of HbA1c and urinary albumin excretion to determine the natural course of microalbuminuria during childhood and adolescence." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:10097935", IAO:0000119="PMID:18349042"}
