[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001443
name: Defining the Basis of Fibromuscular Dysplasia
def: "An observational case-control study at the Icahn School of Medicine at Mount Sinai, New York, United States, that since 2013 has enrolled adults with fibromuscular dysplasia and, since its expansion, adults with spontaneous coronary artery dissection or cervical artery dissection, together with healthy controls from the general population matched to the fibromuscular dysplasia cases by age and sex, and collects blood (DNA, plasma and serum) and skin-biopsy fibroblasts for a systems-genetics study of the key drivers of these arterial diseases." [] {IAO:0000119="https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT01967511", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31424497", IAO:0000119="PMID:39271816"}
