[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001446
name: Human Reproductive Behaviour Consortium
def: "A consortium of cohort studies that carries out genome-wide association meta-analyses of human reproductive behaviour, such as age at first sex, age at first birth, number of children ever born and childlessness, in people of European ancestry; after a first study of age at first birth and number of children ever born, it meta-analysed cohorts for age at first sex and age at first birth." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34211149"}
