[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001452
name: 100-plus Study
def: "An ongoing prospective cohort study, started in 2013 at the Alzheimer Center Amsterdam (Amsterdam UMC), of Dutch-speaking centenarians in the Netherlands who report being cognitively healthy, as confirmed by an informant, and since 2017 also of their first-degree family members and partners, set up to identify characteristics associated with escaping or delaying cognitive decline. Centenarians are visited at home for interviews, neuropsychological testing and blood sampling, followed annually until death, and offered post-mortem brain donation." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30362018"}
synonym: "100-plus" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "100-plus Study of cognitively healthy centenarians" RELATED []
synonym: "The 100-plus Study of cognitively healthy centenarians" RELATED []
instance_of: coho:COHO_0000000 ! cohort
