[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001459
name: Amsterdam Breast Cancer Study – Familial
def: "The familial arm of the Amsterdam Breast Cancer Study, whose cases are breast cancer patients of any age without a pathogenic BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutation who were counselled and tested from 1995 at the family cancer clinic of the Netherlands Cancer Institute – Antoni van Leeuwenhoek Hospital in Amsterdam, and whose controls are healthy women from the general population recruited through the blood bank. The Breast Cancer Association Consortium lists it as a study separate from the main ABCS." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27424772", IAO:0000119="PMID:32424353", IAO:0000119="PMID:25855707"}
