[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001460
name: Australian Breast Cancer Tissue Bank
def: "A breast cancer biobank, headquartered at the Westmead Institute for Medical Research of the University of Sydney, that since 2005 has collected tumour tissue, blood and linked clinical and follow-up data from consenting patients with breast cancer at collection sites across Australia and provides them for research. It contributes breast cancer cases to the Breast Cancer Association Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30554720", IAO:0000119="PMID:25496151", IAO:0000119="PMID:25855707", IAO:0000119="PMID:31263747"}
