[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001461
name: Anonymous Blood Donor Cohort
def: "A population-based sample of anonymous Danish blood donors used as population controls in genetic studies, contributed under the abbreviation DKctrl, with self-reported anthropometry, to the GIANT consortium's genome-wide meta-analyses of height and body mass index. The study its contributors cite for it recruited its healthy controls among blood donors of the Danish Blood Donor Corps in the Copenhagen area." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36224396", IAO:0000119="PMID:40691366", IAO:0000119="PMID:17849003"}
