[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001462
name: Adelaide Blood Pools
def: "A population-based sample of unrelated adults from Adelaide, Australia, with measured central corneal thickness, whose members in the thinnest and thickest fifths of the distribution had equal volumes of whole blood pooled before DNA extraction and genotyped as case and control pools in a genome-wide association study of central corneal thickness." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20485516"}
