[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001463
name: Aneurysm Consortium
def: "A consortium of investigators in the United Kingdom, Australia and New Zealand formed to carry out a genome-wide association study of abdominal aortic aneurysm (AAA). Its GWAS dataset pools AAA cases with DNA from eight centres in those countries and from the UK Small Aneurysm Trial, recruited from inpatients, outpatient clinics and population screening programmes, and compares them with Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium 2 controls from the 1958 British Birth Cohort and the UK National Blood Service." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18621558", IAO:0000119="PMID:22055160", IAO:0000119="PMID:37845353"}
