property_value: coho:numberOfParticipants "483" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="subjects with two health checkups (1992-1993 and 1998-1999) analysed", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A11889014+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="The aim of the present longitudinal study was to compare the progression of aortic stiffness over a 6-year period in treated hypertensive subjects and normotensive subjects, and to evaluate the determinants of this progression.Methods and resultsData for the present analysis were gathered from 483 subjects who had 2 health checkups at the Centre d'Investigations Préventives et Cliniques, the first one in 1992--1993 and the second one in 1998--1999."}
