property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:26631737" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Genome-wide Association Studies Identify Genetic Loci Associated With Albuminuria in Diabetes.", xref="PMID:26631737", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4764151/fullTextXML", comment="Our study was based on 30 discovery and replication studies mostly from the general population, with the exception of Action in Diabetes and Vascular Disease: Preterax and Diamicron MR Controlled Evaluation (ADVANCE) and Genetics of Diabetic Nephropathy (GENDIAN), which enrolled exclusively individuals with type 2 diabetes, totaling 67,452 participants of European ancestry across the different analyses (up to 7,787 with diabetes in discovery and replication)."}
property_value: IAO:0000116 "The acronym ADVANCE also denotes ADVANCE trial (COHO:0001052) and Atherosclerotic Disease, Vascular Function, and Genetic Epidemiology Study (COHO:0001053); this term is Action in Diabetes and Vascular disease: Preterax and Diamicron-MR Controlled Evaluation." xsd:string

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001475
name: Aneurysm-Express Biobank Study
def: "A biobank study at University Medical Center Utrecht and St. Antonius Hospital Nieuwegein, the Netherlands, set up in 2003 as a derivative of the Athero-Express, of patients undergoing open surgical repair of abdominal aortic and other arterial aneurysms, which stores aneurysm wall tissue collected during surgery together with blood, clinical data and three years of follow-up for cardiovascular events, to study aneurysm heterogeneity in relation to postoperative outcomes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20720431", IAO:0000119="PMID:31882626", IAO:0000119="PMID:25372389"}
