id: coho:COHO_0001476
name: Atrial Fibrillation Biobank LMU
def: "A biobank and ongoing prospective registry of patients with atrial fibrillation from the arrhythmia clinic of the Department of Medicine I, University Hospital Munich, Ludwig-Maximilians-University, Germany, established within the Arrhythmia-Biobank-LMU with support from the German Federal Ministry of Education and Research, which collects blood samples and clinical data and follows patients for recurrence of atrial fibrillation after rhythm-control interventions such as catheter ablation." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32814717", IAO:0000119="PMID:31113362", IAO:0000119="PMID:28416818", IAO:0000119="PMID:32078373"}
