[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001478
name: AFTER EU
def: "The Danish part of the European Rational Approach for the Genetics of Diabetic Complications (EURAGEDIC) study: a case–control sample of adults with type 1 diabetes attending the outpatient clinic of the Steno Diabetes Center, Denmark, recruited from 1993 to 2000, with diabetic nephropathy (cases) or with persistent normoalbuminuria after more than 15 years of diabetes (controls), whose blood samples and clinical data were collected to study genetic risk factors for diabetic nephropathy and who were followed prospectively for mortality and cardiovascular and renal outcomes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20357380", IAO:0000119="PMID:17704113", IAO:0000119="PMID:31152163"}
