[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001486
name: Australian National Endometrial Cancer Study
def: "A nationwide population-based case-control study of endometrial cancer in Australia, run by a study group at QIMR Berghofer Medical Research Institute in Brisbane, whose cases are women aged 18–79 years newly diagnosed with histologically confirmed primary endometrial cancer between July 2005 and December 2007, identified through major hospitals and state cancer registries, and whose controls are women randomly selected from the Australian Electoral Roll and frequency-matched to the cases by state of residence and five-year age group. Participants gave risk-factor information by telephone interview and blood samples, and the cases were followed for survival, to study the causes and outcomes of endometrial cancer." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:22245995", IAO:0000119="PMID:29533022", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40033780", IAO:0000119="PMID:27135401"}
synonym: "ANECS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
