[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001489
name: Australian & New Zealand Registry of Advanced Glaucoma
def: "A prospective registry, run from the Department of Ophthalmology at Flinders University in Adelaide, of people with glaucoma referred by their eye practitioners across Australia and New Zealand: mainly people with advanced glaucoma (chiefly primary open-angle glaucoma with severe visual field loss), but also with less advanced, secondary and developmental glaucomas such as Axenfeld–Rieger malformation, whose clinical information and blood or saliva samples are collected by post. It was set up to find genetic risk factors for glaucoma blindness, and relatives of participants who carry myocilin mutations are offered cascade genetic testing." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23453510", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28513611", IAO:0000119="PMID:22171965", IAO:0000119="https://anzrag.com.au/"}
synonym: "ANZRAG" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
