[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001490
name: Alberta Ovarian Tumor Types Study
def: "A population-based, retrospective study of the histological types of ovarian carcinoma in the province of Alberta, Canada, whose cases are women with ovarian carcinoma identified through the Alberta Cancer Registry and sampled by histological type (endometrioid, clear cell, mucinous and high-grade serous carcinoma), with archival tumour tissue and pathology reports reviewed by a gynaecological pathologist, clinical data abstracted from medical charts and yearly updates of vital status, to study molecular and clinical differences between the types and survival." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:41922350", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25349970", IAO:0000119="PMID:24175302"}
synonym: "Alberta Ovarian Tumor Types study" RELATED []
