property_value: coho:numberOfCases "1695" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="analysed subset: cases and controls of white ancestry in a 2012 BBCS analysis; no total stated", xref="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3272480/", comment="For this analysis we included 1695 cases, 1564 of whom had two sequential or simultaneous primary breast cancers, and 131 of whom had at least two affected first degree relatives. The excess relative risk among cases with a second primary and those with two affected first degree relatives has been shown to be equivalent( 1 ) so the subsequent analysis assumes that all cases are bilateral. 2001 controls were ascertained as friends and non-blood relatives of the cases."}
property_value: coho:numberOfControls "2001" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="analysed subset: cases and controls of white ancestry in a 2012 BBCS analysis; no total stated", xref="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3272480/", comment="For this analysis we included 1695 cases, 1564 of whom had two sequential or simultaneous primary breast cancers, and 131 of whom had at least two affected first degree relatives. The excess relative risk among cases with a second primary and those with two affected first degree relatives has been shown to be equivalent( 1 ) so the subsequent analysis assumes that all cases are bilateral. 2001 controls were ascertained as friends and non-blood relatives of the cases."}
