[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001519
name: Blood-Cell Consortium
def: "An international consortium of cohort studies and biobanks, organised in red blood cell, white blood cell and platelet working groups, that meta-analyses genetic associations with blood-cell counts and indices in participants of European, African, Hispanic/Latino, East Asian and South Asian ancestry, first with exome-array genotypes and later (its second phase, BCX2) with genome-wide imputed data, to identify common and rare variants that influence blood-cell traits." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:27346685", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27346686", IAO:0000119="PMID:34925446"}
