[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001526
name: Baltic Familial Breast and Ovarian Cancer Consortium
def: "A collection of carriers of BRCA1 and BRCA2 pathogenic variants from families seen in clinical cancer genetics services in Lithuania and Latvia, gathered by a collaboration of Lithuanian (BFBOCC-LT) and Latvian (BFBOCC-LV) hereditary breast and ovarian cancer research groups and contributed as one study to the Consortium of Investigators of Modifiers of BRCA1 and BRCA2, for studies of genetic modifiers of cancer risk in carriers." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29058716", IAO:0000119="PMID:23544012", IAO:0000119="PMID:28448241", IAO:0000119="PMID:34320204"}
