[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001531
name: Breast Cancer in Galway Genetic Study
def: "A case-control study of breast cancer in the West of Ireland whose cases are unselected breast cancer patients recruited from University College Hospital Galway and surrounding hospitals in the West of Ireland since 2001, and whose controls are women over 60 years of age with no personal history of any cancer and no family history of breast or ovarian cancer, identified from retirement groups in the West of Ireland in 2001–2008; it is one of the studies of the Breast Cancer Association Consortium (BCAC)." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32424353", IAO:0000119="PMID:23535729"}
