[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001537
name: Begleitende Evaluierung innovativer Testverfahren zur Darmkrebsfrüherkennung
def: "An ongoing, prospective, multicentre diagnostic study of participants in the German screening colonoscopy programme, recruited since November 2005 at a preparatory visit before colonoscopy at gastroenterology practices in southern Germany, who donate blood and stool samples and answer a questionnaire. Run from the German Cancer Research Center (DKFZ) in Heidelberg, it evaluates new blood and stool tests for the early detection of colorectal cancer and advanced adenomas against the findings of screening colonoscopy." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://drks.de/search/en/trial/DRKS00008737", IAO:0000119="PMID:35060941", IAO:0000119="PMID:29574091", IAO:0000119="PMID:38704818"}
synonym: "BLITZ" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "BliTz" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Blitz" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Evaluation of novel markers for early detection of colorectal cancer" RELATED []
