[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001540
name: Bavarian Ovarian Cancer Cases and Controls
def: "A case-control study of ovarian cancer in Erlangen, northern Bavaria, Germany, supported by the ELAN programme of the University of Erlangen-Nuremberg, whose cases were recruited through the hospital in Erlangen and whose controls were randomly selected women from Erlangen, both enrolled from May 2002 to August 2008 and interviewed. It is one of the studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium (study code BAV) and contributes to its pooled epidemiological analyses and genome-wide association studies of ovarian cancer." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36688720", IAO:0000119="PMID:28346442", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23535730", IAO:0000119="PMID:21639959", IAO:0000119="PMID:21673961"}
