[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001541
name: Belgian Ovarian Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of ovarian cancer at University Hospitals Leuven, Belgium, funded by the Belgian National Cancer Plan (Nationaal Kankerplan). It is one of the studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium (study code BEL) and contributes cases and controls to its genome-wide association studies of ovarian cancer risk and to its analyses of ovarian cancer outcome." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:28346442", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23535730", IAO:0000119="PMID:21639959", IAO:0000119="PMID:23513043"}
