def: "A type 2 diabetes case-control sample of unrelated Han Chinese from Beijing, China, made up of people with type 2 diabetes and nondiabetic controls, used in genetic association studies of type 2 diabetes and glycaemic traits." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22961080", IAO:0000119="PMID:25993007"}
