[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001554
name: Coronary Artery Disease and Genomics
def: "A German case-control study of coronary artery disease that pools patients with angiographically documented coronary artery disease from the hospital catheter-laboratory-based AtheroGene Registry, enrolled in 1999–2004 at Johannes Gutenberg University Mainz and the German Federal Armed Forces Central Hospital in Koblenz, with controls without a history of myocardial infarction from the population-based Gutenberg Heart Study of the city of Mainz and the Mainz-Bingen district, assembled for genome-wide association studies of coronary artery disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/1-s2.0-S0140673610619964-mmc1.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:21606135"}
