[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001557
name: Kyushu University Fukuoka Cohort Study
def: "A community-based prospective cohort of middle-aged and older Japanese men and women in Fukuoka, Japan, run by Kyushu University, who took part in a baseline survey with a questionnaire and DNA collection between February 2004 and August 2007 and are followed up to investigate lifestyle factors and genetic susceptibility to lifestyle-related diseases such as cardiovascular diseases, cancer and diabetes mellitus." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:24647736", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26648100", IAO:0000119="PMID:21297916", IAO:0000119="PMID:34313618"}
