id: coho:COHO_0001558
name: Hospital-based Cohort Study at the National Center for Global Health and Medicine
def: "A hospital-based prospective cohort at the National Center for Global Health and Medicine in Tokyo, Japan, whose participants, drawn from the hospital's clinical practice and annual medical check-ups, are enrolled for detailed examination of lifestyle and lifestyle-related diseases such as cardiovascular diseases, cancer and diabetes mellitus to investigate the relationship between genetic and non-genetic factors." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:24647736", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26648100"}
