id: coho:COHO_0001582
name: Besta Cerebrovascular Diseases Registry
def: "A registry of stroke patients at the Carlo Besta Neurological Institute (Fondazione IRCCS Istituto Neurologico Carlo Besta), Milan, Italy, including consecutive Italian patients with stroke referred to the institute from 2000 to 2009, funded by the Italian Ministry of Health; its imaging-confirmed ischaemic stroke cases, subtyped by stroke neurologists with the TOAST criteria, were genotyped and studied with Italian PROCARDIS participants as controls in genome-wide association studies of stroke." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23041239", IAO:0000119="PMID:23381943"}
