property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:20400780" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Candidate gene association resource (CARe): design, methods, and proof of concept.", xref="PMID:20400780", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A20400780+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="The National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute's Candidate Gene Association Resource (CARe), a planned cross-cohort analysis of genetic variation in cardiovascular, pulmonary, hematologic, and sleep-related traits, comprises >40,000 participants representing 4 ethnic groups in 9 community-based cohorts."}
property_value: IAO:0000116 "The acronym CARe also denotes Los Angeles component of The Womens Contraceptive and Reproductive Experiences Study (COHO:0000110), Canadian Airways Research Group (COHO:0000229), Cholesterol and Recurrent Events (COHO:0001569) and Childhood Asthma Research and Education Network (COHO:0001570); this term is Candidate Gene Association Resource." xsd:string

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001587
name: Copenhagen General Population Study
def: "A prospective general-population cohort run from Herlev and Gentofte Hospital, Copenhagen University Hospital, and modelled on the Copenhagen City Heart Study, which from 2003 to 2015 invited adults aged 20–100 living in the greater Copenhagen area, identified through the Danish Civil Registration System (all those aged 40 or over and a quarter of those aged 20–39), and examined them with a questionnaire, a physical examination, lung function tests and blood sampling with DNA extraction. Participants are re-examined in a second round that began in 2014 and are followed through the national Danish health registries for cardiovascular, pulmonary and other diseases and death." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36852012", IAO:0000119="PMID:36214322", IAO:0000119="PMID:36891075"}
synonym: "CGPS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Herlev/Østerbroundersøgelsen" RELATED []
