[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001590
name: Chinese Prostate Cancer Genetic and Environmental Correlation Study
def: "A case–control study of prostate cancer in Han Chinese men run by the CHIPGECS collaborative group of Chinese hospitals and universities with Barts Cancer Institute, Queen Mary University of London, which recruited hospital patients with a pathological diagnosis of primary prostate cancer and cancer-free men of comparable age from the community or from hospital attendees having routine physical examinations, in several regions of China (south, southeast, southwest, central and northeast), and whose samples were genotyped with the PRACTICAL consortium on the iCOGS and OncoArray arrays." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33623038", IAO:0000119="PMID:26881390"}
