[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001591
name: ChooseWell 365
def: "A randomized clinical trial among employees of Massachusetts General Hospital in Boston, Massachusetts, aged 20 to 75, who regularly paid for food at the hospital's traffic-light-labelled cafeterias with their employee ID, enrolled between September 2016 and February 2018 and followed for 24 months to test whether a 12-month automated, personalized intervention (feedback on their cafeteria purchases, health and lifestyle tips, social norm comparisons and financial incentives) prevented weight gain and improved diet." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30414448", IAO:0000119="PMID:34097048"}
synonym: "ChooseWell 365 Study" RELATED []
