[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001594
name: Community Intervention of Metabolic Syndrome in China and Chinese Family Health Study
def: "A community-based cohort of Chinese adults aged 18 or over recruited in 2007–2008 by three-stage cluster random sampling at four survey sites, in Shandong, Henan and Jiangsu provinces, chosen for their different levels of economic development; it is one of the sub-cohorts of the Prediction for Atherosclerotic Cardiovascular Disease Risk in China (China-PAR) project, followed up with the other sub-cohorts under a uniform protocol in 2012–2015 and 2018–2020 to study cardiovascular risk factors and incident cardiovascular disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34327424", IAO:0000119="PMID:31888885", IAO:0000119="PMID:35195259", IAO:0000119="PMID:32433046"}
