[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001596
name: ChiLdhood Arthritis Risk factor Identification sTudY
def: "A case-control study and biobank of juvenile idiopathic arthritis at the Royal Children's Hospital in Melbourne, Victoria, Australia, begun in February 2008, whose cases are children aged 18 or under with juvenile idiopathic arthritis diagnosed by age 16, recruited at hospital clinic visits within six months of diagnosis (incident) or later (prevalent, diagnosed since 1997), and whose controls are healthy Victorian-born children undergoing minor elective surgery at the hospital's Day Surgery Unit; families complete questionnaires on clinical, epidemiological and environmental factors and the children give a blood sample, to identify genomic and environmental risk factors for the disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23153063"}
synonym: "Childhood Arthritis Risk Factor Identification Study" RELATED []
synonym: "CLARITY" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "CLARITY JIA Biobank" RELATED []
