[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001598
name: Spanish National Cancer Centre Breast Cancer Study
def: "A case-control study of breast cancer of the Spanish National Cancer Research Centre (CNIO) in Madrid, Spain, whose cases, recruited in 2000–2005, are consecutive breast cancer patients from three public hospitals, two in Madrid and one in Oviedo, and women with at least one affected first-degree relative recruited through the CNIO family cancer clinic in Madrid, and whose controls are women free of breast cancer attending the Menopause Research Centre in Madrid or a free medical check-up for female members of the College of Lawyers in Madrid; it is one of the studies of the Breast Cancer Association Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25390939"}
