[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001599
name: Nutrition, Metabolism and Atherosclerosis Clinic cohort
def: "A retrospective clinic-based cohort of patients with familial hypercholesterolaemia caused by a known mutation, identified by genetic screening among the patients with dyslipidaemia attending the lipid clinic (Nutrition, Metabolism and Atherosclerosis Clinic) of the Institut de recherches cliniques de Montréal in Montreal, Canada, whose clinical records and lipid profiles, measured after a washout of cholesterol-lowering medication, are used to study genetic and clinical modifiers of lipid levels and cardiovascular disease in familial hypercholesterolaemia." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:33079599", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28456682", IAO:0000119="PMID:28391914"}
synonym: "Clinique de nutrition métabolisme et athérosclérose" RELATED []
