[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001604
name: ColoCare Study
def: "An international, multicentre prospective cohort of adults newly diagnosed with invasive colorectal cancer of any stage. It began at the Fred Hutchinson Cancer Research Center in Seattle in 2007 and from 2009 added sites in Tampa, Heidelberg (Germany), Salt Lake City, Los Angeles, St. Louis and Memphis. Patients are enrolled before surgery. They complete questionnaires and give blood, urine and stool at enrolment and repeatedly during five years of follow-up, tumour and adipose tissue are collected at surgery, and treatment and outcome data are abstracted from medical records, so that biomarkers and modifiable lifestyle factors that predict recurrence, survival, treatment toxicity and quality of life can be found." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30523039"}
synonym: "ColoCare" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "ColoCare study" RELATED []
