[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001613
name: Danish Psychiatric Central Research Register
def: "A nationwide Danish register of patients treated in psychiatric departments, with records collected systematically from 1938 and computerised from 1969, covering all admissions to psychiatric hospitals and psychiatric wards of general hospitals in Denmark, the Faroe Islands and Greenland and, since 1995, all psychiatric outpatient contacts, with dates of treatment, diagnoses, referral, place and mode of admission and municipality of residence. Kept within a psychiatric epidemiology research unit and fed since 1995 through the Danish National Patient Register, it is used for national health planning and psychiatric epidemiological research." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26604824", IAO:0000119="PMID:9062767", IAO:0000119="PMID:21775352"}
