[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001616
name: Breast Cancer Collaborative Registry
def: "A web-based multicentre breast cancer registry developed at the University of Nebraska Medical Center's Eppley Cancer Center in Omaha, Nebraska, United States, and maintained by the Fred & Pamela Buffett Cancer Center as part of its integrated Cancer Repository for Cancer Research (iCaRe2), into which participating cancer centres in the US Midwest enrol breast cancer patients, breast cancer survivors and women at increased risk of breast cancer. Under common protocols it collects questionnaire data on demographic, medical, family, lifestyle, dietary and environmental factors, clinical and follow-up data and biospecimens for research on breast cancer diagnosis, prevention, treatment and survivorship." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37454130", IAO:0000119="PMID:21918596", IAO:0000119="PMID:31303884"}
