[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001619
name: International Consortium on Lithium Genetics
def: "An international consortium of lithium researchers, established in 2008 on the initiative of the International Group for the Study of Lithium-Treated Patients (IGSLI) and the Unit on the Genetic Basis of Mood and Anxiety Disorders of the US National Institute of Mental Health, whose participating sites in Europe, America, Asia and Australia pool genotyped patients with bipolar disorder treated with lithium, their long-term response rated retrospectively on the Alda scale, for genome-wide studies of the genetic basis of lithium response." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26806518", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20453537", IAO:0000119="PMID:37433967"}
