def: "A hospital-based lung cancer case–control study in Copenhagen, Denmark, whose cases are patients diagnosed histologically with treatable lung cancer from 2012 onwards (recruited 2012–2013) and whose controls are participants of the Copenhagen General Population Study without lung cancer; it was genotyped in the lung cancer OncoArray project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium for studies of genetic susceptibility to lung cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28604730", IAO:0000119="PMID:32393777"}
