[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001625
name: Corea (Genetics of COVID-related Manifestation)
def: "A South Korean case–control study of host genetic factors in COVID-19, contributed to the COVID-19 Host Genetics Initiative, that compares patients with COVID-19, among them hospitalised patients, with controls, all of Korean ancestry, under the ethics approval of Kangbuk Samsung Medical Center, Seoul National University Bundang Hospital and Seoul National University Hospital; its data collection was coordinated with the Kangbuk Samsung Cohort Study and its participants were genotyped on the Axiom Asia Precision Medicine Research Array." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:34379666", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34237774"}
