[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001630
name: California Pacific Medical Center Research Institute Cohort
def: "A cohort of women having screening mammography at the Breast Health Center of California Pacific Medical Center in San Francisco, California, United States, an imaging facility of the San Francisco Mammography Registry (part of the NCI Breast Cancer Surveillance Consortium), who completed the registry's demographic and risk-factor questionnaire and, from 2004 to 2011, were asked to give blood for research and consent to genotyping; breast cancers are ascertained by linkage to the California Cancer Registry." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC5669824/unicode", IAO:0000119="PMID:23668689", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3132306/unicode", IAO:0000119="PMID:27565998"}
