property_value: coho:numberOfParticipants "2895" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="adults recruited at baseline (CRISPS-1), 1995-1996", xref="PMID:36335348", comment="Briefly, in 1995–1996 (CRISPS-1), 2895 Hong Kong Chinese, aged 25–74, were randomly recruited from the general population of Hong Kong to undergo a comprehensive assessment."}
property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:9406673" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Epidemiology of cardiovascular risk factors in Hong Kong.", xref="PMID:9406673", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A9406673+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="To facilitate the development of appropriate population-wide coronary heart disease prevention strategies and to monitor their long-term impact, a comprehensive baseline Hong Kong Cardiovascular Risk Factor Prevalence Study was conducted in 1995-96."}

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001633
name: obsolete Cancer Research UK - Cambridge Research Institute
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. CRUK-CRI is the PGS Catalog's label for Cancer Research UK's Cambridge Research Institute (Li Ka Shing Centre), an author affiliation in PMID:29892050, placed among the GWAS datasets of PGS000751's variant source. By elimination it most likely stands for the 'UK stage 1 and 2' GWAS of that meta-analysis (the only sub-cohort the Catalog's list lacks), but no text says so; either way it is an institution, not a named study sample. The UK stage 1 and 2 GWAS are genotyping stages of the UK prostate cancer GWAS rather than a cohort. No COHO term or review row uses the name. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

