id: coho:COHO_0001636
name: California Teachers Study
def: "A prospective cohort of female California teachers and administrators, established in 1995-1996 among members of the California State Teachers Retirement System who completed a detailed mailed questionnaire on possible risk factors for breast and other cancers, with cancer outcomes identified by linkage to the California Cancer Registry." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:12296510", dcterms:contributor="Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
