[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001637
name: Chinese University of Hong Kong Diabetes Study
def: "A case–control study of type 2 diabetes in southern Han Chinese residents of Hong Kong, conducted by the Chinese University of Hong Kong. Its cases are patients with type 2 diabetes selected from the Prince of Wales Hospital Diabetes Registry (the Hong Kong Diabetes Register), either with early-onset diabetes and a positive family history or selected at random, excluding classic type 1 diabetes, and its controls, with normal glucose tolerance, were recruited from hospital staff, a community-based cardiovascular risk screening programme and a population-based cardiovascular risk screening programme for adolescents." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:25187374", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22158537"}
