[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001641
name: Cleveland Clinic Foundation/Veteran Affairs Medical Center Cohort
def: "A clinic-based case–control collection for genetic studies of age-related macular degeneration in Cleveland, Ohio, whose cases, graded by the Age-Related Eye Disease Study criteria, and controls without signs of macular degeneration or a family history of retinal disease, mostly of European descent, gave blood samples at the Cole Eye Institute of the Cleveland Clinic and at the Veterans Affairs eye clinic." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26691988", IAO:0000119="PMID:20042177", IAO:0000119="PMID:23455636"}
