[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001644
name: Dutch Autoimmune Hepatitis Study Group
def: "A national registry of patients with autoimmune hepatitis in the Netherlands kept by the Dutch Autoimmune Hepatitis Study Group, a collaboration of Dutch tertiary referral and general hospitals supported by the Netherlands Association for the Study of the Liver, which includes known patients retrospectively and new patients prospectively. Its patients have been studied for the treatment and outcome of the disease, and its adult patients with type 1 autoimmune hepatitis were genotyped for a genome-wide association study of the disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25611558", IAO:0000119="PMID:24768677", IAO:0000119="PMID:34165262", IAO:0000119="PMID:31617229"}
