[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001648
name: Dortmund Bladder Cancer Study
def: "A German hospital-based case-control study of urinary bladder cancer at the Department of Urology of St.-Josefs-Hospital Dortmund-Hörde, in the Ruhr area (a former coal, iron and steel industry region), whose cases have confirmed bladder cancer and whose controls are cancer-free patients of the same department admitted for benign urological diseases, enrolled from July 2009 to July 2010; it has contributed to genome-wide association studies of bladder cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21750109"}
