[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001650
name: Diet, Cancer and Health
def: "A Danish prospective cohort of the Danish Cancer Society that recruited men and women aged 50 to 64, born in Denmark, living in Aarhus or Copenhagen and without a cancer diagnosis, between 1993 and 1997, collecting questionnaires, a clinical examination and biological samples to investigate how diet and lifestyle relate to the risk of cancer and other chronic diseases. It is an associated cohort of the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38016806", IAO:0000119="PMID:36852012"}
