property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:23164817" xsd:string {dcterms:title="The protective effect of the obesity-associated rs9939609 A variant in fat mass- and obesity-associated gene on depression.", xref="PMID:23164817", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A23164817+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="As variation in the intron 1 of the fat mass- and obesity-associated (FTO) gene contributes to polygenic obesity, we assessed the possibility that FTO gene may contribute to depression in a cross-sectional multi-ethnic sample of 6561 depression cases and 21,932 controls selected from the EpiDREAM, INTERHEART, DeCC (depression case-control study) and Cohorte Lausannoise (CoLaus) studies."}

