id: coho:COHO_0001654
name: deCODE CAD/MI Study
def: "A case-control sample of Icelanders assembled by deCODE genetics for genetic studies of coronary artery disease and myocardial infarction, with cases identified from the Icelandic myocardial infarction registry (MONICA criteria, infarction before age 75) or hospital discharge diagnoses and contacted through deCODE's cardiovascular disease genetics programme, and population controls recruited through other deCODE genetic research programmes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21378990", IAO:0000119="PMID:19198609"}
