[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001660
name: Dutch Familial Bilateral Breast Cancer Study
def: "A Dutch breast cancer case-control study whose cases are BRCA1/2 mutation-negative familial bilateral breast cancer patients selected from five clinical genetics centres (Erasmus University Medical Center/Daniel den Hoed, the Netherlands Cancer Institute, Leiden University Medical Center, University Medical Center Utrecht and VU University Medical Center), with patient recruitment organised by the Netherlands Collaborative Group on Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer (HEBON), and whose controls are women aged 55 or over without breast cancer from the Rotterdam Study; it was genotyped for genome-wide association studies of breast cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22267197", IAO:0000119="PMID:23535729"}
