[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001662
name: obsolete Harvard Breast Cancer SPORE Blood Repository
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. In every paper the PGS Catalog records the id DFCI in, it is the Dana-Farber Cancer Institute's centre in CIMBA, BRCA1 and BRCA2 carriers that CIMBA's study list names only after the institution (PMID:28346442); the carriers are covered by CIMBA (COHO:0000901). The Catalog's name, Harvard Breast Cancer SPORE Blood Repository, appears in none of the papers. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true

