def: "A nationwide, prospective, population-based cohort of all people with HIV aged 16 or older treated at Denmark's specialised HIV centres since 1 January 1995, which keeps enrolling newly diagnosed people and immigrants with HIV and records demographic, clinical and laboratory data on their infection and care, linkable to the Danish national registers." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21799935", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38966335", IAO:0000119="PMID:22984529"}
