[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001666
name: Danish National Health Service Register
def: "A national administrative register of the services provided under Denmark's public health insurance by the contractors of primary health care (general practitioners, practising specialists, dentists, physiotherapists, psychologists and others), which covers everyone living in Denmark with data from 1990 and records the citizen, the provider and the service but little clinical information; collected for administrative and research purposes, it is linked by personal identification number to the other national registers." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:41835011", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38654257", IAO:0000119="PMID:21775348"}
