[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001671
name: UK Young Lacunar Stroke DNA Study
def: "A UK case-control collection for genetic studies of lacunar stroke, in which Caucasian patients aged 70 or under with a clinical lacunar syndrome and a compatible subcortical infarct on MRI were recruited from 72 specialist stroke centres throughout the UK between 2002 and 2012, and unrelated Caucasian controls free of cerebrovascular disease were sampled, stratified by age and sex, from general practice lists in the same areas." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29531354"}
