[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001674
name: Dutch HeFH cohort
def: "A prospective cohort drawn from the Dutch national cascade-screening programme for heterozygous familial hypercholesterolaemia, which enrolled participants between 1994 and 2013: adult carriers of a heterozygous familial hypercholesterolaemia variant free of atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease at enrolment who consented to genetic analysis and linkage of their health records, together with relatives from the same families confirmed as non-carriers and matched to them by age and sex, followed for incident coronary artery disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38938725"}
