id: coho:COHO_0001681
name: Eastern European Bladder Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based case–control study of bladder cancer in Hungary, Romania and Slovakia, the bladder cancer component of the ASHRAM case–control study of cancer risk from environmental arsenic exposure, whose cases were diagnosed from 2002 to 2004 and whose hospital-based controls were recruited from 2002 to 2004 in the same countries." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:20972438", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19706757", IAO:0000119="PMID:21750109"}
