[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001682
name: obsolete The Eastern Europe Study Population
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Eastern Europe study population is the heading deCODE genetics' papers give the samples of the ASHRAM case-control study (PMID:18794855, PMID:20348956, PMID:19151717). The heading is a description, not a name, and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0001497 (Arsenic Health Risk Assessment and Molecular Epidemiology), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0001497

