id: coho:COHO_0001683
name: Estudio Familiar de Influencia Genetica en Alzheimer
def: "A family study of Caribbean Hispanics from families multiply affected by late-onset Alzheimer's disease, recruited at the Taub Institute for Research on Alzheimer's Disease and the Aging Brain in New York and from clinics in the Dominican Republic, with follow-up of unaffected family members, to study the genetics of familial late-onset Alzheimer's disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28213371", IAO:0000119="PMID:24425039"}
