[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001686
name: ADDITION-Ely Case-Control Study
def: "A type 2 diabetes case-control study in the United Kingdom whose cases had previously undiagnosed type 2 diabetes, defined by World Health Organization oral glucose tolerance test criteria, found by population-based stepwise screening of 40- to 69-year-olds in the UK Cambridge arm of the ADDITION study or by oral glucose tolerance testing in the MRC Ely Study, and whose controls were participants of the MRC Ely Study, a population-based cohort of white European adults without diagnosed diabetes from a similar sampling frame as the cases, confirmed free of diabetes by oral glucose tolerance test." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18372903", IAO:0000119="PMID:20081857", IAO:0000119="PMID:22039354"}
