[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001689
name: Environmental and genetic risks factors study in adult lymphoma
def: "A French multicentre hospital-based case-control study of lymphoid neoplasms (non-Hodgkin lymphoma, Hodgkin lymphoma, lymphoproliferative syndromes and multiple myeloma), conducted in the main hospitals of Bordeaux, Brest, Caen, Nantes, Lille and Toulouse from September 2000 to December 2004, whose cases were recently diagnosed patients aged 18 to 75 living in each hospital's catchment area and whose controls were patients of the same hospitals, mainly from orthopaedic and rheumatology departments, to study environmental, infectious and genetic risk factors for these neoplasms." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19058175"}
