[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001698
name: EpiLymph
def: "A multicentre case-control study of incident lymphoma conducted in 1998–2004 in the Czech Republic, France, Germany, Ireland, Italy and Spain, whose controls were frequency-matched to cases on age, sex and country and drawn at random from population registers in Germany and Italy and from patients of the cases' hospitals elsewhere, and whose participants were interviewed in person about their medical and family history and environmental exposures, to investigate risk factors for lymphoma." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:17087949", IAO:0000119="PMID:32649712", IAO:0000119="PMID:16702371"}
