[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001699
name: EPI-NPC-2005 study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of nasopharyngeal carcinoma in Guangdong, southern China, whose cases are Guangdong residents under 80 with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed nasopharyngeal carcinoma identified at Sun Yat-sen University Cancer Center in Guangzhou between October 2005 and October 2007, and whose frequency-matched controls are Guangdong residents without cancer recruited among people attending health examinations at large general hospitals of the province; it was set up to study dietary, environmental and genetic risk factors for the disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31241250", IAO:0000119="PMID:35414057", IAO:0000119="PMID:20727127", IAO:0000119="PMID:29905022"}
