[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001700
name: EPIPARK
def: "A population-based cohort set up in 2010 in Lübeck, Germany, in which inhabitants screened by mailed questionnaire were assigned to groups ranging from healthy controls to people with suspected early motor signs of parkinsonism, alongside Parkinson's disease patients, and selected participants were examined in person and followed up, to investigate the specificity of non-motor symptoms for Parkinson's disease." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23257687", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
