[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001701
name: obsolete European Prospective Osteoporosis Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. In the only paper the PGS Catalog records the id EPOS in (PMID:35654975), it is the EPoS Consortium's liver-biopsy cohort from the European NAFLD Registry, not an osteoporosis study. The Catalog's expansion, European Prospective Osteoporosis Study, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0001420 (LITMUS Metacohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0001420

