[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001704
name: Evaluation of Risk of ALL Treatment-Related Side-Effects
def: "A national retrospective study of children aged 1 to 18 years diagnosed with acute lymphoblastic leukaemia or lymphoblastic lymphoma between 1998 and 2013 at six tertiary paediatric oncology centres in Australia and treated on Berlin-Frankfurt-Münster- or Children's Oncology Group-based protocols, with annotation of treatment, survival and treatment-related toxicities and a germline genome-wide association study, to find clinical and genetic risk factors for side-effects of treatment." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33567813", IAO:0000119="PMID:41163570", IAO:0000119="PMID:32438682"}
