id: coho:COHO_0001707
name: Etude Sur les Cancers et les Leucémies de l'Enfant
def: "A nationwide registry-based case-control study carried out in France in 2003–2004 of children under 15 years old diagnosed with acute leukaemia, lymphoma, a malignant central nervous system tumour or neuroblastoma, and population controls frequency-matched to them on age and sex, whose mothers were interviewed by standardised telephone questionnaire, to investigate environmental and genetic risk factors for childhood cancers and leukaemia." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:17330239", IAO:0000119="PMID:21147599", IAO:0000119="PMID:18396378"}
