[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001714
name: Ewha Womans University Hospital PCOS Study
def: "A case-control study of polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS) in Korean women, whose women with PCOS and control women with regular menstrual cycles were recruited at the endocrinology and gynaecology clinics of Ewha Womans University Hospital (Mokdong Hospital) in Seoul, South Korea, from December 2008 to 2010, and genotyped for a genome-wide association study of PCOS." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26308735", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33209044", IAO:0000119="PMID:32591571"}
