[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001716
name: European Youth Heart Study
def: "A school-based population study of risk factors for future cardiovascular disease in children aged 9 and 15 years, randomly sampled through schools in Denmark, Estonia, Norway, Portugal and Sweden in the late 1990s, with objectively measured physical activity and fitness; its Danish part, recruited in 1997, has been followed longitudinally into early adulthood." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:12740078", IAO:0000119="PMID:32871146", IAO:0000119="PMID:37404302", IAO:0000119="PMID:14707773"}
