[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001721
name: Fremantle Diabetes Study
def: "A community-based longitudinal observational study of people with known diabetes living in a postcode-defined area around the port city of Fremantle, Western Australia, run in two separately recruited phases, Phase I (1993–1996) and Phase II (2008–2011). Participants were identified from hospital, clinic and primary-care lists and local advertising, assessed in detail at entry and followed for diabetes complications and mortality." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11981027/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9820984/fullTextXML"}
