[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001728
name: Older Finnish Twin Cohort
def: "A population-based longitudinal cohort of twins from same-sex pairs born in Finland before 1958, identified from the population register and established in 1974, who answered health questionnaires in 1975, 1981, 1990 and 2011–2012, were screened for dementia in later waves, took part in clinical studies of subsamples and are followed up through national medical registers; it was expanded to opposite-sex pairs born 1938–1957, and is the oldest of the three Finnish Twin Cohorts." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23298696", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:12537859", IAO:0000119="PMID:38671483", IAO:0000119="PMID:31462340"}
