id: coho:COHO_0001732
name: FIRE-3
def: "An open-label, randomised phase 3 trial, led from the Ludwig-Maximilians-University of Munich, that from January 2007 to September 2012 recruited patients aged 18–75 with KRAS (exon 2) wild-type metastatic colorectal cancer at centres in Germany and Austria and assigned them to first-line FOLFIRI plus cetuximab or FOLFIRI plus bevacizumab." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT00433927", IAO:0000119="PMID:25088940"}
