property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:40141198" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Genetic Polymorphisms in MHC Classes I and II Predict Outcomes in Metastatic Colorectal Cancer.", xref="PMID:40141198", xref="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11942614/", comment="Genomic DNA from the blood samples of 775 patients enrolled in three independent, randomized, first-line trials, namely TRIBE (FOLFIRI-bevacizumab, N = 215), FIRE-3 (FOLFIRI-bevacizumab, N = 107; FOLFIRI-cetuximab, N = 129), and MAVERICC (FOLFIRI-bevacizumab, N = 163; FOLFOX6-bevacizumab, N = 161), was genotyped through OncoArray, a custom array manufactured by Illumina including approximately 530K SNP markers."}

