[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001734
name: Flemish Study on Environment, Genes and Health Outcomes
def: "An observational, community-based prospective cohort study of cardiovascular risk factors and outcomes in adults, whose family-based population sample was randomly recruited between 1985 and 2010, stratified by age and sex, from a geographically defined area in northeastern Belgium, and followed up with in-person examinations and records of health outcomes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40979826", IAO:0000119="PMID:35390065"}
