[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001735
name: Fleurbaix-Laventie Ville Santé II study
def: "The second phase of the Fleurbaix Laventie Ville Santé study: a prospective, community-based study of nuclear families (parents and their children) living in the two small towns of Fleurbaix and Laventie in northern France, recruited in 1999 among the families of the first phase (FLVS I, families with a child in primary school in 1992) and examined again in 2001, to identify determinants of adiposity and of weight and adiposity changes in the general population." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:22216207", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2247/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2247_MOESM24_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:20433707"}
