id: coho:COHO_0001739
name: Further Cardiovascular Outcomes Research with PCSK9 Inhibition in Subjects with Elevated Risk
def: "A multinational, randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial (TIMI 59) of whether adding the PCSK9 inhibitor evolocumab to statin therapy reduces major cardiovascular events in patients aged 40 to 85 with clinically evident atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease (a history of myocardial infarction, non-haemorrhagic stroke or symptomatic peripheral artery disease) and raised LDL or non-HDL cholesterol." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40011692", IAO:0000119="PMID:31707849"}
