[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001743
name: FRagmin and Fast Revascularisation during InStability in Coronary artery disease II
def: "A prospective randomised multicentre trial at 58 hospitals in Sweden, Norway and Denmark in which patients with unstable coronary-artery disease were assigned to an early invasive or a non-invasive treatment strategy, together with placebo-controlled long-term treatment with the low-molecular-mass heparin dalteparin (Fragmin), to compare the two strategies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2480/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2480_MOESM9_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:10475181"}
