[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001747
name: Genetics in Atrial Fibrillation
def: "A Norwegian study of early-onset lone atrial fibrillation that enrolled, between 2009 and 2016, people diagnosed with atrial fibrillation before age 50 in the absence of clinical or echocardiographic signs of cardiovascular disease, hypertension, or metabolic or pulmonary disease; all participants had a clinical examination with ECG and echocardiography and gave blood for DNA." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0133-9/MediaObjects/41588_2018_133_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
