[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001748
name: German Alzheimer's disease Integrated Genome Research Network
def: "A German genome-wide association dataset of Alzheimer's disease cases and controls from the Alzheimer's disease Integrated Genome Research Network (AD-IG) of the German National Genome Research Network (NGFN), a Federal Ministry of Education and Research-funded project of the Homburg group, used for in silico replication in the 2011 GERAD+ genome-wide association study of Alzheimer's disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24922517", IAO:0000119="PMID:21460840"}
