id: coho:COHO_0001751
name: Bipolar Disorder Genetic Association Information Network
def: "The sample of the first genome-wide association study of the Bipolar Genome Study, funded through the Genetic Association Information Network (GAIN): unrelated cases with bipolar disorder of European American and African American ancestry from the collections of the NIMH Genetics Initiative for Bipolar Disorder in the United States, and controls matched by ethnicity, age and sex who were ascertained throughout the United States for the Molecular Genetics of Schizophrenia collaboration, all genotyped on the Affymetrix 6.0 array." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19488044", IAO:0000119="PMID:21305692"}
