id: coho:COHO_0001753
name: Genetics of Asthma in Latino Americans
def: "A multicentre, international, family-based study of childhood asthma run from the University of California, San Francisco, which recruited Mexican and Puerto Rican children with asthma and their parents (parent–child trios) in Mexico City, the San Francisco Bay Area, Puerto Rico and New York City, to identify clinical and genetic risk factors for asthma." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:19951396", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21912604", IAO:0000119="PMID:19930545"}
