id: coho:COHO_0001755
name: Gwangju Alzheimer's and Related Dementias
def: "A community-based longitudinal cohort study of Alzheimer's disease and related dementias in South Korea, established in 2013 and run by the GARD Cohort Research Center at Chosun University in Gwangju, whose participants, aged 60 or over, come mainly from local senior citizens' centres in the city of Gwangju, with additional people with Alzheimer's disease or mild cognitive impairment recruited from Chosun University Hospital and its affiliated hospitals in Gwangju and elsewhere in Korea, and are followed with repeated clinical and neuropsychological evaluation, neuroimaging and biospecimen collection for multi-omics analyses, for early detection and monitoring of dementia." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:41537461", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39428694"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
