id: coho:COHO_0001759
name: Gothenburg Cervical Artery Dissection Collection
def: "A collection of patients with cervical artery dissection, of European origin, at the Sahlgrenska Academy of the University of Gothenburg, Sweden, drawn from the Sahlgrenska Academy Study on Ischemic Stroke and meeting the inclusion criteria of the CADISP study, which with controls from the same study formed one of the follow-up samples of the 2015 genome-wide association study of cervical artery dissection." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:25420145", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3154/MediaObjects/41588_2015_BFng3154_MOESM24_ESM.pdf"}
