[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001768
name: Genetic Lung Cancer Predisposition Study
def: "A case-control DNA resource for lung cancer established in March 1999 by the Institute of Cancer Research and adopted in 2002 onto the portfolio of the National Cancer Research Network, through which oncology departments across England recruited patients diagnosed with lung cancer between March 1999 and July 2004, and their spouses or partners without a history of cancer as controls, to collect DNA and clinico-pathological data for identifying low-penetrance susceptibility alleles for lung cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18715499"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
synonym: "GELCAPS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
