[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001769
name: Genes and Environment in Lung Cancer, Singapore Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer in ethnic Chinese women in Singapore, recruited from 2005 to 2008 in the major public-sector hospitals (Changi General Hospital, National Cancer Centre, National University Hospital, Singapore General Hospital and Tan Tock Seng Hospital), with cases of primary lung carcinoma of all histological types and controls from the same hospitals frequency-matched by 10-year age group; it is one of the studies pooled in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36530673", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34750403", IAO:0000119="PMID:23143601"}
