id: coho:COHO_0001771
name: Genetic Modifiers of cancer risk in BRCA1/2 mutation carriers
def: "A multicentre study of carriers of pathogenic BRCA1 or BRCA2 variants, run through the French National Cancer Genetics Network of the UNICANCER Genetic Group, coordinated from Lyon (Hospices Civils de Lyon and Centre Léon Bérard) and the Institut Curie in Paris, with contributing cancer genetics centres across France and at Creighton University in Omaha, United States, to identify genetic modifiers of cancer risk in these carriers." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32665703", IAO:0000119="PMID:28448241"}
