[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001775
name: Génétique de la Néphropathie Diabétique
def: "A cross-sectional multicentre study of people with insulin-dependent (type 1) diabetes and proliferative diabetic retinopathy, and so exposed to the risk of diabetic nephropathy, conducted from May 1994 to April 1995 in 17 diabetic clinics in France and Belgium, in which participants were classified by the severity of their renal involvement, to study the genetic determinants of diabetic nephropathy." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31537649", IAO:0000119="PMID:9120002"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
