[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001776
name: Gene MSA CH
def: "The Swiss site sample, recruited at University Hospital Basel, Switzerland, of people with multiple sclerosis and controls enrolled in the Genetic Multiple Sclerosis Associations (GeneMSA) study, a prospective case-control study of multiple sclerosis started in 2003 and funded by GlaxoSmithKline at three clinical centres with identical inclusion criteria, of patients of northern-European ancestry with any clinical subtype of multiple sclerosis (preferentially relapsing onset) and unrelated controls (mainly spouses or partners, friends and other volunteers) group-matched on age and sex, to study genetic influences on susceptibility and on clinical and MRI phenotype; used as a separate stratum in genome-wide meta-analyses of multiple sclerosis." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19010793", IAO:0000119="PMID:22570697", IAO:0000119="PMID:19525953"}
