id: coho:COHO_0001781
name: obsolete Johns Hopkins - Genetic STudy of Atherosclerosis Risk
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. GeneSTAR_b is the PGS Catalog's second id for GeneSTAR, which its own acknowledgements name 'The Johns Hopkins Genetic Study of Atherosclerosis Risk (GeneSTAR)'. Replaced by COHO:0000455 (Genetic Study of Atherosclerosis Risk), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000455

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001782
name: Genetic influences on severity of COVID-19 illness in Korea
def: "A South Korean case–control study of host genetic influences on the severity of COVID-19, contributed to the COVID-19 Host Genetics Initiative, that compares patients hospitalised with COVID-19 with controls, all of East Asian ancestry, under the review of eight Korean institutional review boards, among them those of Chungnam National University Hospital, Keimyung University Dongsan Hospital, Myongji Hospital and Pusan National University Hospital; its cases were genotyped on version 1.1 and its controls on version 1.0 of the Korea Biobank Array (KoreanChip)." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:37674002", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34237774"}
