id: coho:COHO_0001787
name: Genetic Study in Ischemic Stroke Patients treated with r-tPA
def: "A multicentre Spanish study of patients of European ancestry with acute ischaemic stroke, admitted to the emergency rooms of Vall d'Hebron Hospital in Barcelona and other Spanish hospitals and treated with recombinant tissue plasminogen activator (r-tPA), set up to find genetic variants associated with haemorrhagic transformation and death after thrombolysis." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:28411264", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34300314", IAO:0000119="PMID:23280790", IAO:0000119="PMID:38103737"}
