[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001788
name: Genetics Network Rheumatology Amsterdam
def: "A prospective collection of Dutch patients with rheumatoid arthritis meeting the 1987 American College of Rheumatology criteria, recruited from the outpatient rheumatology clinics of the VU University Medical Center, the Jan van Breemen Institute and the Academic Medical Center/University of Amsterdam in the Amsterdam region of the Netherlands, together with healthy blood-donor controls from the same region, which the Genetics Network Rheumatology Amsterdam contributed to genetic studies of rheumatoid arthritis susceptibility and of response to anti-TNF therapy." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:20453842", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19898481", IAO:0000119="PMID:23555300"}
