[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001805
name: Genomic Imaging Göttingen
def: "A sample of healthy young adults of European ancestry, established at the Center for Translational Research in Systems Neuroscience and Psychiatry of the University of Göttingen and recruited through advertisements at the University of Göttingen and the University Medical Center Göttingen, excluding people with past or present psychiatric disorders, a family history of psychiatric disorders, recent substance abuse, or neurological or metabolic disease, who are genotyped and undergo brain magnetic resonance imaging, including functional MRI." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27184339", IAO:0000119="PMID:26854805"}
