[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001806
name: Genes in Myopia Study
def: "An Australian family and twin study of the genetics of myopia and other refractive errors, established in Melbourne in 2004, which recruited probands with myopia and a family history of it (contacted through the database of the Melbourne Excimer Laser Group) together with their family members, and adult twins from Victoria through the Australian Twin Registry, with a detailed eye examination, ocular biometry, questionnaire and blood sample for DNA." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18552384", IAO:0000119="PMID:16283990", IAO:0000119="PMID:20576483"}
