[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001807
name: Genetic and Immunological Studies of European and African HIV-1+ Long Term Non-Progressors
def: "A European-African consortium project of the European Commission's Sixth Framework Programme on the genetics and immunology of HIV-1 long-term non-progression, and its French-Italian cohort of untreated, HIV-1-infected Caucasian long-term non-progressors (CD4+ T-cell counts above 500/μL for more than seven years after infection without antiretroviral therapy) drawn from the French asymptomatic long-term cohort, the Italian ELVIS study and the Chelsea and Westminster cohort. The cohort was genotyped genome-wide and compared with seroconverters of the French PRIMO cohort to find host genetic factors of long-term non-progression, and it contributed to the International Collaboration for the Genomics of HIV." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23750159", IAO:0000119="PMID:23459797", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2766982/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="PMID:28702030", IAO:0000119="PMID:23935489"}
