[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001808
name: GISSI-Prevenzione trial
def: "A multicentre Italian randomized trial of the Gruppo Italiano per lo Studio della Sopravvivenza nell'Infarto miocardico (GISSI) in which patients surviving a recent (3 months or less) myocardial infarction, with no limits of age and sex, were randomly assigned from October 1993 to September 1995 in a factorial design to supplements of n-3 polyunsaturated fatty acids, vitamin E, both, or none for 3.5 years, with death, non-fatal myocardial infarction and stroke as the combined primary endpoint." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:10465168", IAO:0000119="PMID:20403154"}
