id: coho:COHO_0001809
name: Glasgow Stroke Sample
def: "A hospital-based collection of patients with ischaemic stroke attending the cerebrovascular service of the Western Infirmary, Glasgow, Scotland, recruited between 1990 and 2004 as part of an ongoing study of genetic and circulating biomarkers in stroke, all with brain imaging and extracranial carotid ultrasound, analysed against shared WTCCC controls from the 1958 Birth Cohort in the MEGASTROKE consortium’s genome-wide association study of stroke." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29531354"}
