id: coho:COHO_0001813
name: GliomaScan
def: "A genome-wide association study of glioma led by the US National Cancer Institute, genotyped at the NCI Core Genotyping Facility, that pooled incident glioma cases and matched or previously genotyped controls from 19 studies, mostly prospective cohorts of the United States, Europe and Australia (among them ATBC, CPS-II, the Nurses' Health Study, the Health Professionals Follow-up Study, PLCO, NSHDS and the Melbourne Collaborative Cohort Study), together with case-control studies (among them the Sweden and Denmark arm of INTERPHONE) and the case-only Gliogene study." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:22886559", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3761216/"}
