id: coho:COHO_0001814
name: GMetS
def: "A French type 2 diabetes case-control sample, whose DNA samples were managed by the CNRS UMR 8199 Genomic and Metabolic Disease unit in Lille, genotyped on the Metabochip and contributed to the stage 2 replication of the DIAGRAM consortium's 2012 type 2 diabetes meta-analysis." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22885922", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2383/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2383_MOESM31_ESM.pdf"}
