id: coho:COHO_0001815
name: Gut Microbiota and Obesity Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of overweight or obese adults and age- and sex-matched normal-weight controls aged 35–54 years, noninstitutionalized residents of two urban districts of Shanghai, China (Luwan and Zhabei), recruited from November 2007 to January 2008 to investigate the effects of gut microbiota and environmental factors on obesity and related metabolic disorders." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20530747"}
