id: coho:COHO_0001816
name: Genentech Human Genetics Initiative Cancer Immunology Cohort 2020 Q2
def: "A collection of germline whole-genome sequencing data, assembled by Genentech's Human Genetics Initiative, from patients in seven Roche/Genentech phase 3 trials of the anti-PD-L1 antibody atezolizumab, alone or combined with chemotherapy or bevacizumab, and their standard-of-care control arms in six cancers (IMvigor211, IMpower150, IMpower130, IMpower131, IMpower133, IMmotion151 and IMpassion130), sequenced from blood samples given under the trials' optional research biosample consent." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34099659"}
