[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001818
name: Genetics of Brain Structure and Function Study
def: "A family-based imaging genetics study of Mexican Americans in San Antonio, Texas, United States, which recruited members of the extended pedigrees of the San Antonio Family Heart Study and the San Antonio Family Gallbladder Study, with the children and grandchildren of their probands, for brain magnetic resonance imaging and neuropsychological and psychiatric assessment at the University of Texas Health Science Center at San Antonio, to localise, identify and characterise genes and quantitative trait loci that influence brain structure and function." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21557468", IAO:0000119="PMID:36204553", IAO:0000119="PMID:22028680"}
