[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001821
name: Genetic characteristics of coRonary Artery disease in ChiNese young aDults
def: "A prospective multicentre, hospital-based, coronary angiography-based case-control study in China, coordinated from Zhongshan Hospital, Fudan University, that recruited adults at 38 cardiac centres between May 2017 and April 2019, centred on patients with early-onset coronary artery disease (onset at 45 years or younger) and older controls (65 years or older) without angiographic coronary disease, to identify genetic factors in the susceptibility to and outcomes of early-onset coronary artery disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11645474/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9429139/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12008806/fullTextXML"}
