[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001824
name: Groningen Renal Hemodynamic Cohort Study Group
def: "An ongoing research programme at the renal function unit of the University Medical Center Groningen, the Netherlands, that hosts and harmonises a series of studies of renal hemodynamics, mainly in healthy volunteers, under a common protocol of integrated measurement of renal hemodynamics and extracellular volume, with standardised methods and calibration over time; participants are typically studied on a standardised dietary sodium intake." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26149279", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21082022"}
synonym: "GRECO" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Groningen Renal Hemodynamic Cohorts" RELATED []
