id: coho:COHO_0001828
name: obsolete Glasgow, Scotland ImmunoChip Study Samples
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. GSICSS is the Stroke Genetics Network's Glasgow ImmunoChip Study (PMID:26708676), the Glasgow ischaemic stroke sample with the same cases and controls as the Glasgow Stroke Sample. Replaced by COHO:0001809 (Glasgow Stroke Sample), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
