[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001832
name: UK2 GWAS
def: "The second UK genome-wide association study of breast cancer, funded by the Wellcome Trust and Cancer Research UK, whose cases are women with breast cancer from UK cancer genetics clinics, recruited through the Familial Breast Cancer Study, and from UK oncology clinics, recruited through the POSH study, and whose controls come from the 1958 Birth Cohort and the UK National Blood Service, genotyped by the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium 2." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC4229095", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.1049/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng1049_MOESM2_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:20453838"}
