[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001834
name: Health2 T2D Study
def: "A type 2 diabetes case-control sample of Korean adults contributed by the Korea National Institute of Health to the Asian Genetic Epidemiology Network's type 2 diabetes meta-analysis. Its cases, with type 2 diabetes of onset at age 40 or older, were drawn from the population-based Health2 cohort of the Korean Genome and Epidemiology Study; its controls, without diabetes or anti-diabetic medication and with normal fasting glucose, came partly from the Health2 cohort (those older than 60 with a normal oral glucose tolerance test) and partly from the Health Examinee (HEXA) shared control study. It was genotyped genome-wide on the Affymetrix Genome-Wide Human SNP Array 6.0." [] {IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.1019/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng1019_MOESM23_ESM.pdf", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22158537"}
synonym: "H2T2DS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "HT2DS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
