[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001836
name: HangAmDan-B1-Investigator Initiated Trial
def: "A randomized, multi-center, open-label clinical trial in the Republic of Korea, registered as KCT0005414, that compared the safety and efficacy of afatinib alone with afatinib combined with HAD-B1 (HangAmDan-B1), a traditional Korean medicine herbal formulation, in patients with locally advanced or metastatic EGFR-mutation-positive non-small cell lung cancer enrolled at six centres, and ran from February 2021 to April 2023." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:39103991", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38469817"}
synonym: "HAD-B1-IIT" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "HangAmDan-B1-Investigator Initiated Trial study" RELATED []
