[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001845
name: Hwasun Cancer Epidemiology Study-Colon and Rectum Cancer
def: "The colorectal cancer arm of the Hwasun Cancer Epidemiology Study, a hospital-based case-control study of multiple cancers in South Korea. Its cases are patients newly diagnosed with colorectal cancer at Chonnam National University Hwasun Hospital, a cancer hospital in Jeollanam-do province, between April 2004 and February 2013, excluding secondary or recurrent cancers, and its controls are participants in the Korean Community Health Survey in Jindo and Bosung counties of Jeollanam-do in 2010 to 2012." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24836286"}
