[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001849
name: Helsinki Breast Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based breast cancer case-control study at Helsinki University Central Hospital in southern Finland, whose cases are consecutive, unselected breast cancer patients from the hospital's Departments of Oncology (1997-1998 and 2000) and Surgery (2001-2004) together with familial breast cancer patients from its Departments of Oncology and Clinical Genetics (from 1995), and whose controls are healthy women from the same region." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fnature24284/MediaObjects/41586_2017_BFnature24284_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:22267197"}
