id: coho:COHO_0001867
name: obsolete HMGU
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. HMGU is the German lung cancer case-control GWAS sample of the International Lung Cancer Consortium, with LUCY and Heidelberg cases and KORA controls (PMID:25644374), which COHO holds as COHO:0000165. Replaced by COHO:0000165 (The Helmholtz-Gemeinschaft Deutscher Forschungszentren), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000165

