[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001873
name: obsolete Prospective cohort of men (USA)
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. HPFS3 is the third Health Professionals Follow-up Study case-control set of the colorectal cancer GWAS of PMID:29917119, beside NHS3. The Catalog's name for it, Prospective cohort of men (USA), is generic and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000527 (Health Professionals Follow-up Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000527

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001874
name: Helsinki Sudden Death Study/Tampere Coronary Study
def: "A Finnish forensic autopsy series of men aged 35 to 69 who died out of hospital, combining consecutive autopsies in Helsinki in 1991-1992 (the Helsinki Sudden Death Study) and in Tampere in 2001-2004 (the Tampere Coronary Study), in which coronary artery disease was assessed at autopsy from coronary stenosis of 50% or more, old or acute myocardial infarction, or sudden cardiac death from plaque rupture and thrombosis." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3396/MediaObjects/41588_2015_BFng3396_MOESM57_ESM.pdf"}
