[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001883
name: obsolete Hamburg-Zagreb
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Hamburg-Zagreb (HZ) names two cities: the PGS Catalog cohort id is the PRACTICAL consortium’s label for hospital-based prostate cancer cases seen at the Department of Oncology, University Hospital Center Zagreb, and controls, a local sample with no study name. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001884
name: Harvard i2b2
def: "A major depressive disorder case-control sample of the Psychiatric Genomics Consortium from the Partners HealthCare System in the United States, assembled with the i2b2 (Informatics for Integrating Biology and the Bedside) centre, whose cases were identified by natural language processing of electronic medical records with psychiatrist review (an ICD-9 diagnosis of major depressive disorder, confirmed on record review, with depression either responsive to an SSRI or unresponsive to at least two antidepressant trials) and whose controls came from neuroimaging studies, screened by self-reported psychiatric history." [] {IAO:0000119="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0090-3/MediaObjects/41588_2018_90_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3837431/"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
