[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001885
name: obsolete Icelandic Atrioventricular Block Sample
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. No paper names the id, but every Icelandic genetic sample of advanced atrioventricular block is a deCODE genetics case set, drawn from Icelanders in deCODE's studies (PMID:20062063, PMID:23583979): the sample is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog's name describes only that disease subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000428

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001886
name: obsolete Icelandic Atrial Fibrillation Sample
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Icelandic atrial fibrillation sample is a deCODE genetics case set, described under that name in deCODE's papers (PMID:30271950) and listed under deCODE in PMID:30061737: it is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog's name describes only that disease subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000428

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001887
name: Irish Affected Sib Pair Study of Alcohol Dependence
def: "A family study of alcohol dependence in Ireland and Northern Ireland that between 1998 and 2002 recruited probands meeting DSM-IV criteria for alcohol dependence, ascertained in community alcoholism treatment facilities and public and private hospitals and with all four grandparents born in Ireland or Great Britain, together with their siblings and parents, all interviewed by clinically trained interviewers, probands and siblings with a modified Semi-Structured Assessment for the Genetics of Alcoholism and parents with a modified Structured Clinical Interview for DSM." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15770118", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41593-018-0275-1/MediaObjects/41593_2018_275_MOESM4_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:18331377"}
