[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001890
name: Iceland Bladder Cancer Study
def: "A case-control sample of Icelanders assembled by deCODE genetics for genome-wide association studies of urinary bladder cancer, with cases identified through the Icelandic Cancer Registry and recruited from 2001 by trained nurses through special recruitment clinics, donating a blood sample and answering a lifestyle questionnaire, and controls drawn from other ongoing genome-wide studies at deCODE." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21750109", IAO:0000119="PMID:26732427"}
