[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001891
name: Indiana Biobank Liver cohort
def: "A case-control sample drawn from the Indiana Biobank, the statewide biobank of Indiana University, Purdue University and the University of Notre Dame whose participants are recruited in person from participating clinics and linked to the Indiana Network for Patient Care, comprising participants with chronic liver disease identified from ICD-9/10 codes and confirmed by chart review, among them patients with cirrhosis attributed to alcohol or to metabolic dysfunction-associated steatotic liver disease, and liver disease-free controls without liver-specific codes or abnormal liver tests, assembled for genetic studies of cirrhosis." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38727677"}
