[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001892
name: Inflammatory Bowel Disease in South-Eastern Norway
def: "A population-based inception cohort of all patients newly diagnosed with inflammatory bowel disease (ulcerative colitis or Crohn's disease) from 1990 to 1993 while living in four counties of south-eastern Norway, each matched for age and sex with five controls drawn from the Norwegian Population Register, set up to establish the incidence of the disease in the region and followed prospectively for its natural course at 1, 5, 10, 20 and 30 years." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36239614", IAO:0000119="PMID:41531802"}
