[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001893
name: integrated Cancer Repository for Cancer Research
def: "An umbrella repository of collaborative cancer-specific registries, among them the Pancreatic Cancer Collaborative Registry, the Breast Cancer Collaborative Registry and the Thyroid Cancer and Tumor Collaborative Registry, developed and maintained by the Fred & Pamela Buffett Cancer Center at the University of Nebraska Medical Center in Omaha, through which participating hospitals in the Midwestern United States enrol cancer patients, high-risk individuals and controls and collect questionnaire data on a common core of demographic, lifestyle, family history and quality-of-life items, clinical and follow-up data and biospecimens for cancer research." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38672660", IAO:0000119="PMID:31303884", IAO:0000119="PMID:27168721"}
