id: coho:COHO_0001894
name: International Cohort Collection for Bipolar Disorder
def: "A consortium of investigators in the United States, the United Kingdom and Sweden, established to accelerate genome-wide association studies of bipolar disorder and its clinical subtypes by applying high-throughput phenotyping methods, which brings together bipolar disorder cases and unaffected controls from the Sweden Bipolar Disorder Cohort, the Bipolar Disorder Research Network in the United Kingdom, a University of Southern California collection and a Massachusetts General Hospital collection identified from electronic health records, all genotyped at the Broad Institute." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:28072414", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29666432"}
