def: "A family-based study of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease funded by GlaxoSmithKline, whose pedigrees of probands with COPD and their siblings, characterised by spirometry, serve as a replication and testing cohort in COPD genome-wide association studies and genetic risk-score meta-analyses (1,103 pedigrees in the 2017 meta-analysis of 16,707 subjects)." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:19300482", IAO:0000119="PMID:34855941", IAO:0000119="PMID:28170284", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
