[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001903
name: Hospital Clínic Primary HIV-1 Infection Cohort
def: "A prospective single-centre cohort that has enrolled, since 1997, all patients with acute or recent HIV-1 infection (within 180 days of infection) evaluated at the Hospital Clínic in Barcelona, Spain, identified by detectable viraemia with a negative HIV serology or by documented seroconversion within the previous six months." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26039689", IAO:0000119="PMID:30472421"}
