[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001904
name: obsolete Icelandic ECG study sample
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Icelandic ECG sample is deCODE genetics' set of genotyped Icelanders with stored electrocardiograms from Landspitali University Hospital, listed as 'Study cohort: deCODE' in PMID:30012220: it is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog's name describes only that subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000428

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001905
name: obsolete Irish Family Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. IFS is the Indiana Fragility Study (PMID:24064335), premenopausal white sister pairs from Indiana: the sample COHO holds as the Indiana Sisters Study. The Catalog's name for it, Irish Family Study, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000099 (Indiana Sisters Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000099

