[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001907
name: obsolete Indiana Genetics of Bone Fragility Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Indiana Genetics of Bone Fragility Study is the full name a bone mineral density consortium table (PMID:22504420) gives the Indiana sister-pair study whose GWAS (PMID:20164292) is the Indiana Sisters Study's example. Replaced by COHO:0000099 (Indiana Sisters Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000099

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001908
name: obsolete Interaction Gåne-Environment en Physiopathologie Cardio-Vasculaire
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. IGE-PCV is a research unit of INSERM and the Université de Lorraine in Nancy, with its biobank, which supplied two different samples to the VEGF GWAS of PMID:26910538: an institution, not a cohort. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001909
name: obsolete International Hereditary Cancer Centre
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The International Hereditary Cancer Centre of the Pomeranian Medical University, Szczecin, is an institution. In every paper the PGS Catalog records the id IHCC in, it labels the centre's contribution of BRCA1 and BRCA2 carriers or cancer cases to consortium analyses such as CIMBA (PMID:29058716), with no study name of its own. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001910
name: Intern Health Study
def: "A multi-institutional prospective cohort study of stress and depression in physicians in the United States, which invites incoming interns each year before they start the first year of residency training (from 2007) and follows them from the end of medical school through internship, recording depressive and anxiety symptoms and their risk factors by repeated questionnaires and a daily mood smartphone app, with DNA collected by mail for genetic studies of depression under stress." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31818913", IAO:0000119="PMID:31659322", IAO:0000119="PMID:31084447"}
synonym: "HIS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "IHS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
