id: coho:COHO_0001915
name: IMSGC UK
def: "A UK case-control sample of the International Multiple Sclerosis Genetics Consortium, comprising patients with multiple sclerosis (McDonald criteria) of European descent recruited in the United Kingdom and healthy control subjects from the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium, genotyped on the Affymetrix 500K platform and used as one stratum of the consortium's genome-wide association meta-analyses." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21654844", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19525953"}
