id: coho:COHO_0001919
name: Indian Diabetes Consortium
def: "A nationwide collaborative biorepository of DNA, plasma and serum from people with and without type 2 diabetes in India's two major ethnic groups (Indo-European and Dravidian speakers), collected from 2003 to 2011 with anthropometric and clinical measurements by the Indian Diabetes Consortium to study the genetic, epigenetic and environmental causes of type 2 diabetes in Indians undergoing socioeconomic transition, re-sampling the same areas at intervals to follow the effects of urbanisation." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23205164"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
synonym: "INdian DIabetes COnsortium" RELATED []
