[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001922
name: International Head and Neck Cancer Epidemiology Consortium
def: "An international consortium of research groups leading epidemiological studies of head and neck cancer, mostly case–control studies in North and South America, Europe and Asia, which pools their individual-level data in a common database to share comparable data, study rare subgroups such as never smokers and coordinate laboratory analyses of the causes of head and neck cancer, including genome-wide association studies of cancers of the upper aerodigestive tract." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:27749845", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5834132/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="PMID:16023150", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13340975/fullTextXML"}
