[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001923
name: Interdisciplinary Health Research International Team on Breast Cancer Susceptibility
def: "A research programme based at the Centre Hospitalier Universitaire de Québec and Laval University, Canada, that has recruited high-risk French-Canadian families with breast and/or ovarian cancer (several affected close relatives, or a known BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutation) through a network of referring clinicians across Quebec since 1996, for BRCA1 and BRCA2 mutation testing and studies of inherited susceptibility to breast and ovarian cancer." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1413985/fullTextXML", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2702391/fullTextXML"}
