id: coho:COHO_0001933
name: IPO-Porto study
def: "A hospital-based case–control study of prostate cancer at the Portuguese Oncology Institute of Porto (IPO-Porto), Portugal, whose cases are men with early-onset and/or familial prostate cancer and whose controls are blood donors, contributing to the PRACTICAL consortium's genome-wide association and polygenic risk studies of prostate cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-021-21287-0/MediaObjects/41467_2021_21287_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0142-8/MediaObjects/41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
