id: coho:COHO_0001934
name: obsolete Icelandic Pacemaker Population Sample
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Icelandic pacemaker sample is deCODE genetics' pacemaker population sample set (PMID:30271950, PMID:29050564): it is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog's name describes only that subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000428

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001935
name: Internet-based Students Health Research Enterprise
def: "An ongoing prospective internet-based cohort (e-cohort) of students aged 18 or over who are enrolled at a university or other higher education institution in France and can read French, recruiting since February 2013 with the support of the universities of Bordeaux, Versailles and Nice, which collects online questionnaires on sociodemographic and academic characteristics, health status, personal and family medical history, lifestyle and mental health to study the health of university students over ten years." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29113070", IAO:0000119="PMID:31167858"}
