id: coho:COHO_0001937
name: Investigation of Serial Studies to Predict Your Therapeutic Response with Imaging And molecular analysis 2
def: "An ongoing adaptive phase II platform clinical trial, run collaboratively by academic investigators, the US National Cancer Institute, the US Food and Drug Administration and industry under the Foundation for the NIH Biomarkers Consortium, conducted at multiple clinical sites in the United States with participants continuously enrolled since 2010, testing novel neoadjuvant therapeutic agents and biomarkers in women with locally advanced, high-risk breast cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:42530945", dcterms:contributor="Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19440188"}
