comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. deCODE genetics describes its sick sinus syndrome sample set among its Icelandic data ('The deCODE genetics SSS sample consisted of 3577 Icelanders diagnosed with SSS', PMID:33580673): the sample is part of the deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort. The Catalog's name describes only that disease subset and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000428 (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
