[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001943
name: obsolete Juvenile Diabetes Research Foundation/Wellcome Trust Diabetes and Inflammation Laboratorys British case collection
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Checked 2026-09-23: The PGS Catalog records no score or paper for this id (its REST record is empty); the name is copied from Todd et al. 2007 (PMID:17554260). The PGS Catalog name is the source of the id: Todd et al. 2007 calls the case sample 'the JDRF/WT Diabetes and Inflammation Laboratory's JDRF/WT British case collection (Genetic Resource Investigating Diabetes)', so the JDRF/WT British case collection is GRID, already in COHO as COHO:0001013 (whose definition already says it was assembled by the JDRF/WT Diabetes and Inflammation Laboratory). Add JDRF/WT as an acronym and the collection names as synonyms, and obsolete the placeholder COHO:0001943 in favour of COHO:0001013. Replaced by COHO:0001013 (Genetic Resource Investigating Diabetes), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0001013

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001944
name: Japanese Genetic Study Consortium for Alzheimer's Disease
def: "A case-control collection of blood samples from Japanese patients with clinically validated late-onset Alzheimer's disease meeting the NINCDS-ADRDA criteria and from elderly people without signs of dementia living unassisted in the local community, gathered by the members of the Japanese Genetic Study Consortium for Alzheimer's Disease for candidate-gene and genome-wide association studies of Alzheimer's disease in the Japanese population." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23565137", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39428694", IAO:0000119="PMID:18854865"}
