property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:23565137" xsd:string {dcterms:title="SORL1 is genetically associated with late-onset Alzheimer's disease in Japanese, Koreans and Caucasians.", xref="PMID:23565137", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A23565137+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="To discover susceptibility genes of late-onset Alzheimer's disease (LOAD), we conducted a 3-stage genome-wide association study (GWAS) using three populations: Japanese from the Japanese Genetic Consortium for Alzheimer Disease (JGSCAD), Koreans, and Caucasians from the Alzheimer Disease Genetic Consortium (ADGC)."}

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001945
name: obsolete Johns Hopkins Hospital
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Johns Hopkins Hospital (JHH) is an institution: the PGS Catalog cohort id denotes hospital-based case series from Johns Hopkins Hospital (prostate cancer patients undergoing radical prostatectomy in Black et al. 2020, pancreatic cancer cases in the PanScan scores), not a named cohort. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001946
name: obsolete Johns Hopkins Sibling and Family Heart Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Johns Hopkins Sibling and Family Heart Study is the former name of GeneSTAR: 'The study was originally known as the Johns Hopkins Sibling and Family Heart Study, and was more recently renamed GeneSTAR' (PMID:21785111). Replaced by COHO:0000455 (Genetic Study of Atherosclerosis Risk), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000455

