[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001948
name: Joslin Kidney Study
def: "A longitudinal observational study, led from the Research Division of the Joslin Diabetes Center in Boston, of adults with type 1 or type 2 diabetes attending the Joslin Clinic, enrolled in several cohorts from 1991 onwards with the aim of taking all eligible patients with albuminuria and a similar number drawn at random from those with normoalbuminuria, and followed for the development and progression of diabetic kidney disease, including kidney function decline and end-stage kidney disease." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:33883567", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39435665", IAO:0000119="https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf"}
