[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001965
name: Kick It at Swope III
def: "A randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled clinical trial (NCT00666978), conducted from December 2007 to May 2010 at an urban community-based clinic in Kansas City, Missouri, of sustained-release bupropion combined with health education counselling for smoking cessation in African American light smokers (10 or fewer cigarettes per day) aged 18 or older; the third of the Kick It at Swope trials." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22282543"}
