[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001972
name: Korean Epithelial Ovarian Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of epithelial ovarian cancer and benign epithelial ovarian neoplasms in Korea, which enrolled women with incident, histologically confirmed epithelial ovarian tumours at major general hospitals in Seoul and Gyeonggi-do, and as controls women without ovarian cancer undergoing health screening at general hospitals, collecting standardized interview questionnaires and biological specimens and following up the cases, to study the epidemiological and molecular risk factors and natural history of epithelial ovarian cancer in Koreans." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23098463", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10134271/fullTextXML"}
synonym: "Ko-EVE" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Ko-Eve" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Korean epithelial ovarian cancer study" RELATED []
