[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001977
name: Cooperative Health Research in the Region of Augsburg S3
def: "The third population-based survey of the Augsburg MONICA project, conducted in 1994/95 and continued within the KORA research platform, which examined a random sample of residents aged 25–74 of the city of Augsburg and surrounding counties in southern Germany; its participants were re-examined ten years later in the KORA F3 follow-up (2004/05)." [] {IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.501/MediaObjects/41588_2010_BFng501_MOESM25_ESM.pdf", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:16032513", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-022-32821-z/MediaObjects/41467_2022_32821_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fnature09270/MediaObjects/41586_2010_BFnature09270_MOESM283_ESM.pdf"}
