[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001978
name: Cooperative Health Research in the Region of Augsburg S4
def: "A population-based survey of the KORA research platform (the KORA-Survey 2000), conducted from October 1999 to July 2001, which examined residents of German nationality aged 25–74 living in the city of Augsburg and two adjacent counties in southern Germany, identified through the population registration office; its participants were re-examined in the KORA F4 follow-up (2006–2008)." [] {IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.501/MediaObjects/41588_2010_BFng501_MOESM25_ESM.pdf", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2685752/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-023-01314-0/MediaObjects/41588_2023_1314_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-022-32821-z/MediaObjects/41467_2022_32821_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
