[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001979
name: Seoul Colorectal Cancer Study
def: "A multicentre hospital-based case-control study of colorectal cancer in South Korea, whose cases were colorectal cancer patients admitted to two university hospitals and one general cancer hospital in the Seoul Metropolitan Area between 1995 and 2004, and whose controls were inpatients with non-neoplastic conditions at the same hospitals in the same period; it contributes to the genetic studies of the Asia Colorectal Cancer Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.nature.com/articles/ng.2985", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2985/MediaObjects/41588_2014_BFng2985_MOESM57_ESM.pdf"}
