id: coho:COHO_0001981
name: Kursk State Medical University Study
def: "A case-control study of asthma in adults of Russian origin from Central Russia, run by Kursk State Medical University, whose patients with asthma were recruited at the Department of Pulmonology of Kursk Regional Clinical Hospital in 2003–2004 and compared with controls matched for age and sex; further adult patients with asthma and healthy subjects from the same population were recruited in 2007–2008 for genome-wide association studies of asthma." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-017-0014-7"}
