id: coho:COHO_0001982
name: obsolete Karolinska University Hospital
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Karolinska University Hospital (KUH) is an institution: the PGS Catalog cohort id is the Swedish breast cancer replication sample of the deCODE genome-wide association study (Stacey et al. 2007) used for PGS001778, described by the Catalog only by its hospitals. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

