id: coho:COHO_0001987
name: Los Angeles Study of Aggressive Prostate Cancer
def: "A population-based case-control study of aggressive prostate cancer in Los Angeles County, California, run from the University of Southern California, whose cases were identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program and whose controls, men without prostate cancer frequency-matched to cases on age, were identified by a neighbourhood walk algorithm, with some controls drawn from the Multiethnic Cohort; it includes men of European, Latino and African ancestry." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31226226", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0142-8/MediaObjects/41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:38014910", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41391-020-00311-2/MediaObjects/41391_2020_311_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5448553/supplementaryFiles"}
