[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0001989
name: Latvian Diabetic Nephropathy Study
def: "A longitudinal study, started in 2013, of adults in Latvia with type 1 diabetes diagnosed before the age of 40, with insulin treatment started within one year of diagnosis and C-peptide below 0.3 nmol/L, excluding those with chronic kidney disease other than diabetic kidney disease, who are examined, give blood and urine samples and answer questionnaires at baseline and at follow-up visits every three years, to study diabetic kidney disease and the other complications of diabetes. It is part of the InterDiane consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39720301", IAO:0000119="PMID:37893052", IAO:0000119="PMID:35915454"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
synonym: "LatDiane" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "LatDiane study" RELATED []
synonym: "Latvian diabetic nephropathy study" RELATED []
