id: coho:COHO_0001991
name: Lung Cancer Cohort Consortium
def: "An international consortium of prospective cohort studies in North America, Europe, Asia and Australia, established in 2010 within the US National Cancer Institute Cohort Consortium, that pools harmonized risk-factor and lung cancer outcome data on the cohorts' participants, and prediagnostic blood samples of lung cancer cases and matched controls for biomarker studies, for research on lung cancer aetiology, risk prediction and early detection." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36653422", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39179310", IAO:0000119="PMID:36404465", IAO:0000119="PMID:40212049"}
