[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002006
name: Longitudinal Investigation of Thromboembolism Etiology
def: "A prospective study of venous thromboembolism occurrence in the United States that pools two multi-center, longitudinal, population-based cohort studies of white and African American men and women, the Atherosclerosis Risk in Communities (ARIC) Study and the Cardiovascular Health Study (CHS)." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23650146", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:26916295"}
