[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002007
name: Liver Biopsy Cohort
def: "A cross-sectional study of adults of European descent who underwent liver biopsy for suspected non-alcoholic steatohepatitis or for severe obesity, consecutively enrolled at the Metabolic Liver Diseases outpatient service and bariatric surgery centre of the Fondazione IRCCS Ca' Granda Ospedale Policlinico in Milan and at Palermo University Hospital, Italy, and in the Northern Savo Hospital District in Kuopio, Finland, excluding people with excess alcohol intake or other causes of liver disease, and used to study the genetics of non-alcoholic fatty liver disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29881818", IAO:0000119="PMID:35102341", IAO:0000119="PMID:29280273"}
