id: coho:COHO_0002008
name: Lung Institute of Western Australia Asthma Genetic Cohort
def: "A collection of adults of European ancestry with physician-diagnosed mild, moderate or severe asthma, recruited through the Lung Institute of Western Australia from specialty asthma clinics and hospital databases, together with non-asthmatic controls selected at random from the metropolitan telephone directory, assembled for studies of the genetics of asthma and its severity." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:24691493", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
