[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002009
name: Liverpool Lung Project
def: "A molecular epidemiological study of lung cancer in a defined area of Merseyside, England, with a high incidence of lung cancer, made up of a case-control study of newly diagnosed lung cancer cases matched 2:1 on age and sex, and a prospective cohort followed for ten years, to build a lung cancer risk model from epidemiological and molecular genetic risk factors and to find markers of preclinical carcinogenesis for early detection." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:12212983", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:16273220"}
