[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002013
name: Learning on Genetics of Schizophrenia Spectrum
def: "A Greek study of healthy young male army conscripts, randomly selected and recruited from June 2008 in waves at the Greek Army Training Camp in Heraklion, Crete, within their first two months of service and screened to exclude mental and physical illness, who were assessed on schizophrenia-related intermediate phenotypes (prepulse inhibition of the startle reflex, cognition, personality and schizotypal traits) and gave DNA, to study the genetics of the schizophrenia spectrum." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27336024", IAO:0000119="PMID:29036523", IAO:0000119="PMID:21471957"}
synonym: "Learning on Genetics of Schizophrenia" RELATED []
synonym: "Learning On Genetics Of Schizophrenia Spectrum" RELATED []
synonym: "Learning on Genetics of Schizophrenia Spectrum study" RELATED []
