[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002021
name: obsolete Landspitali University Hospital, Reykjavik
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. LUHR is the PGS Catalog's id for Landspitali University Hospital, Reykjavik, as a contributing site: the Icelandic BRCA1/BRCA2 carriers it contributed to CIMBA (called ILUH, 'Iceland Landspitali - University Hospital', in CIMBA's own lists; PMID:32665703, 28346442) and the hospital's ovarian cancer material in the deCODE BRIP1 study (PMID:21964575). None of these papers gives the sample a study name or a recruitment of its own beyond the hospital, so it is a site, not a named cohort. Note that the PGS Catalog's own id ILUH is a different thing (Infanta Leonor University Hospital, Madrid), so this is not a duplicate of E535. The Icelandic cohorts COHO already has (deCODE genetics Icelandic cohort COHO:0000428, Icelandic Cancer Registry COHO:0000096) are not this sample. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

