id: coho:COHO_0002028
name: obsolete Mexican-American families EBNA-1 GWAS
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. MAFEGWAS is the Mexican American family EBNA-1 GWAS of the San Antonio Family Heart Study, replicated in the San Antonio Family Diabetes/Gallbladder Study: the two studies of the San Antonio Family Study. The Catalog's name describes that analysis and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000649 (San Antonio Family Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
