id: coho:COHO_0002029
name: Multicenter Asthma Genetics in Childhood Study
def: "An observational study of children with physician-diagnosed asthma recruited from secondary and tertiary care centres in Germany and Austria for the genetics of childhood asthma, whose cases have been compared in genome-wide association studies with controls from the German arm of the International Study of Asthma and Allergies in Childhood Phase II, and whose participants were re-examined as adolescents and young adults in a follow-up stage, followMAGICS." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20860503", IAO:0000119="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8503671/", IAO:0000119="PMID:25930191"}
