id: coho:COHO_0002035
name: Mauritius study
def: "A type 2 diabetes case-control sample of adults of self-reported South Asian ancestry in Mauritius, drawn from a population-based survey of people aged 20 years and older undertaken in 1998, one of the national surveys of 1987, 1992 and 1998 that included a 2-hour 75-g oral glucose tolerance test." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21874001", IAO:0000119="PMID:15606693", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.921/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng921_MOESM16_ESM.pdf"}
