id: coho:COHO_0002038
name: Milan Breast Cancer Study Group
def: "A case-control study of breast cancer in Milan, Italy, whose cases are patients with familial or early-onset breast cancer who test negative for BRCA1 and BRCA2 mutations, ascertained from 2000 at two large cancer centres in Milan, and whose controls are female blood donors recruited at two Milan centres from 2004 and 2007; it is one of the studies of the Breast Cancer Association Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fnature24284/MediaObjects/41586_2017_BFnature24284_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:22267197"}
