name: obsolete Mexico City
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Mexico City (MC) is a city, and the PGS Catalog cohort id MC denotes the Mexico City type 2 diabetes samples that the GIANT body mass index study it is recorded for (Smit et al. 2025, PMID:40691366) acknowledges as Mexico City 1 and Mexico City 2 (MC1 & MC2), which are Mexico City sample 1 (COHO:0000738) and Mexico City sample 2 (COHO:0000737); both carry the names MC and Mexico City. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.
