[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002043
name: obsolete Manchester Cancer Research Centre
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Manchester Cancer Research Centre (MCRC), the PGS Catalog cohort id for the 1,202-participant validation cohort of Lebrett et al. 2023 (PMID:37154150; 652 surgical lung cancer patients and 550 Manchester Lung Health Check participants), is an institution, and the GWAS Catalog tags the same study as the Manchester Cancer Research Centre Biobank (GCST90315948, the example of COHO:0001371). Replaced by COHO:0001371, which carries the names MCRC and Manchester Cancer Research Centre. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0001371

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002044
name: Prostate Cancer Case-Control Studies at MD Anderson
def: "Epidemiological case-control studies of prostate cancer conducted since 1996 by the University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center in the Houston metropolitan area, whose cases, not restricted by Gleason score, stage or PSA, were accrued from institutions of the Houston Medical Center and whose controls were identified by random-digit dialling or among hospital visitors and frequency-matched to cases on age and race, with lifestyle, demographic and family-history data collected by a standardised questionnaire." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21637779", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs001391.v1.p1"}
