[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002045
name: obsolete MD Anderson Cancer Center Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The PGS Catalog id MDACCS (MD Anderson Cancer Center Study) stands for a different MD Anderson study in each GWAS it is recorded in: the lung cancer study (COHO:0000874), the melanoma study (COHO:0000875), the ovarian, prostate and renal cell cancer studies (COHO:0002047, COHO:0002044, COHO:0002048), and pancreatic cancer, glioma and colorectal cancer series COHO does not have. It is not one cohort; the id is an acronym of each of those terms. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true

