[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002049
name: MDD2000+ study
def: "A genome-wide association study of major depressive disorder that combined unrelated cases and screened controls from several sources genotyped on different platforms: Australian twins and their families recruited through the Australian Twin Registry by the Queensland Institute of Medical Research, the Netherlands Study of Depression and Anxiety, the Netherlands Twin Registry, patients of psychiatric hospitals in Scotland recruited by the University of Edinburgh, and controls from the Molecular Genetics of Schizophrenia study in the United States." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21042317"}
