id: coho:COHO_0002058
name: Mexican ancestry in Los Angeles, California
def: "A collection of DNA samples from people of Mexican ancestry in Los Angeles, California, one of the seven population samples added in phase 3 of the International HapMap Project and used as a reference for human genetic variation." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20811451"}
