[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002061
name: MGH Cardiology and Metabolic Patient Cohort
def: "A cohort of outpatients at Massachusetts General Hospital with recorded demographic data, medical and medication history and a resting electrocardiogram, many of whom also underwent an oral glucose tolerance test, genotyped genome-wide for genetic studies of cardiometabolic traits such as the QT interval, insulin secretion and body mass index." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:28986454", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29295838"}
