[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002065
name: obsolete Molecular Genetics of Schizophrenia - nonGAIN Sample
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. MGS_nonGAIN is the second genotyping phase of the Molecular Genetics of Schizophrenia case-control sample ('The remainder of the sample (called “nonGAIN” here) was genotyped in the same laboratory several months later', PMID:19571809). The Catalog's name describes only that phase and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000116 (Molecular Genetics of Schizophrenia Collaboration), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000116

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002066
name: obsolete Mexican Hypertriglyceridemia cohort
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. MHC is the Mexican Hypertriglyceridemia study (MexHTG) of the BMI GWAS of PMID:40691366, funded by the grant of the Mexican Hypertriglyceride Study (HL-095056). Replaced by COHO:0000734 (Mexican Hypertriglyceride Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000734

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002067
name: obsolete The University of Miami – Sylvester Comprehensive Cancer Center
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. The University of Miami – Sylvester Comprehensive Cancer Center (MIAMI-WFPCS) is an institution: the PGS Catalog cohort id is the PRACTICAL consortium’s site label for prostate cancer samples of the Sylvester Comprehensive Cancer Center in its African-ancestry analyses, not a named cohort. Found by the review of 2026-09-24.
property_value: IAO:0000116 "Identity resolved 2026-09-28: the PGS tag MIAMI-WFPCS denotes the Wake Forest University Prostate Cancer Study (COHO:0002564), as named in the prostate consortium cohort tables. The former institutional expansion is not carried as a cohort name. This deprecated term now has its biological replacement." xsd:string
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0002564

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002068
name: Midspan Family Study
def: "A general population study of families in the towns of Renfrew and Paisley in the west of Scotland, in which the locally resident adult offspring, aged 30 to 59, of couples who had taken part in the Renfrew and Paisley general population survey of 1972 to 1976 were surveyed in 1996 by questionnaire, clinical examination, spirometry and blood samples and then followed up for cardiovascular disease and death, to study familial and intergenerational influences on cardiovascular and respiratory health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23071162", IAO:0000119="PMID:12540691", IAO:0000119="PMID:26525718", IAO:0000119="PMID:10884260"}
synonym: "MIDSPAN" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "MIDSPAN Family Study" RELATED []
