[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002070
name: Microarray in Node-Negative and 1 to 3 Positive Lymph Node Disease May Avoid Chemotherapy
def: "A randomized phase III trial of the European Organisation for Research and Treatment of Cancer (EORTC 10041/BIG 3-04) that enrolled women aged 18–70 years with operable early-stage invasive breast cancer and up to three positive lymph nodes at institutions in nine European countries from 2007 to 2011, to test whether the 70-gene signature (MammaPrint), used with clinical-pathological criteria, can select patients for adjuvant chemotherapy." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:32719399", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27557300", IAO:0000119="PMID:36689693"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
