synonym: "EORTC 10041/BIG 3-04" RELATED []
synonym: "Microarray In Node-Negative and 1 to 3 Positive Lymph Node Disease May Avoid Chemotherapy Study" RELATED []
synonym: "Microarray in Node-negative Disease May Avoid Chemotherapy" RELATED []
synonym: "MINDACT" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
