[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002079
name: Mammography, Oestrogens and Growth Factors study
def: "An observational study of mammographic density nested within the intervention arm of the Age Trial, a British trial of annual mammographic screening in young women, which from 2000 to 2003 invited cancer-free women of the intervention arm who were still attending screening to give a blood sample and complete a questionnaire on demographic, anthropometric, lifestyle and reproductive characteristics, and enrolled women from 17 screening centres in England and Wales." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:19490643", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33495599", IAO:0000119="PMID:20144221"}
