[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002080
name: Molecular Markers in Treatment of Endometrial Cancer
def: "A prospective multicentre study of women treated for endometrial cancer (ClinicalTrials.gov NCT00598845), centred on Haukeland University Hospital in Bergen, Norway, that between May 2001 and February 2013 enrolled consenting patients at ten hospitals in Norway, Belgium and Sweden within the European Network for Individualized Treatment of Endometrial Cancer (ENITEC), collecting preoperative curettage or biopsy specimens, tumour tissue, blood and clinical follow-up to study molecular markers of lymph node metastasis and prognosis for preoperative risk stratification." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25897678", IAO:0000119="PMID:23932335", IAO:0000119="PMID:28771617", IAO:0000119="PMID:27135401"}
