id: coho:COHO_0002081
name: Monitoring National du Risque Artériel
def: "A population-based cross-sectional survey of cardiovascular risk factors in France, in which women and men aged 35 to 74 years were randomly selected from electoral rolls between 2005 and 2007 in three areas: the Lille urban community in northern France, the Bas-Rhin department in eastern France and the Haute-Garonne department in southwestern France." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:24885863", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40485857"}
