[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002082
name: Montreal/Boston Collection
def: "A collection of families of children with autism spectrum disorder, recruited in the Montreal and Quebec City regions of Canada and by investigators of the Autism Consortium of Boston in Massachusetts and surrounding states of the United States, including the Extreme Discordant Sib-Pair family sample. Funded in part by the Autism Consortium of Boston, its parent-offspring trios have been genotyped for autism genome-wide association studies, including those of the Psychiatric Genomics Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19812673", IAO:0000119="PMID:28540026", IAO:0000119="PMID:30804558"}
