[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002083
name: Systematic Investigation of the Molecular Causes of Major Mood Disorders and Schizophrenia
def: "A German research consortium, the Integrated Genome Research Network MooDS of the National Genome Research Network plus (NGFNplus), funded by the German Federal Ministry of Education and Research, whose groups collected and genotyped case-control samples for genome-wide association studies of schizophrenia in Germany and of bipolar disorder in Germany and in partner centres in Poland, Russia, Spain, Canada and Australia." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24618891", IAO:0000119="PMID:27694991", IAO:0000119="PMID:29906448", IAO:0000119="PMID:26854805"}
