[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002085
name: Mechanisms of Progression of Atopic Dermatitis to Asthma in Children
def: "A prospective early-life cohort of children with atopic dermatitis at Cincinnati Children's Hospital Medical Center, United States, recruited from late 2016 in the greater Cincinnati area (southwest Ohio and northern Kentucky) through public advertising or medical records, which enrols infants and toddlers with atopic dermatitis (at first aged 1–2 years, later from a few months of age) and follows them for five years with annual visits and extensive biospecimen collection from skin, blood and saliva, to define atopic dermatitis phenotypes and endotypes, the mechanisms of its progression to food allergy, asthma and other allergic disorders, and biomarkers of asthma risk." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32302785", IAO:0000119="PMID:38564302"}
synonym: "Mechanisms of Progression from Atopic Dermatitis to Asthma in Children" RELATED []
synonym: "Mechanisms of Progression of Atopic Dermatitis to Asthma in CHildren" RELATED []
synonym: "MPAACH" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
