id: coho:COHO_0002087
name: Malmö Preventive Project atrial fibrillation study
def: "A nested case-control study of atrial fibrillation within the Malmö Preventive Project in Malmö, Sweden, in which participants with prevalent or incident atrial fibrillation identified from national registers, with DNA from the project's 2002-2006 re-examination, were matched one to one to controls from the same cohort by sex, age and date of baseline examination." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29892015"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
