relationship: coho:isSubCohortOf coho:COHO_0000787 {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7083427/fullTextXML", comment="Hence, our aim in this observational study was to investigate SNPs with documented association with diabetes and their further association with one of the earliest signs of left ventricular dysfunction (i.e. diastolic dysfunction) in two independent Swedish population UCG cohorts: the population‐based Malmö Preventive Project‐Re‐examination Study UCG (MPP‐RES UCG) and the VARA UCG."}
