id: coho:COHO_0002097
name: Montreal Gene-Environment Breast Cancer Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of breast cancer in Montreal, Canada, whose cases were postmenopausal women aged 47 to 75 years living in Montreal with a first primary invasive breast cancer, identified from 2007 to 2010 in 15 of the 16 Montreal hospitals that treat breast cancer, and whose controls were a random sample of women living in Montreal from the provincial voter registration list, frequency-matched to cases on age; a member study of the Breast Cancer Association Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29059683", IAO:0000119="PMID:23535729"}
