id: coho:COHO_0002098
name: Minnesota Twin Family Registry
def: "A birth-record-based registry of twins born in Minnesota, United States, identified from Minnesota State birth certificates and enrolled by mailed questionnaires together with their parents, spouses, siblings and children, covering twins born 1904–1934, 1936–1955 and 1961–1964 who were assessed in middle and older adulthood, with subsets later assessed in person, as one of the studies of the Minnesota Center for Twin and Family Research." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:2392892", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:31796137", IAO:0000119="PMID:9108705"}
synonym: "Minnesota Twin Registry" RELATED []
synonym: "MTR" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
