[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002099
name: Munich-MI study
def: "A case-control study of early-onset myocardial infarction recruited at the German Heart Center in Munich, Germany, with cases who had a myocardial infarction before age 41 (men) or 56 (women) and controls from German population studies without myocardial infarction or coronary artery disease over age 65 (men) or 75 (women), exome-sequenced in the Myocardial Infarction Genetics Exome Sequencing Consortium to find genetic contributors to early myocardial infarction." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000916.v1.p1"}
