id: coho:COHO_0002105
name: Greek NAFLD study
def: "A case-control study of non-alcoholic fatty liver disease run by Harokopio University of Athens in Greek adults without secondary liver disease or excessive alcohol intake, recruited between 2012 and 2015 at the outpatient clinics of the First Department of Propaedeutic and Internal Medicine, Laiko General Hospital, Athens, and classified as cases or controls by degree of hepatic steatosis." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11765347/fullTextXML", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
