comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. NAG/IRPG is the Australian Nicotine Addiction Genetics families with genome-wide genotypes from the Interactive Research Project Grants (PMID:22833196), one of the three coordinated studies of the Australian Alcohol and Nicotine Studies. Replaced by COHO:0000841 (Australian Alcohol and Nicotine Studies), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
