[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002117
name: Nanjing and Beijing Lung Cancer Studies
def: "A two-centre case-control genome-wide association study of lung cancer in Han Chinese in China, made up of the Nanjing Study (with participants from Nanjing and Shanghai) and the Beijing Study, whose cases had histopathologically or cytologically confirmed lung cancer and whose controls, frequency-matched to the cases for age, sex and region, were people receiving routine physical examinations in local hospitals or taking part in community screening for noncommunicable diseases." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23469231", IAO:0000119="PMID:22899653", IAO:0000119="PMID:23341777"}
synonym: "NBLCS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
