[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002120
name: Nijmegen Cervical Artery Dissection Collection
def: "A collection of patients with cervical artery dissection, of European origin, at Radboud University Nijmegen Medical Centre, the Netherlands, drawn in part from the FUTURE study and meeting the inclusion criteria of the CADISP study, which with controls from Nijmegen and the Rotterdam Study formed one of the follow-up samples of the 2015 genome-wide association study of cervical artery dissection." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:25420145", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3154/MediaObjects/41588_2015_BFng3154_MOESM24_ESM.pdf"}
