[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002124
name: National Cancer Institute-Surveillance, Epidemiology, and End Results Interdisciplinary Case-Control Study of Non-Hodgkin's Lymphoma
def: "A multicentre population-based case-control study of non-Hodgkin lymphoma in the United States, run by the US National Cancer Institute, whose cases were people with a first primary non-Hodgkin lymphoma (excluding people infected with HIV) identified through four Surveillance, Epidemiology, and End Results cancer registries (Detroit, Iowa, Los Angeles and Seattle), and whose controls from the same areas were matched on area, age and race and found by random digit dialling (under 65) or from Medicare files (65 and over)." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15342441", IAO:0000119="PMID:26956414", IAO:0000119="PMID:29674426"}
