id: coho:COHO_0002125
name: North Carolina Ovarian Cancer Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of epithelial ovarian cancer in 48 counties of central and eastern North Carolina, United States, in which women diagnosed with ovarian cancer from 1999 to 2008 were identified by rapid case ascertainment and controls from the same region were selected by random digit dialing and frequency-matched to the cases on age and race." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36688720", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19127255", IAO:0000119="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3650102/", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.668/MediaObjects/41588_2010_BFng668_MOESM17_ESM.pdf"}
