[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002127
name: National Colorectal Cancer Cohort
def: "A prospective cohort study in China, coordinated by the Second Affiliated Hospital of Zhejiang University, of risk factors and biomarkers across the colorectal cancer continuum from aetiology to survivorship, made up of a screening cohort of people at high risk of colorectal cancer recruited from 2016 to 2020, first in Jiashan County, Zhejiang Province, and a multicentre cohort of patients newly diagnosed with colorectal cancer recruited from 2015 to 2020 at 16 hospitals in 11 provinces and followed up after surgery." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8672005/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="PMID:34903541"}
