id: coho:COHO_0002128
name: Norfolk Diabetes Case-Control Study
def: "A type 2 diabetes case-control study in Norfolk, UK, whose cases were men and women with type 2 diabetes identified through general practice diabetes registers and local hospital diabetes clinic and retinal screening programme registers in Norfolk, and whose controls, free of known diabetes, were randomly selected from participants of the EPIC-Norfolk cohort." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23702607", IAO:0000119="PMID:22039354"}
