[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002129
name: Northern Dutch Hodgkin Lymphoma Study
def: "A population-based series of patients with Hodgkin lymphoma diagnosed in the northern Netherlands between 1987 and 2009, whose tumours were classified by WHO criteria and Epstein-Barr virus status and whose germline DNA, with that of first-degree relatives of patients diagnosed up to 2000, was used to study HLA associations with Epstein-Barr virus-positive and -negative Hodgkin lymphoma; its classical Hodgkin lymphoma cases were one of the five case series of the European genome-wide association study of classical Hodgkin lymphoma." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:22286212", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24920014", IAO:0000119="PMID:15978930"}
synonym: "NDHLS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
