comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. In the only paper the PGS Catalog records the id in (PMID:33958783), NET-PD is the NET-PD Long-term Study-1. Replaced by COHO:0001161 (National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke Exploratory Trials in Parkinson's Disease Long-Term Study-1), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
