name: Nanjing colorectal cancer GWAS
def: "A case-control sample of Han Chinese adults assembled by Nanjing Medical University in Nanjing, China, for genome-wide association studies of colorectal cancer, whose cases are patients with colorectal cancer recruited at the Cancer Center of Nanjing Medical University from September 2010 and whose cancer-free controls come from the same districts of Nanjing." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:41851747", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27145994"}
