[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002163
name: NL4
def: "A case-control cohort from the population-based registry of amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS) in the Netherlands, one of the cohorts of the international ALS genome-wide association study linked to Project MinE, whose cases have probable or definite ALS diagnosed by neurologists at the tertiary referral centres University Medical Center Utrecht, Academic Medical Centre Amsterdam and Radboud University Medical Center Nijmegen, and whose controls, free of neuromuscular disease and matched for age, sex and ethnicity, were ascertained through a population-based study of ALS in the Netherlands. Its genotyped controls have been reused as a Dutch control group in other genetic association studies." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:33495596", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3622/MediaObjects/41588_2016_BFng3622_MOESM43_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:27455348"}
