id: coho:COHO_0002164
name: Nijmegen Lung and Bladder Cancer sample
def: "A Dutch sample of three groups from Nijmegen, the Netherlands: population controls from the Nijmegen Biomedical Study, patients with urinary bladder cancer recruited for the Nijmegen Bladder Cancer Study, and patients with lung cancer identified through the population-based cancer registry of the Comprehensive Cancer Center IKO and recruited for a study of gene–environment interactions in lung cancer; it was one of the samples of the ENGAGE consortium's genome-wide association analysis of the number of cigarettes smoked per day." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20418888"}
