[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002172
name: NordicDB
def: "A database and web portal set up in the Nordic countries that pools genome-wide SNP genotypes of control individuals from Finnish, Swedish and Danish studies, with country-specific allele frequencies, so that genetic association studies in the Nordic countries can use them as shared controls." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20664631"}
