id: coho:COHO_0002187
name: NSW non-Hodgkin lymphoma study
def: "A population-based case-control study of non-Hodgkin lymphoma in adults aged 20–74 years in New South Wales and the Australian Capital Territory, Australia, whose cases were diagnosed in 2000–2001 and identified through the New South Wales or Australian Capital Territory cancer registries (excluding people with HIV infection and transplant recipients), and whose controls were randomly selected from the electoral rolls and frequency-matched on age, sex and state or territory of residence." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24069324", IAO:0000119="PMID:25261932", IAO:0000119="PMID:26340796"}
