id: coho:COHO_0002188
name: obsolete Nijmegen Thyroid Cancer Cohort
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. NTCC names no study: it is the Nijmegen thyroid cancer case-control set of deCODE genetics' thyroid cancer GWAS, patients of the Radboud University Nijmegen Medical Centre with Nijmegen Biomedical Study controls, which the papers call only the Dutch study population (PMID:22267200, PMID:24586183). Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002189
name: Northeastern Taiwan Community Medicine Research Cohort
def: "A prospective community-based cohort on disease prevention and health promotion, run by the Community Medicine Research Center of Chang Gung Memorial Hospital in Keelung since 2013, that enrols volunteers aged 20 or over living in Keelung City and New Taipei City in northeastern Taiwan through community health outreach sessions with a health examination, questionnaires and biological sampling, and follows them up." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35820405", IAO:0000119="PMID:35460926", IAO:0000119="https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT04839796"}
