[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002190
name: National Taiwan University Hospital Diabetes Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of type 2 diabetes in Han Chinese adults in Taiwan, whose cases were patients with type 2 diabetes diagnosed by American Diabetes Association criteria (onset at age 35 or older) recruited from the metabolism clinics of National Taiwan University Hospital, Taipei, and whose controls were people with normal glucose tolerance on a 75-g oral glucose tolerance test recruited from routine health examinations; it was a replication study of the Asian Genetic Epidemiology Network's type 2 diabetes genome-wide meta-analysis." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22158537"}
