[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002193
name: New Zealand CAD Study
def: "A case-control sample of patients with angiographically proven coronary artery disease (stenosis of at least 50% of the vessel diameter in at least one coronary artery) from the Otago-Southland region of New Zealand, with age-matched controls from the same region who had no history of ischaemic heart disease, assembled alongside abdominal aortic aneurysm and peripheral arterial disease series from the same region; it served as a replication sample in genetic studies of coronary artery disease." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:18239157", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21378990", IAO:0000119="PMID:19198610"}
