[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002201
name: Ogliastra Genetic Park
def: "A population-based study of a genetic isolate in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, in which the inhabitants of ten villages (Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai), invited by public proclamations and letters to every family, took part from 2002 to 2008 in a cross-sectional epidemiological survey with blood sampling and extended pedigrees, to study the genetic and environmental determinants of complex traits." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26180744", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23527229", IAO:0000119="PMID:23382888"}
