comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Ottawa Heart Study of PMID:28209224 cites the design paper of the Ottawa Heart Genomics Study (PMID:17478681) and has its design. Replaced by COHO:0002202 (Ottawa Heart Genomics Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0002202

