id: coho:COHO_0002205
name: Ocular Hypertension Treatment Study
def: "A multicentre randomised clinical trial at 22 clinical centres in the United States that from 1994 to 1996 enrolled people aged 40 to 80 with ocular hypertension and no evidence of glaucomatous damage, randomised them to topical ocular hypotensive medication or close observation, and followed them for the onset of primary open-angle glaucoma." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:39346574", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:12049574", IAO:0000119="PMID:10326953"}
