[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002211
name: Orofacial Pain: Prospective Evaluation and Risk Assessment
def: "A multicentre study of temporomandibular disorder (TMD) that from 2006 recruited community volunteers aged 18 to 44 years in and around four US academic health centres (in Baltimore, Buffalo, Chapel Hill and Gainesville) into a prospective cohort of people free of TMD, followed for first-onset TMD, and a baseline case-control study comparing people with chronic TMD with controls drawn from the cohort, to identify risk factors for TMD pain." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22074749", IAO:0000119="PMID:22074754"}
synonym: "OPPERA" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "OPPERA study" RELATED []
synonym: "Orofacial Pain Prospective Evaluation and Risk Assessment" RELATED []
synonym: "Prospective Evaluation and Risk Assessment" RELATED []
