id: coho:COHO_0002221
name: Ovarian Cancer in Alberta and British Columbia Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of ovarian cancer in the Canadian provinces of British Columbia and Alberta, running from 2002 to 2012, whose British Columbia cases were identified through the British Columbia Cancer Registry and controls through the provincial health roster, with data collected by self-completed questionnaire from 2002 to 2004 and by interview from 2004 to 2012. It is one of the studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36688720", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3108163/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.668/MediaObjects/41588_2010_BFng668_MOESM17_ESM.pdf"}
