[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002235
name: Predictive Values of Blood Pressure and Arterial Stiffness in Institutionalized Very Aged Population Study
def: "An observational cohort of people aged 80 years or older living in 72 nursing homes in France and Italy, recruited between January 2006 and June 2008 by four French and two Italian university hospital centres and followed for two years, to determine how well blood pressure and arterial stiffness predict mortality and major cardiovascular events in very old institutionalised people." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22999729", IAO:0000119="PMID:41307346"}
