[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002247
name: obsolete PEGASUS-TIMI 54
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. PEGASUS-TIMI_54 is the PEGASUS-TIMI 54 trial of ticagrelor after myocardial infarction, pooled with other TIMI trials in the papers the PGS Catalog records the id in (PMID:33185476, PMID:36474045, PMID:41419686). Replaced by COHO:0002246 (Prevention of Cardiovascular Events in Patients with Prior Heart Attack Using Ticagrelor Compared to Placebo on a Background of Aspirin), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0002246

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002248
name: Peru Genetics and Genomics of Breast Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based cohort of women diagnosed with invasive breast cancer in 2010 or later at ages 21 to 79 and recruited at the Instituto Nacional de Enfermedades Neoplásicas (INEN) in Lima, Peru, who complete a standardised survey and give a blood sample for genotyping, with tumour subtypes from pathology at INEN, used to study genetic ancestry and other factors in breast cancer among Peruvian women." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36925912"}
