[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002253
name: obsolete Mass General Brigham - Host Vulnerability to COVID-19
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. PHBB is the Mass General Brigham Biobank's contribution to the COVID-19 Host Genetics Initiative, drawn from the biobank's own participants (PMID:36013271). The Catalog's name is that of the COVID-19 analysis and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000383 (Mass General Brigham Biobank), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000383

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002254
name: obsolete Pirkanmaa Hospital District
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. Pirkanmaa Hospital District (PHD) is the Finnish health-care district around Tampere, not a study. The PGS Catalog id is its label for 2283 clinically diagnosed prostate cancer cases from the district's hospital (Tampere University Hospital) in PMID:33051487 (E895.4, Table 1 'Clinical cases (Pirkanmaa Hospital)'), used with FinRSPC cases and controls in a PRS evaluation; the paper gives the case series no study name or recruitment design of its own. The FinRSPC part is a separate id. Other papers found by the name use the district only as a place. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002255
name: Philadelphia Cohort
def: "A case–control collection of people with epilepsy and controls of African-American and European-American ancestry, assembled in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, United States, with approval from the review boards of Thomas Jefferson University Hospital, the Children's Hospital of Philadelphia, the University of Pennsylvania and other centres in the United States and Canada, genotyped on Illumina arrays and contributed to the genome-wide association meta-analyses of the ILAE Consortium on Complex Epilepsies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:25087078", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-018-07524-z/MediaObjects/41467_2018_7524_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
