[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002259
name: obsolete PICO
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. PICO is the PGS Catalog's mistyping of PLCO: its two scores from one paper list the same 95 cohorts, with PLCO in one and PICO in the other in the same place (PGS000351, PGS000352). Replaced by COHO:0000485 (Prostate, Lung, Colorectal, and Ovarian Cancer Screening Trial), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000485

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002260
name: Prospective Imaging Study of Ageing: Genes, Brain and Behaviour
def: "A prospective cohort of healthy midlife and older adults from across Australia, recruited using genetic prediction to be enriched for high and low genetic risk of Alzheimer's disease and followed longitudinally with online surveys and cognitive testing, with at-risk participants and a clinical group of patients with mild cognitive impairment or early Alzheimer's disease invited for neuroimaging, detailed neurocognitive testing and blood sampling, to find the earliest signs and modifiable risk factors of Alzheimer's disease; approved by the ethics committee of QIMR Berghofer Medical Research Institute." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33341723", IAO:0000119="PMID:40759756"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
