[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002263
name: obsolete Princess Margaret Cancer Centre
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Princess Margaret Cancer Centre, Toronto, is a cancer hospital; no score in the PGS Catalog uses the id, and every paper found by the name is a different clinical series at the hospital. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002264
name: Pharmacogenomics of Metformin
def: "A pharmacogenomic study of glycaemic response to metformin and sulfonylureas in adults with type 2 diabetes who are members of Kaiser Permanente in the United States, with drug response defined from HbA1c measurements and prescriptions in electronic health records. Its first cohort, PMET1 (previously named PMT2, from the Pharmacogenomics of Membrane Transporters project of the NIH Pharmacogenomics Research Network), was drawn from the Genetic Epidemiology Research on Adult Health and Aging (GERA) cohort of the Kaiser Permanente Research Program on Genes, Environment, and Health in Northern California; Kaiser Permanente Northern California also supplied the phenotype data of a second cohort, PMET2." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:42504935", IAO:0000119="PMID:29650774", IAO:0000119="PMID:34607834", IAO:0000119="PMID:27500523"}
synonym: "Pharmacogenomics of metformin study" RELATED []
synonym: "PMET" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
