[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002281
name: Progression in Cancer of the Prostate
def: "A nationwide Swedish cohort of men with localized prostate cancer, drawn from the National Prostate Cancer Register of Sweden Follow-up Study (men registered in 1997-2002 with localized disease, PSA below 20 ng/mL and age 70 or younger at diagnosis), whose members still alive in 2007 answered a lifestyle questionnaire and gave a blood sample for genetic analysis in 2007-2008, to study genetic and lifestyle factors in prostate cancer progression and survival." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:31343436", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
