id: coho:COHO_0002282
name: Prognostic Genetic factors in Multiple Sclerosis
def: "A cross-sectional multicentre study of multiple sclerosis in continental Italy (excluding Sardinia), coordinated from Novara (the AOU Maggiore della Carità and the University of Piemonte Orientale), in which consecutive patients with multiple sclerosis of Italian ancestry, mostly from north-west Italy, were recruited through hospital-based clinics and gave DNA, to study genetic factors in multiple sclerosis, in particular prognostic ones." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23785401", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29587799", IAO:0000119="PMID:21833088", IAO:0000119="PMID:38927672"}
