[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002289
name: Prostate Cancer: Mechanisms of Progression and Treatment
def: "A UK prostate cancer study run from Cambridge as a National Cancer Research Institute and Medical Research Council collaborative linked to the ProtecT trial, which collected biological samples (including tissue and urine) and data from men with and without prostate cancer attending hospital outpatient clinics, for a bio-repository used to study the mechanisms of prostate cancer progression and treatment." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27225428", IAO:0000119="PMID:29892016", IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs001391.v1.p1"}
