[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002290
name: Profiling Parkinson's disease
def: "A hospital-based longitudinal cohort of patients with idiopathic Parkinson's disease, recruited from neurology clinics of university and regional hospitals in the western Netherlands across strata of age at onset and disease duration and examined mainly at Leiden University Medical Center, who were assessed on a broad range of motor and non-motor features at baseline in 2003-2005 and annually for five years, to profile the clinical course of the disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27126456", IAO:0000119="PMID:27717005"}
