id: coho:COHO_0002294
name: Pravastatin or Atorvastatin Evaluation and Infection Therapy-Thrombolysis In Myocardial Infarction 22
def: "A double-blind randomised trial in patients hospitalised for an acute coronary syndrome within the preceding 10 days that compared standard statin therapy (pravastatin 40 mg daily) with intensive statin therapy (atorvastatin 80 mg daily), and long-term treatment with the antibiotic gatifloxacin with placebo, for the prevention of death and major cardiovascular events." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15843667", IAO:0000119="PMID:14980229", IAO:0000119="PMID:15007110"}
