id: coho:COHO_0002295
name: Pharma SNP Consortium
def: "A collection of DNA samples and Epstein-Barr virus-transformed cell lines from healthy Japanese volunteers, recruited through the Pharma SNP Consortium in Tokyo, whose health was checked through the consortium; the samples were used for a database of SNPs and haplotypes in drug-related genes and as controls in genetic association studies of the Japanese population." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18199129", IAO:0000119="PMID:34246321", IAO:0000119="PMID:22291604", IAO:0000119="PMID:15202072"}
