[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002306
name: QUASAR 2
def: "An open-label randomised phase 3 trial in which patients aged 18 or older who had undergone potentially curative surgery for stage III or high-risk stage II colorectal cancer were recruited at 170 hospitals in seven countries, led from the United Kingdom, between 2005 and 2010 and randomly assigned to adjuvant capecitabine alone or capecitabine plus bevacizumab, to test whether bevacizumab improves disease-free survival." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.isrctn.com/api/query/format/default?q=ISRCTN45133151", IAO:0000119="PMID:27660192"}
