[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002310
name: Réseau Français de la Génétique de la Sclérose En Plaques
def: "A French national network for the genetic study of multiple sclerosis that since 1992 has recruited people with multiple sclerosis, with the parents and siblings of patients in trio and multiplex families, through physicians at hospital centres across France and through advertising campaigns run with patient associations, confirming each diagnosis by a network physician and collecting clinical information and a blood sample, and whose biological resource centre keeps DNA and cell lines for genetic studies of multiple sclerosis." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:31961910", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22085902", IAO:0000119="PMID:24076602", IAO:0000119="PMID:38880029", IAO:0000119="PMID:21833088"}
