[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002311
name: Girona Heart Registry
def: "A population-based study of cardiovascular disease in the province of Girona, north-eastern Spain, run by the REGICOR study group of the Hospital del Mar Research Institute, Barcelona. It began as a registry of patients with myocardial infarction in Girona, with data from 1978, and its population cohort, established in 1995 to study the prevalence and control of cardiovascular risk factors, novel risk factors and biomarkers of cardiovascular disease and cardiovascular risk prediction, combines participants of four surveys (1995, 2000, 2005 and 2018) randomly sampled from towns of the province and the city of Girona. Participants were re-examined, followed up for cardiovascular and other events and death, including by linkage to electronic health records, and genotyped, with other omics measured in subsets." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40611603", IAO:0000119="PMID:37781316", IAO:0000119="PMID:7588921", IAO:0000119="PMID:16371198"}
