id: coho:COHO_0002313
name: Randomized Trial to Prevent Vascular Events in HIV
def: "A multicentre, international, phase 3, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial (ACTG A5332) of pitavastatin calcium for the primary prevention of major adverse cardiovascular events in adults with HIV on antiretroviral therapy and at low-to-moderate traditional cardiovascular risk, which enrolled participants from 2015 to 2019 at sites in 12 countries across five Global Burden of Disease regions." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:39435321", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40207047", IAO:0000119="PMID:38533953"}
