id: coho:COHO_0002316
name: The Resource for the Study of Lung Cancer Epidemiology in North Trent
def: "A case-control study of lung cancer epidemiology run from Sheffield, England, since 2006, which recruits pathologically confirmed lung cancer cases diagnosed at age 60 or younger (or older with a family history of lung cancer) and family-matched controls through several cancer treatment centres, mostly in North Trent, collecting a lifestyle, occupational-exposure and family-history questionnaire and blood for DNA." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28604730"}
