[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002319
name: RuiJin T2D Study
def: "A case-control genome-wide association study of type 2 diabetes in Han Chinese at Ruijin Hospital, Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine, in Shanghai, China, whose cases were patients with type 2 diabetes recruited from the hospital's outpatient departments and whose healthy controls were drawn from a glucose survey in Youyi community, Baoshan district, Shanghai; its genome-wide data were one of the Stage 1 studies of the 2015 meta-analysis of genome-wide association studies of adult height in East Asians." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21799836", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/instance/4351379/bin/supp_ddu583_ddu583supp.doc", IAO:0000119="PMID:25429064"}
