id: coho:COHO_0002323
name: Royal Marsden Hospital Trust/Institute of Cancer Research Family History and DNA Registry
def: "A collection of DNA samples from people with cancer, among them colorectal cancer patients, and from healthy people who were the spouses or unrelated friends of patients with malignancies, recruited from 1999 through the Institute of Cancer Research and the Royal Marsden Hospital NHS Trust in the United Kingdom for genetic epidemiological studies of cancer susceptibility." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22076443", IAO:0000119="PMID:17615053", IAO:0000119="PMID:20949628", IAO:0000119="PMID:19050702"}
