[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002325
name: Research on Osteoarthritis/Osteoporosis Against Disability
def: "A population-based cohort study of osteoarthritis and osteoporosis in Japan, established in 2005 to build epidemiological indices for skeletal diseases, whose participants were recruited from resident registration listings in three communities (urban Itabashi in Tokyo, and mountainous Hidakagawa and coastal Taiji in Wakayama Prefecture) for a baseline survey in 2005–2007 with radiographic examinations and questionnaires, and have been re-examined in follow-up surveys since." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19410032", IAO:0000119="PMID:39968102"}
synonym: "Research on Osteoarthritis Against Disability" RELATED []
synonym: "Research on Osteoarthritis Against Disability study" RELATED []
synonym: "Research on Osteoarthritis/Osteoporosis Against Disability study" RELATED []
synonym: "ROAD" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "ROAD study" RELATED []
