id: coho:COHO_0002329
name: Rotterdam-Clinic study
def: "A clinic-based series of patients with advanced age-related macular degeneration (choroidal neovascularisation, geographic atrophy, or one in each eye), recruited through ophthalmology clinics in Rotterdam, ascertained by fundus examination and optical coherence tomography and graded with a Wisconsin/modified International system, which contributed advanced-AMD cases, without intermediate-AMD cases or controls, to the genome-wide association study of the International AMD Genomics Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3448/MediaObjects/41588_2016_BFng3448_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
