[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002330
name: Roswell Park Cancer Institute Data Bank and BioRepository
def: "A biobank at Roswell Park Cancer Institute in Buffalo, New York, that collects blood samples before treatment, clinical data and an epidemiological questionnaire from patients newly diagnosed with cancer at the institute and, as controls, from people with no personal history of cancer (family members and friends of patients and community members), and supplies them to cancer research studies." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:16985014", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21386992", IAO:0000119="PMID:22969801"}
