[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002331
name: Rugao Longevity and Ageing Study
def: "A population-based observational cohort study in Rugao, a city in Jiangsu province, China, with two arms: a longevity arm that in 2007–2008 recruited long-lived residents aged 95 years and over together with population controls drawn at random from the resident registry, and an ageing arm that in 2014 randomly recruited residents aged 70–84 years from rural communities of Jiang'an Township by age and sex strata and is followed up longitudinally, both examined with structured questionnaires, physical examinations and blood samples to study longevity and ageing." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28134330", IAO:0000119="PMID:31906855"}
synonym: "Rugao Longevity and Aging Study" RELATED []
synonym: "RuLAS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "The Rugao Longevity and Ageing Study" RELATED []
