relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/China {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5278549/fullTextXML", comment="All data used in this study were obtained from the RuLAS, a population-based observational two-arm cohort study performed in Rugao, a typical medium-sized city of Jiangsu province, China."}
relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Eastern_Asia
property_value: IAO:0000112 "PMID:28134330" xsd:string {dcterms:title="Associations of triglyceride levels with longevity and frailty: A Mendelian randomization analysis.", xref="PMID:28134330", xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5278549/fullTextXML", comment="Based on data from the Rugao Longevity and Ageing Study (RuLAS), we used MR analysis to determine whether the observational associations of triglyceride levels with the two ageing phenotypes, longevity and frailty, are causal."}

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002332
name: obsolete Rural cohort
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The KoGES rural cohort was renamed the Cardiovascular Disease Association Study: 'the Cardiovascular disease association study (CAVAS) cohort (formerly RURAL cohort)' (PMC7670174). Replaced by COHO:0000629 (Cardiovascular Disease Association Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000629

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002333
name: obsolete Rush University Medical Centre- Memory and Aging Project
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. RUSHMAP is not the university: in the source GWAS (Okbay et al. 2016, SSGAC well-being, depressive symptoms and neuroticism) it is the Rush Memory and Aging Project, which COHO already has as COHO:0000810. The supplement names it 'Rush University Medical Center - Memory and Aging Project' and 'Rush MAP' and thanks 'the study participants of the Rush Memory and Aging Project'. It is not ROSMAP (COHO:0000400): the Religious Orders Study is not part of this id. Add RUSHMAP as an acronym and the Catalog's and the paper's spellings as synonyms of COHO:0000810. The placeholder COHO:0002333 is then a duplicate. No COHO term carries RUSHMAP or 'Rush MAP', so there is no clash. Replaced by COHO:0000810 (Rush Memory and Aging Project), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000810

