id: coho:COHO_0002339
name: Stanford Aging and Memory Study
def: "A longitudinal study of healthy ageing at Stanford University in which cognitively unimpaired older adults, recruited through advertisements in the Bay Area, undergo neuropsychological assessment, brain imaging and fluid biomarker sampling, with a focus on medial temporal lobe function and episodic memory." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:32469308", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39528825", IAO:0000119="PMID:33408146"}
