name: Spanish Cervical Artery Dissection Collection
def: "A collection of patients with cervical artery dissection in Barcelona, Spain, which contributed patients of European origin, meeting the inclusion criteria of the CADISP study, to the second sample (CADISP-2) of the 2015 genome-wide association study of cervical artery dissection and, from Hospital Vall d'Hebron, patients and controls to its follow-up sample." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:25420145", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3154/MediaObjects/41588_2015_BFng3154_MOESM24_ESM.pdf"}
