[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002350
name: obsolete Singapore Cardiovascular Cohort Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Singapore Cardiovascular Cohort Study 2 is published jointly with the Singapore Prospective Study Program as one study, SP2/SCCS2 (PMID:19914996, PMID:23405065). The bare name the Catalog gives, Singapore Cardiovascular Cohort Study, is that of the earlier cohort it re-examined and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0000481 (Singapore Prospective Study Program), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0000481

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002351
name: Subjective Cognitive Impairment Cohort
def: "A prospective cohort study, with inclusion from June 2014, of consecutive patients with subjective cognitive decline, without major psychiatric or neurological disorders, who presented at the memory clinic of the Alzheimer Center of VU University Medical Center Amsterdam, the Netherlands. After the clinic's standardised dementia screening they are followed annually, with repeated blood and cerebrospinal fluid collection for biobanking and optional amyloid PET, to study clinical progression and the factors contributing to subjective cognitive decline." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30081935"}
subset: coho1:PGS_subset
synonym: "SCIENCe" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
