[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002354
name: Singapore Cohort Study of the Risk Factors for Myopia
def: "A school-based cohort study of myopia in Singapore children, begun in three Singapore schools in 1999–2001, which recruited children aged 7 to 9 years and examined them yearly in their schools, with cycloplegic autorefraction and ocular biometry, to study the risk factors for the onset and progression of myopia." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33344056", IAO:0000119="PMID:16234459"}
