[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002356
name: Shanghai Diabetes Genetic Study
def: "A genome-wide association study of type 2 diabetes in Chinese women in Shanghai, contributed by Vanderbilt University and the Shanghai Cancer Institute, whose cases were incident type 2 diabetes cases from the Shanghai Women's Health Study and prevalent cases found among the controls of the Shanghai Breast Cancer Study, and whose controls were women from the general population free of cancer and diabetes, shared with the Shanghai Breast Cancer Genetics Study. Genotyped on the Affymetrix Genome-Wide Human SNP Array 6.0, it has also been pooled with the Shanghai breast and endometrial cancer genetics studies for genetic analyses of other traits in women." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:20862305", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.1019/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng1019_MOESM23_ESM.pdf", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22158264", IAO:0000119="PMID:23406970"}
