[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002357
name: Study of Digestive Health
def: "A population-based case-control study of Barrett's oesophagus and reflux-related conditions in Brisbane, Australia, whose cases were residents of metropolitan Brisbane aged 18 to 79 with a new histologically confirmed diagnosis of Barrett's oesophagus, with or without dysplasia, between February 2003 and June 2006, identified through the pathology laboratories serving the city, and whose controls were people randomly selected from the Australian electoral roll and matched to the cases by age and sex, together with endoscopy patients whose biopsies showed only oesophageal inflammation consistent with reflux and no Barrett's oesophagus." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26090820", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22787114", IAO:0000119="PMID:16284367"}
synonym: "SDH" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
