id: coho:COHO_0002364
name: obsolete The Seoul CRC Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Seoul CRC Study is the Seoul colorectal cancer study of the Asia Colorectal Cancer Consortium, whose GWAS supplement heads its description with that name and the id Korea-Seoul (PMID:24836286). Replaced by COHO:0001979 (Seoul Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0001979

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002365
name: Shanghai Endometrial Cancer Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of endometrial cancer among Chinese women in urban Shanghai, China, conducted from 1997 to 2003, in which women aged 30-69 with newly diagnosed endometrial cancer, identified through the Shanghai Cancer Registry, and age frequency-matched controls randomly selected from the general population through the Shanghai Resident Registry were interviewed in person and gave blood or buccal cell samples, to study risk factors for endometrial cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:17301695", IAO:0000119="PMID:17315164", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.318/MediaObjects/41588_2009_BFng318_MOESM9_ESM.pdf"}
