[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002366
name: Severe Asthma Cohorts
def: "A collection of children and adults with severe or refractory asthma recruited through three specialist severe asthma clinics in England, the adult and paediatric clinics of the Royal Brompton Hospital, London, and the adult clinic of the Glenfield Hospital, Leicester, where they were characterised under the clinics' severe asthma protocols, assembled as the severe asthma group of the GABRIEL consortium's genome-wide association study of asthma." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20860503", IAO:0000119="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-017-0014-7/MediaObjects/41588_2017_14_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
