[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002374
name: SNP Health Association Asthma Resource Project
def: "A genome-wide genotyping project of the NHLBI SNP Health Association Resource (SHARe) that collects children and adults with asthma who took part in NHLBI asthma clinical trials: children of the Childhood Asthma Management Program and of trials of the Childhood Asthma Research and Education (CARE) network, most of them with their parents as parent-child trios, and adults of trials of the Asthma Clinical Research Network (ACRN), for genetic studies of asthma and of response to asthma treatment." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000166.v2.p1", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22792082"}
