[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002375
name: Stockholm Heart Epidemiology Program
def: "A population-based case-control study of risk factors for a first myocardial infarction, whose study base was all Swedish citizens aged 45–70 years without a previous myocardial infarction living in Stockholm County, Sweden, in 1992–1994: cases were identified through the coronary and intensive care units of the catchment-area hospitals, hospital discharge records and death certificates, controls were drawn at random from the study base matched on age, sex and hospital catchment area, and the patients were followed for recurrent cardiovascular events and mortality." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34551078", IAO:0000119="PMID:17108306"}
synonym: "SHEEP" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "SHEEP study" RELATED []
synonym: "Stockholm Heart epidemiology Program" RELATED []
