[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002387
name: South Korea Multi-Center Lung Cancer Study
def: "A South Korean multi-centre lung cancer study that brings together three previously described case-control studies of ethnic Koreans, the Seoul National University study, the Korea University Medical Center study and the Kyungpook National University Hospital study, which recruited lung cancer patients at university hospitals and a lung cancer research centre and controls from hospital health check-up programmes; it takes part in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia as one study." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28025329", IAO:0000119="PMID:23143601"}
synonym: "SKLCS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
