[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002389
name: Shenyang Lung Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer in never-smoking ethnic Chinese women in Shenyang, Liaoning Province, northeast China, whose cases had histologically confirmed lung cancer and whose controls were non-smoking women with other lung diseases but free of cancer, frequency-matched to the cases on age; it is one of the studies pooled in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20003391", IAO:0000119="PMID:23143601"}
