[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002408
name: Scottish Randomised Trial in Ovarian Cancer
def: "An international multicentre phase III randomised trial (SCOTROC1) of first-line docetaxel-carboplatin versus paclitaxel-carboplatin chemotherapy for stage Ic–IV epithelial ovarian or primary peritoneal cancer, coordinated through a clinical trials unit in Glasgow and recruiting patients in the United Kingdom, elsewhere in Europe, the United States and Australasia, whose patients were followed for progression-free and overall survival and whose DNA has been used in pharmacogenetic studies and in the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium's studies of ovarian cancer outcome." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:17925548", IAO:0000119="PMID:16314640", dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15547181", IAO:0000119="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3650102/"}
