relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Japan {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12358252/fullTextXML", comment="We, therefore, used data from the Suita Study, a population-based prospective cohort study investigating people residing in an urban city in Osaka, Japan, to explore this association."}
