id: coho:COHO_0002422
name: obsolete Swedish Bladder Cancer Study
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The PGS Catalog id SwBCS and its name, Swedish Bladder Cancer Study, are a transcription error for TWBCS, the Taiwanese Breast Cancer Study of the breast cancer GWAS the id comes from (PMID:22267197), which has no Swedish or bladder cancer study. The name is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0002474 (Taiwanese Breast Cancer Study), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0002474

