id: coho:COHO_0002434
name: Tampa Lung Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer run from Washington State University at the H. Lee Moffitt Cancer Center in Tampa, Florida, United States, whose cases were patients with histologically confirmed primary lung cancer identified at the centre in 1999–2002 and recruited within a year of diagnosis, and whose cancer-free controls, matched to cases on age, race and sex, were recruited at the centre's affiliated Lifetime Cancer Screening Center." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28604730", IAO:0000119="PMID:32393777"}
