id: coho:COHO_0002435
name: Finnish Genetic Predisposition to Prostate Cancer Study
def: "A population-based prostate cancer case–control study in Finland, run from Tampere, whose cases were identified through linkage to the Finnish Cancer Registry, patient records and the Finnish arm of the European Randomized Study of Screening for Prostate Cancer (ERSPC), and whose controls are ERSPC cohort participants without a cancer diagnosis; it contributes to the PRACTICAL consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33623038", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0142-8/MediaObjects/41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
