id: coho:COHO_0002441
name: Tampa Bay Ovarian Cancer Study
def: "A population-based case-control study of epithelial ovarian cancer run by the Moffitt Cancer Center in Tampa, Florida, United States, which since 2000 has recruited women newly diagnosed with ovarian cancer, through rapid case ascertainment in the two most populous counties of the Tampa Bay region, and control women, with data collected by interview." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36688720", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22891074", IAO:0000119="PMID:23047549"}
