[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002445
name: Tehran Cardiometabolic Genetic Study
def: "A family-based, population-based genetic cohort in Tehran, Iran, designed by the Research Institute for Endocrine Sciences in collaboration with deCODE genetics, that genotyped participants of the Tehran Lipid and Glucose Study genome-wide and links their genotypes to the behavioural, biochemical and clinical data collected since 1999, later extended to participants of four ongoing studies with periodic follow-up, to identify genetic factors in cardiometabolic risk factors, cancers and other non-communicable diseases." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:37169991", IAO:0000119="PMID:28232301"}
synonym: "TCGS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
