[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002459
name: Tianjin Lung Cancer Study
def: "A case–control study of lung cancer in Tianjin, China, whose cases were patients with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed primary non-small cell lung cancer at Tianjin Medical University Cancer Hospital, excluding those with a previous cancer or earlier radiotherapy or chemotherapy, and whose controls were people attending regular health check-ups in the same period who lived in the same or nearby neighbourhoods, frequency-matched to the cases on sex and age; all participants were ethnic Chinese. Its never-smoking women were genotyped genome-wide as one of the studies of the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23143601"}
