[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002461
name: Tasmanian Longitudinal Health Study
def: "A population-based cohort study of respiratory health that began in 1968 with a survey of the children born in 1961 who were attending school in Tasmania, Australia, and has followed these probands with repeated surveys and lung function testing from age 7 into their sixth decade, with their parents also surveyed." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:42480573", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19187325", IAO:0000119="PMID:41736738"}
