[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002462
name: Triple Negative Breast Cancer Consortium
def: "An international consortium of case-control, cohort, case-only and tumour-collection studies of breast cancer in the United States, Australia and Europe that pools women with triple-negative (estrogen receptor-, progesterone receptor- and HER2-negative) breast cancer and controls to study inherited susceptibility to triple-negative breast cancer, and that contributes its case series to the Breast Cancer Association Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29058716", IAO:0000119="PMID:21844186"}
