[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002468
name: obsolete University Health Network, Toronto, Canada
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-24. TOR is the PGS Catalog's id (PGS000030 evaluation, sample set PSS000041) for the PRACTICAL/OncoArray prostate cancer study that the Schumacher 2018 supplement lists only as 'Toronto': men undergoing prostate biopsy at the Princess Margaret Cancer Centre (University Health Network), Toronto, Canada, cases with positive biopsies and controls with negative biopsies, described as 'Prospective hospital-based biopsy cohort' (41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf, Supplementary Table 1). Its only design paper (PMID:24568896, Eur Urol 2014) calls it 'a large prostate biopsy cohort (in Toronto, Canada)'. The sample has no name of its own beyond the city and institution, so, like HZ and Poland, it is not a cohort. No COHO term or review row names a Toronto prostate biopsy cohort (checked coho_names.tsv and catalog_cohorts_review.tsv for Toronto, Princess Margaret, UHN). Found by a check of the placeholder names flagged as institutions or places against their sources, 2026-09-24.
is_obsolete: true

