comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The Tennessee Valley Healthcare System is a Veterans Affairs health-care system, an institution; no score in the PGS Catalog uses the id, and papers name it only as the setting of unrelated clinical studies. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
