id: coho:COHO_0002480
name: Dutch Bipolar Cohort
def: "A multicentre case-control study in the Netherlands, started in 2011 as a collaboration between the University of California Los Angeles and University Medical Center Utrecht with other Dutch mental health care institutes, that collects genetic and phenotypic information on patients with bipolar I disorder, their first-degree relatives and controls, recruited through clinicians, the Dutch bipolar disorder patients' association, pharmacies, advertisements and earlier research studies." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34821429", IAO:0000119="PMID:31748521"}
