id: coho:COHO_0002486
name: UFA Study
def: "A case-control study of asthma in the Volga-Ural region of Russia, in which patients with physician-diagnosed asthma and healthy controls matched on age and sex, of Russian, Tatar and Bashkir origin, were recruited at the Hospital of the Bashkir Medical State University and Ufa Municipal Hospital No. 21 between 1999 and 2007." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20860503", IAO:0000119="PMID:29273806"}
