id: coho:COHO_0002487
name: University of Florida Diabetes Institute Study Bank
def: "A cross-sectional collection of serum and genomic DNA from people with type 1 diabetes, their first- and second-degree relatives, islet autoantibody-positive at-risk individuals and unaffected controls, recruited from the general population and from outpatient clinics at the University of Florida in Gainesville, Nemours Children's Hospital in Orlando and Emory University in Atlanta, United States, and banked by the University of Florida Diabetes Institute for studies of type 1 diabetes genetic risk and biomarkers." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39755561", IAO:0000119="PMID:29540798"}
