id: coho:COHO_0002490
name: Utrecht Health Project
def: "A community-based prospective cohort study in Leidsche Rijn, a newly developed residential area of the city of Utrecht, the Netherlands, in which all new inhabitants are invited by their general practitioner to take part, receive a baseline individual health profile from research nurses, and are followed up through continuous linkage with the general practitioners' electronic medical records." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:15921047", IAO:0000119="PMID:16887835"}
