[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002496
name: UK Barrett's Oesophagus Gene Study
def: "A United Kingdom study, funded by a Medical Research Council programme grant, of people with Barrett's oesophagus identified at endoscopy with a histopathologically confirmed diagnosis of intestinal metaplasia and recruited across the UK excluding Northern Ireland, whose cases have been used in genetic association studies of Barrett's oesophagus and oesophageal adenocarcinoma." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:29551738", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24121790"}
