relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Italy {xref="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/instance/4106467/bin/NIHMS595180-supplement-000412_-_Supplemental_Material.pdf", comment="The HIFMECH study comprises Caucasian male survivors of a first MI aged <60 years (excluding patients with FH and insulin‐dependent diabetes mellitus) and population‐based individuals of the same age and region recruited from four centres in Europe: Stockholm, Sweden and London, England for the North and Marseille, France and San Giovanni Retondo, Italy representing the South"}
relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Portugal
