id: coho:COHO_0002504
name: UK Familial Ovarian Cancer Register
def: "A register of families in the United Kingdom in which at least two people have been diagnosed with ovarian cancer, begun in 1991 as the UKCCCR study of familial ovarian cancer and supported by Cancer Research UK and the University of Cambridge, which recruited until 2009 and collected medical information, family histories and, from some members, blood and tissue samples to study familial risk factors for ovarian cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19648919", IAO:0000119="https://web.archive.org/web/20230402084624/https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/about-cancer/find-a-clinical-trial/a-study-looking-at-family-history-and-ovarian-cancer"}
