[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002505
name: United Kingdom Graves' disease cohort
def: "The patients with Graves' disease of the United Kingdom's national DNA collection for autoimmune thyroid disease (the AITD National Collection), a multicentre collection of Caucasian patients with Graves' disease or Hashimoto's thyroiditis and their family members, recruited at hospitals across the United Kingdom with clinical and biochemical data collected prospectively under a common protocol and funded by the Wellcome Trust. Its Graves' disease patients have served as cases in genetic association studies of Graves' disease, analysed against British 1958 Birth Cohort controls." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:16968788", IAO:0000119="PMID:24586183", IAO:0000119="PMID:17952073"}
