[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002506
name: UK Genetic Prostate Cancer Study
def: "A multi-institutional, longitudinal observational study of prostate cancer in the United Kingdom, conducted through the Royal Marsden NHS Foundation Trust, that since 1992 has recruited men with histologically confirmed prostate cancer in a population-based arm and in arms enriched for young age at onset or a family history of the disease, together with cancer-free men from its clinics as controls, collecting baseline and follow-up clinical data to study inherited susceptibility to prostate cancer and its outcomes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:36493335", IAO:0000119="PMID:31089142", IAO:0000119="PMID:36528478"}
