id: coho:COHO_0002508
name: UK HumanCoreExome genotyped IBD study
def: "A genome-wide association study sample of the UK IBD Genetics Consortium, analysed in a 2017 genome-wide association study of inflammatory bowel disease: British patients with Crohn's disease, ulcerative colitis or unclassified inflammatory bowel disease, diagnosed by accepted endoscopic, histopathological and radiological criteria and genotyped on the Human Core Exome v12.1, with population controls from the Understanding Society project (the UK Household Longitudinal Study) genotyped on the Human Core Exome v12.0." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28067908"}
