id: coho:COHO_0002515
name: UK Testicular Cancer Collaboration
def: "The testicular germ cell tumour case series coordinated at the Institute of Cancer Research in the United Kingdom, drawn from a UK study of familial testicular cancer and a national collection of testicular germ cell tumour cases treated in the UK, whose cases were recruited over about 20 years through the UK Testicular Cancer Collaboration, a group of oncologists and surgeons treating the disease across the UK, and used in genome-wide association studies of testicular cancer susceptibility." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4846317/fullTextXML", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2635/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2635_MOESM33_ESM.pdf"}
