[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002516
name: obsolete Center of Excellence-Baden-Wuerttemberg Type 2 Diabetes Cohort
comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. The PGS Catalog id ULM is the Ulm prostate cancer case-control study of the PRACTICAL consortium (PMID:29892016, PMID:33623038). Every score that uses it is a cancer score, so the Catalog's name for it, Center of Excellence-Baden-Wuerttemberg Type 2 Diabetes Cohort, is wrong and is not carried over. Replaced by COHO:0002517 (Familial Prostate Cancer Study Ulm), which now carries this term's names. Found by a check of the placeholders against the papers the PGS Catalog links to them or found by their names, 2026-09-25.
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: coho:COHO_0002517

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002517
name: Familial Prostate Cancer Study Ulm
def: "A prostate cancer case-control study run by the Institute of Human Genetics and the Department of Urology of Ulm University Hospital, Germany. Familial cases were identified through family-history questionnaires sent by collaborating urologists throughout Germany, sporadic cases came from radical prostatectomy series at the Ulm urology clinic, and controls were men from Ulm without prostate cancer. It is used for linkage and association studies of inherited prostate cancer susceptibility and contributes to the PRACTICAL consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22457820", IAO:0000119="PMID:26387087", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0142-8/MediaObjects/41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
