id: coho:COHO_0002531
name: Utah Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia Study
def: "A case-control study of chronic lymphocytic leukaemia in Utah, United States, whose prevalent cases came from the Huntsman Cancer Hospital's haematology clinics or were identified in the Utah Cancer Registry and verified by medical records and pathology reports, and whose controls, from the same area, were frequency-matched to the cases by sex and birth cohort using the Utah Population Database; it was genotyped genome-wide for studies of genetic susceptibility to the disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fncomms10933/MediaObjects/41467_2016_BFncomms10933_MOESM1570_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:28165464"}
