[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002532
name: Utah/Sheffield Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia Collaborative Study
def: "A collaborative case-control study of chronic lymphocytic leukemia with sites in Utah, USA, and Sheffield, UK, whose prevalent cases came from the hematology clinics of the Huntsman Cancer Hospital and the Utah Cancer Registry, verified by medical records and pathology reports, and from National Health Service hospitals in the North Trent region of the UK, and whose controls were ascertained from the Utah Population Database; its cases and controls, genotyped at the University of Utah, were a replication series of the genome-wide association studies of chronic lymphocytic leukemia published in 2013 and 2016." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2652/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2652_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:26956414", IAO:0000119="PMID:23770605"}
synonym: "UTAH-SHEFFIELD" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "Utah-Sheffield" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
