comment: Obsoleted 2026-09-27. UVRIGPC is the MRC/UVRI General Population Cohort of Kyamulibwa, Uganda, as the lipids consortium's study table lists it (PMID:24097068). Replaced by COHO:0000345 (Uganda General Population Cohort), which now carries this term's names. Found by a search for the cohorts behind placeholder names with no known paper, 2026-09-27.
