[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002535
name: UWA, LEI & Flinders
def: "A combined age-related macular degeneration case-control sample contributed by the UWA, LEI & Flinders study group to the International AMD Genomics Consortium. Its participants were recruited from the population (UWA) and from ophthalmology clinics (LEI and Flinders), and AMD was graded with the international classification system." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3448/MediaObjects/41588_2016_BFng3448_MOESM1_ESM.pdf"}
