relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Italy {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8387688/fullTextXML", comment="During the initial phase of the SARS-CoV-2 pandemic, the Gardena valley, a well-known winter tourism destination located in South Tyrol (Italy), became one of the European regions most afflicted by the coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19)."}
