[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002538
name: Vantaa 85+ Study
def: "A population-based study of the oldest old in Finland that includes all people aged 85 years or over who were living in the city of Vantaa, in southern Finland, on 1 April 1991, whose dementia status was assessed at baseline and at three follow-ups in 1994–99 and who underwent general and neuropathological autopsy whenever possible; its genotyped participants have been used in genetic studies of Alzheimer disease and other neuropathology of very old age and as Finnish controls in genome-wide association studies." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:36510334", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:29379882", IAO:0000119="PMID:20522523", IAO:0000119="PMID:26401513", IAO:0000119="PMID:38938199", IAO:0000119="PMID:22911860"}
synonym: "Vantaa 85+" RELATED []
