[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002546
name: Verona Heart Study
def: "An ongoing regional study at the university hospital of Verona, Italy, of adults from the Verona district who underwent coronary angiography, comprising patients with angiographically documented coronary artery disease and coronary artery disease-free subjects angiographed for other reasons (mainly valvular heart disease), with cross-sectional and prospective designs, to search for new risk factors for coronary artery disease and myocardial infarction." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18253477", IAO:0000119="PMID:30646800"}
