property_value: coho:numberOfControls "213" xsd:integer {IAO:0000116="VHS patients with prospective data in the 2019 study", xref="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6497332/", comment="On the basis of an angiographic evaluation, the patients were classified as CAD‐free (n=213, individuals who underwent coronary angiography for reasons other than suspected CAD, primarily valvular heart disease) and patients with CAD (n=807 individuals with at least 1 of the major epicardial coronary arteries [left anterior descending, circumflex, and right] affected by ≥1 significant stenosis [≥50% lumen reduction])."}
