[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002551
name: Vobarno Study
def: "A population-based observational study of middle-aged residents of Vobarno, a small town between Brescia and Lake Garda in northern Italy, randomly selected from the electoral rolls and examined with clinic and 24-hour ambulatory blood pressure measurement, cardiac and carotid ultrasound, aortic stiffness and blood sampling for biochemistry and DNA extraction, to relate cardiac and vascular structure and function to blood pressure; participants were followed for about 25 years for cardiovascular morbidity and mortality." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:8621195", IAO:0000119="PMID:33988330"}
synonym: "Vobarno" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
instance_of: coho:COHO_0000000 ! cohort
