id: coho:COHO_0002553
name: Diabetes UK Warren 2 Repository
def: "A collection, funded by Diabetes UK, of people with type 2 diabetes and their relatives recruited from across the United Kingdom for genetic studies of type 2 diabetes, comprising probands of affected sibships (sib pairs), parent-offspring trios and duos, and a later collection of cases diagnosed at 35 to 65 years who were not selected for a family history of diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20459604", IAO:0000119="PMID:16753056", IAO:0000119="PMID:19672314"}
