[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002555
name: Western Australian HIV Cohort Study
def: "A prospective, single-centre, population-based observational study of the natural history of HIV disease among people with HIV attending the tertiary HIV service in Perth, Western Australia, whose clinical data, HIV sequences and host HLA and genome-wide genotypes have been used to study HIV immune escape, host genetic control of the virus, and prospective HLA-B*5701 screening to prevent abacavir hypersensitivity." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:7802978", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:19690614", IAO:0000119="PMID:16758424", IAO:0000119="PMID:22498169", IAO:0000119="PMID:24171102", IAO:0000119="PMID:9586648"}
