[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002560
name: Westlake Precision Birth Cohort
def: "An ongoing prospective cohort that since August 2019 has recruited pregnant women aged 18 years or older with gestational diabetes at 24–28 weeks' gestation from the Hangzhou Maternity and Child Health Care Hospital in Hangzhou, China, who intend to deliver there and to stay in Hangzhou with their children for at least four years; it was approved by the institutional review board of Westlake University and integrates multi-omics with precision nutrition research on gestational diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39699891"}
