[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002563
name: Wake Forest University Breast Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based breast cancer case-control study at Wake Forest University Health Sciences (Winston-Salem, North Carolina, United States) that from November 1998 enrolled women newly diagnosed with breast cancer, before any therapy, at the Wake Forest University Breast Care Center, and as controls, frequency-matched to cases on age and race, women with normal mammograms and no history of cancer from those attending routine mammography at its Breast Screening and Diagnostic Center; its African-American participants, recruited up to December 2008, were contributed to the African American Breast Cancer Consortium." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:18701435", IAO:0000119="PMID:21852243"}
