id: coho:COHO_0002579
name: West of Scotland Coronary Prevention Study
def: "A primary-prevention trial of men aged 45 to 64 with raised plasma cholesterol, recruited in Scotland and randomised to pravastatin or placebo to test whether lowering serum cholesterol reduces fatal and non-fatal myocardial infarction." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:1624967", IAO:0000119="PMID:7572679", dcterms:contributor="Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
