[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002581
name: Westphalian Stroke Register
def: "A regional hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to cooperating hospitals in Westphalia, north-west Germany, with departments of neurology, internal medicine and geriatric medicine taking part, which records a standardised data set of sociodemographic and clinical characteristics, diagnostic and treatment procedures, complications and status at discharge; its case ascertainment was part of the German Competence Net Stroke, and consecutive consenting ischaemic stroke patients recruited through it have been used in genetic studies of stroke." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:12721875", IAO:0000119="PMID:36786861", IAO:0000119="PMID:15685490", IAO:0000119="PMID:23041239"}
