id: coho:COHO_0002592
name: Zaragoza Bladder Cancer Study
def: "A hospital-based case–control study of urinary bladder cancer in Zaragoza, Spain, whose cases were patients with histologically proven urothelial cell carcinoma of the bladder recruited from the urology and oncology departments of Zaragoza Hospital from 2007 to 2009 and whose controls were individuals who had attended the University Hospital in Zaragoza for diseases other than cancer from 2001 to 2007." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:20972438", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:21750109"}
