id: coho:COHO_0002593
name: Zhejiang colorectal cancer set
def: "A Chinese genetic sample for colorectal neoplasia drawn from the population-based colorectal cancer screening programme of Jiashan County, Zhejiang Province, made up of a one-to-one matched case-control study conducted from 2015 to 2022 and a cross-sectional colonoscopy screening study performed in 2014, whose participants were genotyped on the Illumina Asian Screening Array." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:38872215"}
