[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002594
name: Nurses' Health Studies
def: "An umbrella of three prospective cohorts of nurses: the original Nurses' Health Study established in 1976, Nurses' Health Study II, and Nurses' Health Study 3, which is still enrolling nurses and nursing students in the United States or Canada; together they count more than 275,000 participants and are among the largest prospective investigations into the risk factors for major chronic diseases in women." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:40619433", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://nurseshealthstudy.org/about-nhs/history", IAO:0000119="https://nurseshealthstudy.org/about-nhs"}
