[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002598
name: Study on Transitions in Employment, Ability and Motivation
def: "A prospective cohort of persons aged 45 to 64 years in the Netherlands, stratified by age and employment status, followed from 2010 by the Netherlands Organisation for Applied Scientific Research TNO through online questionnaires on work characteristics, health, employment transitions, work ability and productivity, to study sustainable work participation of older workers; a second group was recruited in 2015." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:42615545", IAO:0000119="PMID:32414410"}
