[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002603
name: ENVIRonmental influence ON early AGEing
def: "A prospective, population-based birth cohort of mother–newborn pairs recruited at delivery since February 2010 at East-Limburg Hospital (Ziekenhuis Oost-Limburg) in Genk, in the province of Limburg, Belgium, with umbilical cord blood collected at birth and follow-up of the children at 4 to 6 years of age at Hasselt University, to study how environmental exposures in early life influence the biology of human ageing." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:41196593", IAO:0000119="https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/ENVIRONAGE", IAO:0000119="https://limburgsgeboortecohort.be/", IAO:0000119="PMID:41106326"}
