[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002612
name: Monitoring Project on Risk Factors for Chronic Diseases
def: "A population-based study of men and women aged 20–65 years drawn as random samples of the populations of Amsterdam, Maastricht and Doetinchem in the Netherlands, whose cardiovascular and other chronic disease risk factors were measured by the Municipal Health Services in 1993–1997 in a project supported by the Dutch Ministry of Health, Welfare and Sport and the National Institute for Public Health and the Environment, and who were followed for disease through linkage with national registers." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:22194890", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
