[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002613
name: Generation R Next Study
def: "A population-based prospective cohort in Rotterdam, the Netherlands, of women enrolled from August 2017 before conception or during pregnancy, with their partners and children, followed from preconception and fetal life onwards by the Generation R group at Erasmus MC to study the growth, development and health of a new generation of children and their parents." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://generationr.nl/next", IAO:0000119="https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/GenR%20Next", IAO:0000119="PMID:41762673", IAO:0000119="PMID:39915565"}
