[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002617
name: 1970 British Cohort Study
def: "A longitudinal birth cohort of the people born in England, Scotland and Wales in a single week of 1970, which began as the British Births Survey and has followed its members' health, physical, educational and social development and economic circumstances through childhood and adult life; it is managed by the Centre for Longitudinal Studies at University College London and core funded by the Economic and Social Research Council." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35849349", IAO:0000119="https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/BCS%201970"}
