[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002618
name: Study on the influence of Air pollution on Lung function, Inflammation and Ageing
def: "A population-based longitudinal cohort of women aged 55 years at recruitment from the industrialised Ruhr Area and rural areas north of it (Borken, Dülmen) in North Rhine-Westphalia, Germany, examined at baseline between 1985 and 1994 and followed up from 2006 onwards; initiated by the State Government of North Rhine-Westphalia to study the health effects of air pollution in women, and run by the IUF – Leibniz Research Institute for Environmental Medicine, Düsseldorf." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24645673"}
