[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002619
name: NoMa study
def: "The participants of an 8-week double-blind randomised controlled dietary intervention trial run from 2012 to 2014 by the University of Oslo and the Oslo and Akershus University College of Applied Sciences, Norway, in which adults with moderately elevated cholesterol ate commercial food items in which saturated fat had been replaced by polyunsaturated fat, or control items, to study effects on blood lipids, immune-cell gene expression and blood metabolites." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.med.uio.no/imb/english/research/projects/noma/", IAO:0000119="PMID:31051508"}
