[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002620
name: National Health and Nutrition Survey – HYDRIA
def: "A cross-sectional national health examination and nutrition survey of a representative sample of adults aged 18 years and over in Greece, drawn by two-stage stratified random sampling across all prefectures and examined between June 2013 and December 2014 by the Hellenic Health Foundation, following European Health Examination Survey and EFSA methodology, to describe the population's dietary intake, nutritional status and health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35334847"}
