[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002622
name: Piccolipiù birth cohort
def: "An Italian multicentre prospective birth cohort of newborns recruited from October 2011 to March 2015 in six maternity units in Florence, Rome, Trieste, Turin and Viareggio, with maternal blood, cord blood and other samples stored in a biobank at the Istituto Superiore di Sanità and follow-up by questionnaires through childhood, set up to study the effects of environmental exposures, parental conditions and social factors in pre- and early post-natal life on child health and development." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24506846", IAO:0000119="PMID:36191030"}
