[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002623
name: Foods for weight management
def: "The participants of a randomised controlled weight-management trial run from 2008 to 2010 by the Institute of Public Health and Clinical Nutrition, University of Kuopio (now University of Eastern Finland), Finland, in which adults aged 30–65 with obesity followed a very-low-energy diet and were then randomised to weight-maintenance diets containing foods of higher or lower predetermined satiety value, to study whether food satiety value affects self-regulation of food intake and weight management." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.isrctn.com/ISRCTN67529475", IAO:0000119="PMID:22792447"}
