[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002630
name: Generation XXI
def: "A prospective population-based birth cohort of infants born between April 2005 and August 2006 in all the public maternity units of the Porto Metropolitan Area, Portugal, and their families, set up at the University of Porto and followed through childhood and adolescence to study how pregnancy and early-life characteristics relate to later growth, health and risk of chronic disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:41874644", IAO:0000119="https://www.geracao21.com/en/project"}
