[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002631
name: Moli-sani Study
def: "A population-based cohort of men and women aged 35 years or more living in the Molise region of southern Italy, randomly sampled with their family members from the city registries of Molise towns and recruited between 2005 and 2010, examined at baseline with a biobank of their samples and followed by linkage to regional health and mortality registries and a recall examination, to study genetic and environmental risk factors for cardiovascular, cancer and neurodegenerative diseases." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.moli-sani.org/?page_id=423", IAO:0000119="PMID:39010980"}
