property_value: seeAlso https://www.moli-sani.org/

[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002632
name: Central European Longitudinal Studies of Parents and Children: The Next Generation
def: "A prospective birth cohort run by RECETOX at Masaryk University with University Hospital Brno, Czech Republic, which enrolled pregnant women from 2017 (after a 2015-2016 pilot) and follows them and their children from pregnancy through early childhood, collecting biological samples and questionnaires, to study exposome factors such as environment, lifestyle, nutrition, genetics and the gut microbiome behind chronic diseases and developmental disorders in children." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.celspac.cz/tng", IAO:0000119="PMID:39107353"}
