[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002633
name: Cypriot Children's Health and Environment Observatory
def: "The Cypriot site of the CHILDREN_FIRST multi-country prospective exposome cohort: children in the first grade of randomly selected public primary schools in Cyprus, recruited from October 2023 by the Cyprus University of Technology with the biobank of the University of Cyprus and assessed every year until the end of primary school with questionnaires, urine and saliva samples and home and school environmental measurements, to study how the exposome shapes early risk of cardiometabolic, neurodevelopmental and respiratory disease." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://web.cut.ac.cy/childrenfirstcy/about", IAO:0000119="PMID:42044183"}
