[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002634
name: Observation of Cardiovascular Risks and Health in Luxembourg
def: "A nationwide population-based study of adults living in the Grand Duchy of Luxembourg, run by the Luxembourg Institute of Health, whose first wave (2007-2009) examined a random sample of residents and whose second wave (2016-2018) re-examined them together with new participants from the civil registry, another national health examination survey and volunteers, with questionnaires, clinical measurements and blood, urine and hair samples, to describe the prevalence and evolution of cardiovascular risk factors." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:30717671", IAO:0000119="https://www.lih.lu/en/oriscav-lux/"}
