relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Spain {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7695147/fullTextXML", comment="The GENOBOX study was carried out in three hospitals from cities located in different Spanish areas: Hospital Clínico Universitario de Santiago (Santiago de Compostela), Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa (Zaragoza), and Hospital Universitario Reina Sofía (Córdoba)."}
