[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002654
name: Sustainable plant protection transition: a global health approach
def: "A cross-sectional field study of the EU Horizon 2020 SPRINT project in which, during the 2021 growing season, conventional and organic farmers and their families, neighbours living next to or near agricultural fields, and consumers living farther away were recruited at ten case study sites in Europe and one in Argentina, and gave urine, blood, faeces and nasal swabs and wore silicone wristbands (with indoor dust sampled in their homes), to measure their exposure to pesticide mixtures for exposure modelling and health risk assessment." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119=" https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/SPRINT", IAO:0000119="PMID:34780516 "}
