[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002656
name: Survey on Health, Well-Being, and Aging in Colombia
def: "A population-based cross-sectional national survey of community-dwelling adults aged 60 years and over in urban and rural areas of Colombia, carried out in 2015 for the Colombian Ministry of Health and Social Protection by the University of Caldas and the Universidad del Valle with the design of the Latin American and Caribbean Survey on Health, Well-Being, and Aging (SABE), to study health, active ageing and the social determinants of health inequities in older people." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:27956896", IAO:0000119="PMID:31607769"}
