id: coho:COHO_0002657
name: Encuesta Nacional de Situación Nutricional
def: "A repeated nationally representative cross-sectional household survey of the nutritional situation of the population of Colombia, conducted by the Colombian Institute for Family Welfare (ICBF) with the Ministry of Health in 2005, 2010 and 2015, covering people aged 0 to 64 years and pregnant women, that measures nutritional status, dietary intake, food security, breastfeeding and physical activity to inform public food and nutrition policy." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:35070447", IAO:0000119="https://www.icbf.gov.co/bienestar/nutricion/encuesta-nacional-situacion-nutricional"}
