[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002660
name: Banco Nacional de Tumores Terry Fox
def: "The donors of the Terry Fox National Tumour Bank, the biobank of the Instituto Nacional de Cancerología in Bogotá, Colombia: people with cancer, people without cancer and cancer survivors who gave informed consent, answered an epidemiological questionnaire on clinical, sociodemographic, risk-factor, family cancer and lifestyle information, and donated blood and, at surgery, tumour and adjacent non-tumour tissue, stored for health research with an emphasis on cancer." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://molgeniscatalogue.org/Global%20Exposome%20Cohorts/collections/BNTTF", IAO:0000119="PMID:39264897", IAO:0000119="PMID:40065011"}
