[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002661
name: China Health and Retirement Longitudinal Study
def: "A nationally representative longitudinal survey of community-dwelling people aged 45 years and older in China and their spouses, run from the National School of Development of Peking University, with a 2008 pilot in two provinces and a national baseline in 2011-2012 drawn by multistage probability sampling from 150 counties in 28 provinces, followed up every two years and harmonised with the Health and Retirement Study, to study the health, social and economic consequences of population ageing." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23243115"}
subset: coho1:GEC_subset
synonym: "CHARLS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
