relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A36893367+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core", comment="The study team (researchers from Imperial College London and its logistics partner Ipsos) wrote to named individuals aged 5 years and older in random cross-sections of the population of England, using the National Health Service list of patients registered with a general practitioner (near-universal coverage) as a sampling frame."}
