[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002670
name: Primeiros Laços
def: "The participants of a randomised controlled trial run by the University of São Paulo Medical School from 2015 of Primeiros Laços, a nurse home visiting programme from early pregnancy to the child's age of two years, in low-income first-time pregnant adolescents aged 14-19 recruited through primary healthcare units in the western region of São Paulo, Brazil, and their children, followed to test the programme's effects on child development, maternal and home environment outcomes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:34257407"}
