[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002672
name: Norwegian Family Based Life Course Study
def: "A register-based cohort of everyone in Norway who took part in the national censuses from 1960 to 2001, in which family members are linked through personal identity numbers and household and family information from the 1960 census and further linked to health registers and surveys, for multigenerational life-course research in public health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:22735991"}
