[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002676
name: Prospective Epidemiological Research Studies in Iran
def: "An ongoing nationwide population-based prospective cohort of adults aged 35–70 years living in 18 regions of Iran chosen to cover its ethnic, environmental and socioeconomic diversity, enrolled since 2014 through a network of Iranian medical universities coordinated by the Digestive Diseases Research Institute of Tehran University of Medical Sciences, with a biobank, to study environmental, lifestyle and genetic determinants of non-communicable diseases." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://persiancohort.com/", IAO:0000119="PMID:41286709"}
