[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002677
name: Generation Victoria
def: "A whole-population birth and parent cohort open to all children born in the state of Victoria, Australia, between October 2021 and October 2023 and their parents, recruited from December 2020 (an Advance Cohort, then newborns at Victorian maternity services and later remote and ongoing enrolment) and led from the Murdoch Children's Research Institute, which combines linked administrative and clinical data, biosamples and phenotypic waves as a platform for discovery and intervention research on child and adult health." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39754130", IAO:0000119="PMID:41844214"}
