[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002681
name: HUNT4 70+
def: "A sub-study of the fourth wave (HUNT4, 2017–2019) of the Trøndelag Health Study in which all inhabitants aged 70 years and older in the northern Trøndelag region of Norway were invited to detailed assessments of cognition and health, used to study the prevalence and incidence of dementia and mild cognitive impairment." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:40879407"}
subset: coho1:IHCC_subset
