[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002689
name: Kilifi Health and Demographic Surveillance System
def: "A population cohort of the residents of a defined area around Kilifi on the Indian Ocean coast of Kenya, established in 2000 by the KEMRI-Wellcome Trust Research Programme with a census and followed by regular household visits recording births, pregnancies, migrations and deaths, with residents' admissions to Kilifi District Hospital linked to the population register, to measure the incidence of local diseases, evaluate community interventions against infectious diseases and provide a sampling frame for epidemiological studies." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:22544844", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
subset: coho1:IHCC_subset
