id: coho:COHO_0002690
name: Cancer Prevention Study II Nutrition Cohort
def: "A subset of the Cancer Prevention Study II participants, men and women living in 21 US states, enrolled by the American Cancer Society through a mailed questionnaire in 1992–1993 and followed by biennial questionnaires, medical records and registry linkage for incident cancer and death, with blood samples from a subgroup, to study diet and other lifestyle factors and exposures in relation to cancer risk, mortality and survival." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:12015775", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33803340"}
