[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002692
name: Japan Public Health Center-based Prospective Study for the Next Generation
def: "A population-based prospective cohort of residents aged 40 to 74 years of 16 municipalities in seven prefectural areas of Japan, enrolled from 2011 to 2016 through a central office at the National Cancer Center and regional public health centres and universities as the successor to the Japan Public Health Center-based Prospective Study, with questionnaires and blood and urine samples, to identify risk factors for lifestyle-related diseases and factors that extend healthy life expectancy." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:30713262", dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
