[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002695
name: LifeGene
def: "A population-based prospective cohort study and research infrastructure in Sweden, run from Karolinska Institutet, that from 2009 to 2016 recruited adults from the general population, mainly in the Stockholm region, with index persons aged 18 to 45 years invited to bring their household members, and collected questionnaires, physical assessments and biological samples with planned repeated follow-up, to study diseases with onset early in life, pregnancy and early-life exposures, and later co-morbidity." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:39934197", IAO:0000119="PMID:21104112"}
