relationship: coho:has_data_collection_location http://dbpedia.org/resource/Finland {xref="https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13092225/fullTextXML", comment="The STRIP study enrolled children and their families who were recruited at well‐baby clinics at their routine 5‐month visit between December 1, 1989, and May 30, 1992 in the city of Turku, Finland. The children constituted a representative sample of 5‐month‐old children in the area. A total of 1062 7‐month‐old infants and their parents were enrolled in the trial."}
