[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002704
name: Identification of a risk profile to guide atrial fibrillation therapy
def: "A prospective, observational hospital-based cohort of adults with recent-onset paroxysmal or persistent atrial fibrillation for whom a rhythm-control strategy was preferred, conducted at the University Medical Center Groningen and Maastricht University Medical Center in the Netherlands between 2011 and 2016, with detailed cardiovascular phenotyping and serial rhythm monitoring to identify markers of atrial remodelling and atrial fibrillation progression and guide therapy." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:35281756", dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0133-9/MediaObjects/41588_2018_133_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", IAO:0000119="PMID:41756112"}
