[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002709
name: Hwasun Cancer Epidemiology Study
def: "A hospital-based case-control study of multiple cancers in South Korea, with disease-specific series including breast and colorectal cancer at Chonnam National University Hwasun Hospital in Jeollanam-do province. It recruits newly diagnosed cancer patients and community controls to investigate factors in cancer development and clinical progression; its disease-specific series use interview and medical-record information and blood samples." [] {dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:32139696", IAO:0000119="PMID:20504332", IAO:0000119="PMID:24836286"}
