[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002710
name: Stockholm-1
def: "A cohort of men aged 80 or younger who underwent prostate biopsy in Stockholm, Sweden, between 2005 and 2007, identified through pathology-department registries and excluding men with known prostate cancer before 2005. Participants provided blood samples and questionnaire information, with historical prostate-specific antigen measurements and cancer diagnoses, stage and grade obtained through laboratory and cancer-registry linkage, to investigate inherited susceptibility and improve prostate cancer risk prediction." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21295399", IAO:0000119="PMID:23535732", dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09"}
