id: coho:COHO_0002714
name: HD10 trial
def: "A randomized multicentre trial cohort of patients aged 16–75 years with newly diagnosed, biopsy-proven, early-stage Hodgkin lymphoma without adverse risk factors, assembled by the German Hodgkin Study Group to compare two or four cycles of ABVD chemotherapy followed by involved-field radiotherapy at 20 or 30 Gy." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:23321510", dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20818855"}
synonym: "HD10" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
