[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002716
name: HD12 trial
def: "A randomized multicentre trial cohort of patients aged 16–65 years with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed, advanced-stage Hodgkin lymphoma, enrolled by the German Hodgkin Study Group from January 1999 to January 2003 to compare eight cycles of escalated-dose BEACOPP with four escalated-dose followed by four baseline-dose cycles, and to compare consolidation radiotherapy with no radiotherapy for initial bulky or residual disease." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:21990399", IAO:0000119="PMID:23321510", IAO:0000119="PMID:30290903", dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09"}
