id: coho:COHO_0002719
name: European Network for Genetic And Genomic Epidemiology
def: "A European research consortium that provides infrastructure to combine large population study samples and datasets across populations of European origin for genetic and genomic epidemiology, conducting genome-wide association meta-analyses of complex traits, including serum lipid levels and smoking behavior, using data from participating population cohorts, twin cohorts and clinical collections." [] {dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:20418888", IAO:0000119="PMID:19060911", IAO:0000119="PMID:30887376"}
