[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002720
name: Genetic Epidemiology of Glioma International Consortium
def: "An international consortium that studies inherited susceptibility to glioma through a familial glioma study and the Glioma International Case-Control Study. It recruits families affected by multiple gliomas and coordinates multisite case-control recruitment, questionnaire data and biospecimen collection to investigate genetic risk and gene-environment interactions." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:26656478", IAO:0000119="PMID:23290425", dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:17855690"}
