[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002722
name: BRCA1 and BRCA2 Cohort Consortium
def: "An international consortium that harmonizes risk-factor and prospective follow-up data on women carrying pathogenic BRCA1 or BRCA2 variants from the International BRCA1/2 Carrier Cohort Study, Breast Cancer Family Registry and kConFab. Participants are drawn from clinical genetics and population-based family studies to estimate breast, ovarian and contralateral breast cancer risks and investigate their genetic and non-genetic modifiers." [] {IAO:0000119="PMID:32665703", IAO:0000119="PMID:31792088", dcterms:contributor="GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:28632866"}
