[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002728
name: CRYOSTEM
def: "A French national cohort of haematopoietic stem cell transplant recipients, and for some of them their donors, sampled before transplantation, at 100 days, one and two years afterwards and when graft-versus-host disease occurred, to study the complications of haematopoietic stem cell transplantation." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://www.cryostem.org/en/about-cryostem/", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
