[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002732
name: FLAVonoids: University of Reading Study
def: "A single-blind, parallel, randomised controlled dietary intervention trial in which men and women with low fruit and vegetable intake and at least a 1.5-fold increased risk of cardiovascular disease were assigned to high-flavonoid or low-flavonoid fruit and vegetables or to their habitual diet, to measure the dose-response relation with vascular function and other cardiovascular risk indicators." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:24452238"}
