def: "A cross-sectional study at the Human Nutrition Unit of the University of Auckland, New Zealand, of Asian Chinese and European Caucasian adults aged 20 to 70 years across a wide range of body mass index, normoglycaemic or prediabetic, studying the greater susceptibility of Asian Chinese to visceral adiposity and type 2 diabetes." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:33292338"}
