[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002745
name: The Effect of Dietary Bioactives on Gut Microbiome Diversity
def: "A randomised crossover pilot trial in which healthy adults ate two-week diets high or low in plant bioactives, with matched total fibre and separated by a four-week washout, to assess changes in the gut microbiome and in urinary and faecal metabolites." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.10.16.25338140", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
