[Instance]
id: coho:COHO_0002751
name: Mediterranean PHIME cohort
def: "A prospective cohort of mother-infant pairs recruited in the coastal Province of Trieste, Italy, in Ljubljana, Slovenia, in Rijeka, Croatia, and on Greek islands, set up within the PHIME project (2006 to 2011) to investigate the effects of prenatal low-level mercury exposure from maternal fish and seafood consumption on child neurodevelopment." [] {dcterms:contributor="Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09", IAO:0000119="PMID:23269124", dcterms:contributor="Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09"}
